<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Mbula</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Cau amsǝban a ne mala Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cau amsǝban a nê mala</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Mǝncau</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Cau Amsǝban a nê mala Luka</char> ka lǝmdǝí ama Yesu ka nda Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana à pacau ace aban amǝ Isǝrayila ka, sǝ ɗǝm ngga nda Mǝ'amsǝban mala ɓwapǝndǝa kat. <char style="bk">Luka</char> gilǝa ama Yesu ka Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli tunǝi ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ &lt;&lt;yiu nǝ Cau Amsǝban aban amǝ'tǝ̀r.&gt;&gt; Lǝmdǝa mala banɓoarnado ka à sǝni pepè aɓa <char style="bk">Luka</char>, nggeamurǝmi ka aɓalǝ akùré mǝdǝmbe mǝnana à hamnǝ yiu mala Yesu, sǝ ɗǝm ngga aban ká masǝlǝate, aban mǝnana Yesu nyarni aban o a kùli ka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aban nda kam ɓari (kùré 1--2 andǝ 9--19) mǝnana aɓalǝia ka, gir nakam kpǝm mana she àkǝ̀ ɓá mǝnia yì Cau Amsǝban ngga sǝ à nǝ̀ kumia; amǝno yì agir ka à nda ka nggyal mala amǝturonjar, andǝ yiu mala ayálgír a sǝn Yesu mana à loa ɓǝlle ka, andǝ Yesu aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli a muntulo, andǝ akanicau mala Ɓwa mǝɓoarne ɓwa Samariya, andǝ mala Muna-ɓwabura mǝnana ɓwàr ka. Aɓalǝ aban aɓa yì Cau Amsǝban ngga, cau cam nǝ rǝcandǝa amur hiwi, andǝ Bangŋo Mǝfele, andǝ banì mala amamǝna aɓa túró mala Yesu, andǝ twalbani mala Ɓakuli ace acauɓikea.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agir mǝnana a ɓālǝi ka</para>
  <para style="io1">Mǝncau<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ɓǝlban andǝ lo mala Yohana Mǝbatisǝma andǝ mala Yesu<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5--2:52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Túró mala Yohana Mǝbatisǝma mana Ɓakuli tunǝi ace ka<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Batisǝma andǝ kārǝkiban mala Yesu<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21--4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Túró mala Yesu mana Ɓakuli tunǝi ace ka aban aɓwana<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14--9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Twal a Galili aban ká a Urǝshalima<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51--19:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masǝlǝata limo a doɓanza mala Yesu aɓa Urǝshalima andǝ aban mǝnana à kàrì ka<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28--23:56</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lo ɓembe mala Mǝtalabangŋo, lǝmdǝrǝu male, andǝ eauwe male aban ká a kùli<char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Tita cau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Aɓwana pas twalî ɓamuria à nǝ̀ gilǝ cau amur agir mǝnana Ɓakuli pea aɓalǝ sǝm ngga. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Cau mǝnana à gilǝ ka nda kǝ̀ mǝnana à oe a kún aɓwana mǝnana à sǝn agirnì nǝ mǝsǝia a nggea dǝmbe, sǝ à hamnǝ cê ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ace mani ka, we Ɓwamǝgule Tiyofulus, ǝn bǝl atǝ́r acê pepe, sǝ ǝn sǝni ka ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ ǝn gilǝo wia kǝla mǝnana à kwaɗi rǝia ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Ən pak mǝnia ka ace mǝnana wu súrǝ̀ mǝsǝcau mala agir mǝnana à kanio ka.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝturonjar bangcau amur <optbreak /> ɓǝl Yohana Mǝbatisǝma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />A do'nza mala Hirǝdus, murǝm mala bu-nzali Yahudi ka, ɓè pǝris nakam lùllǝì ama Zakariya a buì mala Abija. Māmí ka lùllǝì ama Alisabatu; yì gbal ka nda a tàu mala Haruna. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Yia kǝm ngga amǝ'ɓealɓoarna na aɓadǝm Ɓakuli. À kǝ kpata anzongcau andǝ angguracau mala Mǝtalabangŋo, à eare ama à nǝ̀ ɓwarkio a kǝɓè ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Sǝ yia ka ko à pànǝ muna ɗang, acemǝnana Alisabatu ka nkombi na, sǝ yia kǝm ngga à ena.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />A ɓè pwari mwashat Zakariya nda ban pak túró male mala Pǝris aɓadǝm Ɓakuli, aɓalǝ anonggio mǝnana tàu malea ndanǝ túró ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />A kàné mala kúncau mala túró pǝris ka, Zakariya nda ɓwa mana twalban kpa amurí nǝ̀ kutio aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli nǝ̀ pisǝ muku-gìr mala loasǝ yele mǝ'rǝmɓoarne, ace paɓoro aban Ɓakuli ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Lang pwari loasǝ yele mǝ'rǝmɓoarne ace paɓoro aban Ɓakuli kārǝ́na ka, ɓwapǝndǝa ramba a nza aban pak hiwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Mǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli yi pusǝrǝi a baní, cam nǝ bù-mǝlì mala <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-10">Pur 30:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 40:26">40:26</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 40:27">27</ref></char>.</note>gyangŋan mala myang-loasǝ-yele mǝ'rǝmɓoarne. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Lang Zakariya loasǝ mǝsǝì sǝni ka, ɓangciu pakki wi, yàl hǝrkit. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Pǝlǝa mǝturonjar ne wi ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 1:13">&lt;&lt;Zakariya, ce a ɓang ɗàng! Ahiwi mò ka Ɓakuli ongŋǝnia, māmó Alisabatu nǝ̀ ɓǝ̀lô muna sǝ awu nǝ pè wi lullǝu ama Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Bumo nǝ̀ pwasǝo, a nǝ dum nǝ banɓoarnado, sǝ aɓwana pas ka bumia nǝ̀ pakkiɗire ace ɓǝle. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Mǝnia yì muna ka, nǝ̀ duk ɓwamǝgule a ɓadǝm Mǝtalabangŋo. Ɓǝ̀ kǝa nu mba ko ɓè kǝgìr mǝnana nǝ̀ walban ngga ɗàng. Yì ka, nǝ̀ lùmsǝ nǝ Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli, a bum ngge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Ɓal 6:3</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nǝ̀ tsǝk amǝ Isǝrayila pas à nǝ̀ nyare aban Mǝtalabangŋo Ɓakuli malea. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nǝ̀ akì Mǝtalabangŋo dǝmba, nǝ̀ pak túró aɓa bangŋo andǝ rǝcandǝa, ulang mala Iliya mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli. Nǝ̀ yinǝ dotarǝu mala atárrú andǝ amunia. Nǝ̀ nyesǝ amǝ'mgbikiru ɓǝà kum sǝlǝe mala amǝ ɓealɓoarna, ace tsǝk aɓwana ɓǝà gilǝrǝia ace yiu mala Mǝtalabangŋo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Pǝlǝa Zakariya ɗì mǝturonjar ama, &lt;&lt;Lang sǝ mǝ nǝ sǝlǝ ama gìr mǝnana a bang ngga anggo sǝ nǝ̀ pa? Acemǝnana mim ngga ǝn ena, sǝ māmám gbal ka ena.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mǝturonjar eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda Jibǝrayilu mǝnana camgiyi a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli ka. Ɓakuli tasǝam ɓǝ̀ ǝn yi banggo mǝnia yì cau mǝɓoarne ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Sǝ ado ka, acemǝnana a earnǝ cau mem raka, mǝnana nǝ̀ yia duk mǝsǝcau a pwari male ka, kuno girna; a pà wu nǝ nacau ɗàng, she pwari mǝnana amǝnia yì agir dumǝna mǝsǝia ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Anggo ka, ɓwapǝndǝa nda arǝ kundǝ Zakariya, à kǝ ndali, lang sǝ banì sauwa anggo kǝ̀rkǝ́r aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Lang purna ka, gandǝ nea wia cau ɗàng. Kara à sǝlǝ ama sǝnǝna gìr aɓa bangŋo, aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli. Acemǝnana camarǝ lǝmdǝkia wia cau nǝ bui, sǝ ko gandǝ mǝn kúni na kǝ cau ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Lang anonggio mala túró mala Zakariya malǝna ka, pǝlǝa nyare a ɓala. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Anzǝm man ngga māmí Alisabatu kum muna a bumi. Zongŋo tongno ko sǝn nza ɗàng, kǝ na ama, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />&lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo nǝ̀ pakkam mǝnia ka. Aɓalǝ anonggio man ngga lǝ́mdǝ́nàm ɓwamuru male, sǝ twalǝ́nàmban kǝsǝkya aɓalǝ aɓwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝturonjar bang cau mala ɓǝl Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Aɓa tongno-nong-mwashatia zongŋo mala kum muna-bum mala Alisabatu ka, Ɓakuli túr mǝturonjar Jibǝrayilu a ɓè là aɓa nzali Galili mǝnana à tunǝki ama, Nazarat ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Turi nǝ cau aban ɓè nsari lùllǝì ama Maryamu, mǝnana ɓeɓwa lùllǝì ama Yisǝfu, Mǝkà Dauda pur amurí nǝ̀ ali ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mat 1:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mǝturonjar kutia bani ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ rǝo pwalo! We mǝnana a ndanǝ ɓwamuru mala Ɓakuli ka, Mǝtalabangŋo na to.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mǝnia yì cau mǝturonjar ne ka, pè Maryamu ɗenyicau kǝ̀rkǝ́r, kara kutia ndali ama, ya ulang makkun nda man. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Pǝlǝa mǝturonjar ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Maryamu, ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakko ɗàng, a kumǝna earmúrú aban Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Awu nǝ kum muna a bumo, a nǝ ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura, sǝ a nǝ tsǝki wi lullǝu ama Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nǝ̀ duk ɓwamǝgule, sǝ à nǝ̀ tunǝi ama Muna mala Ɓakuli mana Karban nǝ Gulo kat ka. Mǝtalabangŋo Ɓakuli nǝ̀ pe wi buno-murǝm mala kè Dauda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isha 9:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nǝ̀ duk gbani amur amǝ Isǝrayila tàtǝ́k, sǝ domurǝm male ka masǝlǝate pà kàm ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isha 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Pǝlǝa Maryamu ne mǝturonjar ama, &lt;&lt;Lang sǝ mǝnia ka nǝ̀ pǎ, yi mǝnana mǝ nda nsari, ǝn súrǝ̀ ɓwabura raka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mǝturonjar eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli nǝ̀ sulǝo amuro. Rǝcandǝa mala Ɓakuli mana Karban nǝ Gulo kat ka, nǝ̀ yia zuppi amuro, sǝ Muna Mǝfele mǝnana a nǝ ɓǝli ka, à nǝ̀ tunǝi ama, Muna mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nggearǝ ɓǝla mô Alisabatu ka, ndanǝ muna a bumi aɓa ě male. Yì mǝnana nkombi na ka, gongŋǝna nǝ azongŋo tongno-nong-mwashat. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kǝgìr pà kàm mǝnana Ɓakuli pa nǝ̀ pè raka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Tite 18:14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maryamu eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda guro mala Mǝtalabangŋo. Ɓǝ̀ ce do kǝla mǝnana a na ka.&gt;&gt; Mǝturonjar pǝlǝa o ɗeki.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryamu waria sǝn Alisabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Anzǝm anonggio bǝti ka Maryamu lo tsuk-tsuk aban o a ɓè là a bu-nzali múr ankono mala nzali Yahudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Kya kutio a ɓala mala Zakariya, pǝlǝa makki Alisabatu kun. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Lang Alisabatu ok makkun mala Maryamu ka, muna mǝnana a bumi ka yàl hǝrkit, sǝ Alisabatu lùmsǝ nǝ Bangŋo Mǝfele. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Sǝ loasǝ gi kǝ̀rkǝ́r, banɓoarnado tsǝì na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 1:42">&lt;&lt;A ndanǝ tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli aɓalǝ amamǝna, sǝ muna mǝnana a nǝ ɓǝl ka, ndanǝ tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli gbal! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Lang sǝ múrɓoarna mem yipàm anggo, yi mǝnana nggeau mala Mǝtalem yiu a banam ngga? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Lang ǝn ok makkun mô ka, muna mǝnana a bumam ngga yàl nǝ banɓoarnado. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />A ndanǝ tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli, ace eare mǝnana a ear ama, cau mala Mǝtalabangŋo a bano ka, nǝ̀ yia lumsǝo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nggyal mala Maryamu <optbreak /> mala ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maryamu na ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:46-55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Sam 2:1-10</ref></char>.</note>Yilǝmem ngga kǝ ɓwangsǝki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:46">Mǝtalabangŋo;<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />sǝ ɓabumam kǝ pak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">banɓoarnado atàcau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">mala Ɓakuli Mǝ'amsǝam,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />acemǝnana yì ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ɗenyina nǝ mim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">guro male</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">kat andǝ amani ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ǝn pa a kun kǝgìr raka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Twal ado aban o a dǝmba ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">aɓwana arǝ anza kat</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">à nǝ̀ tunǝam ama mǝ'kúm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Acemǝnana Ɓakuli mana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Karban kat ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">pàngŋǝ́nàm agir mǝgulke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Lùllǝì ka nda Ɓwa Mǝfele.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kǝ lǝmdǝ mǝsǝswatǝr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">male aban aɓwana mǝnana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">à kǝ ɓanggi wi ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">twal a do'nza aban ká ɓè.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Pangŋǝna atúró mǝgulke nǝ murbui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">sǝ mesǝkina amǝ gusǝlǝ-múrû</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">andǝ aɗenyicau malea kat.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Yi sulǝna amurǝma amur</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">abuno-murǝm malea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">sǝ loasǝna amǝ nyesǝmúrû.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Ayu 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Amǝ'nzala ka ɗǝmsǝnia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">nǝ agir mǝɓoarne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">sǝ amǝkume ka tasǝna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">takwaria ɓǝà o nǝ ɓabuia.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Bwalǝni guro male Isǝrayila kàm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">aɓa ɗenyinǝ mǝsǝswatǝr male,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />kǝla mǝnana pàcau aban aká sǝm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">a Ibǝrayim andǝ amǝkè,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">málá male pà kàm ɗàng!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Tite 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:20">Mik 7:20</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maryamu do atà Alisabatu zongŋo tàrú, nda sǝ nyarǝna umna a là ka.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">À ɓǝl Yohana mǝ Batisǝma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Lang pwari gbáshí muna mala Alisabatu kārǝ́na ka, yi ɓǝl muna-ɓwabura. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Aɓi amǝkunɓala, andǝ aɓǝla ok ama, Mǝtalabangŋo lǝmdǝni Alisabatu ɓwamuru mǝgule, ɓǝlna muna ka, à yì bwalì wi pàk banɓoarnado.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />A tongno-nong-tàruià nongŋo ka, à yiu ace kasǝî muna ɓate.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kasǝî muna ɓate: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝnia ka nda lǝmdǝ ama muna ka dumǝna mala Ɓakuli.</char></note> À earce ama à nǝ̀ tsǝki wi lullǝ tárrí Zakariya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Pǝris 12:3</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Sǝ nggè kasǝa ama, &lt;&lt;Awo, ɓǝà tunǝi ama, Yohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Sǝ à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝɓwa pà kàm aɓalǝ aɓǝla ma'wun nǝ mǝna yì lullǝu ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Pǝlǝa à ne tár muna cau nǝ bu, ɓǝ̀ na koya lullǝu na nǝ̀ tunǝna muna nǝi. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sǝ zǝmba ama, ɓǝà yinǝi wi nǝ kpamgbang gilǝgir. Koyan ngga ndali, mǝnana gilǝ ama &lt;&lt;Lùllǝì nda Yohana&gt;&gt; ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Anggo ka, kara kún Zakariya mǝnna, lasǝi panzǝa, pǝlǝa tita nacau, kǝ ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Amǝkunɓala kat ka múrià kàrria. Sǝ aɓwana mǝnana arǝ alá a bu-nzali múr ankono mala nzali Yahudi ka, à camarǝ naki cau mala amǝnia yì agir ka. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Ɓwa mǝnana kat ok ce ka, ndali sǝ ɗiban a ɗenyicau male ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia yì muna ka, nǝ̀ yia duk ya ulangni nani? Acemǝnana bu Ɓakuli na muri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariya ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariya, yì tár Yohana ka lùmsǝ nǝ Bangŋo Mǝfele. Pǝlǝa ɓangnǝa, bangcau mala Ɓakuli, ama:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />Nokiban ngga dumǝna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">mala Mǝtalabangŋo Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">mala amǝ Isǝrayila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Acemǝnana yina ace bwalì</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">aɓwana male kàm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">sǝ angŋǝna múrià,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">pusǝnia a gung.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Yi pa sǝm Mǝ'amsǝban</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">mǝnana ndanǝ rǝcandǝa ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">a tau-murǝm mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">guro male Dauda.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Pè kǝla mǝnana bang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">a kún amǝ'ɓangnǝa male</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">mǝfele ɓara-ɓara ka.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Pe anggo ace mǝnana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ɓǝ̀ amsǝ sǝm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">a bu aɓisǝm amǝbura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">andǝ aɓwana mǝnana kat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">à ɓinǝmǝsǝ sǝm ngga.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Pàk mǝnia ka ace lǝmdǝì</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">atár sǝm mǝsǝswatǝr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɗenyinǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">kùrcau male mǝfele.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74" />Nǝ mǝnia yì kùrcau ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">kánbi tár sǝm Ibǝrayim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:73-74">ama nǝ̀ amsǝ sǝm a bu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:73-74">aɓisǝm amǝbura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm pak túró</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:73-74">male nǝ mǝsǝkang-kangŋa,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />aɓa do mǝfele</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">andǝ ɓealɓoarna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">a ɓadǝmbi a do yilǝmu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">ma'sǝm kat.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Sǝ we munem ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">à nǝ̀ tunǝo ama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">mana Karban nǝ Gulo kat ka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Awu nǝ akì Mǝtalabangŋo dǝmba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">ace gilǝki wi atanjar male,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:76 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isha 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />ace pe aɓwana male</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">súrǝ̀ amsǝban</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">nǝ njar mala kum twalbanì</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">mala acauɓikea malea.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ace mǝsǝswatǝr andǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">ɓuɓɓuka mala Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">ma'sǝm ngga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">nǝ̀ tsǝk kwaro mala ban</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">ɓǝ̀ mǝnna amur sǝm nǝ kuli,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />ace pà tǎlaban aban</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">aɓwana mǝnana à do</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">aɓa pǝndǝa andǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">yinggǝli lú ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ace yál kusǝ sǝm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">aɓa ká tanjar mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">dorǝpwala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:79 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isha 9:2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Muna, yì Yohana ka, camarǝ gulo sǝ dumnǝ rǝcandǝa aɓa bangŋo. Do male ka nda aɓa pǝɗanban a njenza, kya bwal a pwari pusǝrǝi aban amǝ Isǝrayila.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɓǝlban mala Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Aɓalǝ amǝno yì anonggio ka, Kaisar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kaisar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda lullǝ murǝm mǝgule mala amǝ Roma.</char></note> Agusta pa nzongcau ama, ɓǝa ɓal aɓwana mǝnana aɓa nzali Roma ka kat ɓǝa gilǝ lullǝia. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Mǝnia ka nda tita ɓalban arǝ abákú mǝnana Karniyus nda nggwamna mala bu-nzali Suriya ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Sǝ koyan ngga o a là male, ace mǝnana ɓǝà kya gilǝ lullǝì ka.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yisǝfu ka, lo a Nazarat ɓè là a bu-nzali Galili, aban ká a bu-nzali Yahudi, a là mala Dauda mana à tunǝki ama Betalami ka, acemǝnana yì Yisǝfu ka muna lá na, a tàu mala Dauda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />O kano andǝ Maryamu mā-nsari male mǝnana gongŋǝna ka, ace mǝnana ɓǝà kya gilǝ lullǝia. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />À nda kano più a Betalami ka, pwari gbáshí male yi kārǝa. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Pǝlǝa gbáshí muna dǝmba male, muna-ɓwabura. Mbúɓɓǝkì aɓa nggubyau sǝ nongsǝi aɓa kpamgbang-girlina mala agirkusǝu, acemǝnana à pànǝ ban nongŋo aɓa nda a ban-sulǝo ɗang.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayalgir andǝ mǝturonjar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Tù nǝ bania aɓa mǝnia yì bu-nzali ka, aɓea yalgir do a takuri aban yál agirkusǝu malea nǝ du. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Pǝlǝa ɓè mǝturonjar mala Mǝtalabangŋo pusǝrǝi a bania, ɓoarɓwa mala Mǝtalabangŋo ta gumbǝlia. Ɓangciu bwalia kǝ̀rkǝ́r.<figure style="fig" alt="An angel of the Lord appears to the shepherds." file="WA03803b.tif" size="col" loc="LUK 2:9" copy="Graham Wade. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya" ref="2:9">Mǝturonjar mala Mǝtalabangŋo pusǝrǝi aban ayálgír.</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Mǝturonjar banggia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakka wun ɗàng. Wu sǝni, ǝn ndya yina wun nǝ bǝsa Cau Mǝɓoarne mǝ'pwasǝ ɓabumì kǝ̀rkǝ́r mǝnana nda ace ɓwapǝndǝa kat ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Yalung aɓa nggea-là mala Dauda ka, à ɓǝlǝ́na wun Mǝ'amsǝban; yì nda Kǝrǝsti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko Mezaya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Kǝrǝsti&gt;&gt; nǝ kun mala amǝ Gǝrik sǝ &lt;&lt;Mezaya&gt;&gt; nǝ kún mala amǝ Ibǝru ka ɓālǝi nda &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana à ɗārǝi wi mùrú olif amurí mana lǝmdǝ ama Ɓakuli tarni (soani mburu amurí) ace túró male&gt;&gt; ka; anggo gbal a mǝsǝì 26.</char></note> Mǝtalabangŋo. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Gìr mǝnana nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama mǝnia yì cau ka mǝsǝcau na ka ndya ka. Wun nǝ̀ nggá kum bangna-muna à mbuɓɓǝ́kini aɓa nggubyau sǝ à nongsǝi aɓa kpamgbang-girlina mala agirkusǝu.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isha 7:14</ref></char>.</note> <figure style="fig" alt="Baby Jesus laid in a manger" file="CN01617b.tif" size="col" loc="LUK 2:12" copy="Cook NT Images" ref="2:12">À nongsǝ bangna Yesu aɓa kpamgbang-girlina mala agirkusǝu.</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Anggo ka kara aɓea amǝturonjar pas sulǝ nǝ kuli a ban mǝturonjar mana yiu a dǝmbe ka. À kǝ ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli à kǝ na ama:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Nokiban a ban Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">akanó a kùli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">sǝ a ɓanza ka dorǝpwala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">a ban aɓwana mǝnana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">à kǝ pwasǝ ɓabumi ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Lang amǝturonjar nyingŋǝnia à nyarǝna à umna kùli ka, ayálgír mǝno nea rǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu fani sǝm nǝ̀ ká a Betalami, sǝm nǝ̀ nggá sǝn mǝnia yì gìr mana kumban, mǝnana Mǝtalabangŋo na sǝm ce ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Pǝlǝa à lo a kaurǝa à kya kum Maryamu andǝ Yisǝfu sǝ bangna-muna aban nongŋo aɓa kpamgbang-girlina mala agirkusǝu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Lang à sǝnǝni ka, pǝlǝa à mesǝ cau mǝnana mǝturonjar banggia wia amur mǝnia yì muna ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Aɓwana mǝnana kat à ok ka à ndali nǝ cau mǝnana ayálgír banggia wia ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Sǝ Maryamu ka bwal amǝnia yì acau, kǝ ɗenyi amúrià nǝ ɓabumi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ayalgir nyare à kǝ gusǝlǝ Ɓakuli, à kǝ ɓwangsǝki ace agir mǝnana kat à o sǝ à sǝni, kǝla mǝnana à banggia wia ka.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">À tsǝki Yesu lullǝu sǝ <optbreak /> à wari nǝi a Ndàmǝgule <optbreak /> mala Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />A tongno-nong-tàruià nongŋo, pwari mǝnana à nǝ̀ kasǝî wi ɓate ka, à tsǝki wi lullǝu ama Yesu, lullǝu mǝnana mǝturonjar pe wi sǝ yi kpa a bum ngge ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Pǝris 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Lang apwari mala lak rǝia aɓa ɓoarnsari a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli yi lumsǝna, kǝla mǝnana Nggurcau mala Musa na ka, Yisǝfu andǝ Maryamu twal Yesu à um nǝi a Urǝshalima ace mǝnana ɓǝà kyan nǝi a ɓadǝm Mǝtalabangŋo ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Nggurcau mala Mǝtalabangŋo na ama, &lt;&lt;Koya muna-dǝmba mǝnana muna-ɓwabura na ka, à nǝ̀ ká nǝi ɓǝ̀ duk mala Mǝtalabangŋo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Pur 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />À wari gbal ace pà gir'nkila kǝla mǝnana Nggurcau mala Mǝtalabangŋo bang ama ɓǝà pà ka: &lt;&lt;akutugangyi ɓari, ko amuna-kutumurǝm ɓari.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Pǝris 12:8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />A bàkú mǝno ka ɓeɓwa ndakam nǝ do a Urǝshalima lùllǝì ama Shimiyon. Yì ka, mǝ ɓealɓoarna, mǝ ɓanggi Ɓakuli na. Nda ban kundǝ amsǝban mala amǝ Isǝrayila, sǝ Bangŋo Mǝfele na amurí. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Bangŋo Mǝfele lǝmdǝni wi ama pà nǝ̀ wu ɗang, she ɓǝ̀ sǝnǝna Kǝrǝsti Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana Mǝtalabangŋo turi ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli loasǝi wari nǝi a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli. Maryamu andǝ Yisǝfu yiu nǝ Yesu a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, ace mǝnana ɓǝa pakki wi gir mǝnana Nggurcau mala Musa kani ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Shimiyon yi ak muna a buì sǝ ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli na ama:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;A dyan ngga we</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">Mǝtalabangŋo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">mǝnana a Karban kat ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">nying guro mò ɓǝ̀ o</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">aɓa rǝpwala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">kǝla mana a bang ngga.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Acemǝnana amǝsǝam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:30">sǝnǝna amsǝban mô,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />mana a gilǝkice</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:31">a ɓamǝsǝ aɓwana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:31">mala anzali kat ka.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2:32 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isha 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52:10</ref></char>.</note>Tǎlaban na ace</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">mǝn mǝsǝ aɓwana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">mala acili anzali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">sǝ aban aɓwana mô</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">amǝ Isǝrayila ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">gulo na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tár muna andǝ ngge ka à ndali nǝ cau mǝnana à bang amurí ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Pǝlǝa Shimiyon tsǝkia wia bu sǝ ne nggè Maryamu ama, &lt;&lt;Kwakikiro pepè: Mǝnia yì Muna ka Ɓakuli tsǝngŋǝni ama nǝ̀ duk tǝr kpa andǝ lo mala ɓwapǝndǝa pas a Isǝrayila. Yì ka, nǝ̀ duk gir'lǝmdǝa mǝnana pur nǝban Ɓakuli, mǝnana aɓwana pas nǝ̀ na mǝɓane amurí ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Nǝ̀ pusǝta ɗenyicau ɓabum mala aɓwana pas. Sǝ we ka, kpakpak mǝkwanbanì mǝnana aɓwana nǝ̀ pakki wi ka nǝ̀ soa ɓabumo kǝla soaban mala nggeabyau.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anna bangcau amur muna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ɓè ɓwagula mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli nakam gbal lùllǝì ama, Anna, muna mala Fanuwel, a tàu mala Asha. Anzǝm isǝban ngga, à do andǝ burí pǝlǝa tongno-nong-ɓari sǝ burí wu. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Anggo sǝ do mā-lú apǝlǝa lumi-tongno-nong-tàrú nǝ mǝsǝì ine. Gapiyi tārǝia andǝ Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli ɗang, du andǝ pwari nda aban peri aban Ɓakuli nǝ gilmùr andǝ hiwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />A kǝ bu-pwari mǝno Shimiyon nda ban nacau nǝ Yisǝfu andǝ Maryamu ka, yiu pǝlǝa kutia pakki Ɓakuli yàwá andǝ bangcau amur muna a ban aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ kundǝ akmúrú mala Urǝshalima ka.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisǝfu andǝ Maryamu nyare <optbreak /> a la malea a Nazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Lang Yisǝfu andǝ Maryamu malǝna gir mǝnana kat Nggurcau mala Mǝtalabangŋo kani ka, à nyare a nzali Galili, a la malea a Nazarat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat 2:23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Muna gulo, kum rǝcandǝa, lùmsǝ nǝ sǝlǝe, ɗǝm ngga ɓwamuru mala Ɓakuli na amurí.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu, a muntulo aɓa Ndàmǝgule <optbreak /> mala Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2:41 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Pur 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Nggur 16:1-8</ref></char>.</note>Koya pǝlǝa nani ka tár Yesu andǝ ngge kǝ̀ o a Urǝshalima ace Lamsan Yàlîmurû<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lamsan Yàlîmurû: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝnia ka nda pakkiɗire ace ɗenyi nǝ baku mǝnana Ɓakuli pusǝ amǝ Isǝrayila aɓa nzali Masar ka.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Lang Yesu lùmsǝ̀nà apǝlǝa lum-nong-ɓari ka à wari a Lamsan Yàlîmurû, kǝla mǝnana à pakkiyi ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Lang Lamsan Yàlîmurû malǝna sǝ tárrí andǝ ngge na aban nyare à nǝ̀ o a la ka, Muna yì Yesu ka akrǝi a Urǝshalima, sǝ yia ka à sǝlǝ ɗang. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />À twali ama nda aɓalǝ acilia aɓwana mǝnana à twal gya andǝia ka, nda à gya aban o bà pwarikpǝra. Nǝ nzǝ́mò ka à tita alte a ban aɓǝla malea andǝ agyajam. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Lang à sǝni raka, à nyare a kusǝia aban ká Urǝshalima à nǝ̀ nggá sǝnbani. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Anzǝm nongŋo tàrú ka à kya kumi a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli aban do atà amǝkànìgìr, nda rǝ kwakikiri aban oea, sǝ kǝ ɗikia acau. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Ɓwa man kat oe ka, ndali kǝ̀rkǝ́r nǝ sǝlǝgir male andǝ acau mǝnana kǝ nyesǝia wia aɓa pa eare ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Lang a tárrí andǝ ngge sǝni ka, à ndali. Sǝ nggè ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Munem, palang sǝ a pakka sǝm ani? Mim sǝnǝ tárró sǝm came arǝ alto nǝ rǝɓǝla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu ɗia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ace mana sǝ wu altam? Wu sǝlǝ mbak ama dumǝnam púp mǝ pa a ɓala mala Tárrám a kun túró male?&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Sǝ yia ka à bwalta mǝnia yì cau nea wia ka ɗang.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Pǝlǝa lo ateà à nyare aban o a Nazarat. Kǝ okia wia. Sǝ nggè ka bwal amǝnia yì acau ka a ɓabumi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu gulo aɓa sǝlǝe andǝ nggunrǝu, nǝ earmúrú a ban Ɓakuli, andǝ aɓwana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Pas 3:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Hama mala Yohana Mǝbatisǝma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Nda aɓa lum-nong-tongnoia pǝlǝa mala do murǝm mala Kaisar Tiberiya, murǝm mǝgule mala amǝ Roma; Buntu Bilatus nda nggwamna mala bu-nzali Yahudi, Hirǝdus nda murǝm mala bu-nzali Galili, sǝ mǝ'eambi Filip nda murǝm mala abu-nzali Ituriya andǝ Tǝrakonitis; Lisaniyas nda murǝm mala bu-nzali Abilini, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />sǝ Annas andǝ Kayafas ka à nda ka apǝris mǝgule.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:2">A bàkú mǝno ka cau mala Ɓakuli yiu a ban Yohana muna mala Zakariya aɓa pǝɗanban a njenza. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohana ka kutio arǝ alá mǝnana a kun Nggeasala Jodan ngga, kǝ hamnǝ cau ama, &lt;&lt;Wu pwanzali, wu ɗeki bu wun arǝ acauɓikea ma'wun, ɓǝà pakka wun batisǝma, ace mǝnana Ɓakuli ɓǝ̀ twala wun ban acauɓikea ma'wun ngga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kǝla mǝnana à gilǝì aɓa Malǝmce mala Ishaya mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli ɗiɗyal ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Gì ɓeɓwa kǝ tunǝban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">aɓa pǝɗanban a njenza ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Wu gilǝki tanjar mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Mǝtalabangŋo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Wu tsǝk atanjar ɓǝà cam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">pǝrapǝra ace.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Koya ɓatūliban ngga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">à nǝ̀ lumsǝí,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">koya nkono andǝ muna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">nkono ka à nǝ̀ bǝbbǝriki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Atanjar mǝkarke ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">à nǝ̀ sārǝia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">aban mana gwangɗing-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">gwangɗing ngga à nǝ̀</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">gilǝkia ɓǝà nong pàling.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Sǝ ɓwapǝndǝa kat ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">nǝ̀ sǝn amsǝban</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:6">mala Ɓakuli!&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isha 40:3-5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana ne aɓwabundǝa mǝnana à kǝ yiu a baní ɓǝ̀ pakkia wia batisǝma ka ama, &lt;&lt;Wun amuna baffu, yan sangsǝ kir wun ama ɓǝ̀ wu ɓanggi nggea bumlulla mala Ɓakuli mǝnana kǝ yiu ka?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Wu pusǝ ɓealu mǝnana nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama wu pwanǝna'nzali, wu nyìngŋǝ̀nà acauɓikea ma'wun ngga. Wu kǝa twali ama do ma'wun kǝla amǝkau mala Ibǝrayim ngga nǝ̀ amsǝ wun ɗang. Ən nggǝ na wun ama aɓalǝ atali man ngga, Ɓakuli nǝ̀ gandǝ loasǝi Ibǝrayim amǝkau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoh 8:33</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ko ado ka kun bero na a tǝrta anggun. Koya nggun mǝnana pà nǝ̀ pusǝ ɓǝle mǝɓoarne raka à nǝ̀ kasǝi à nǝ̀ turi a bǝsa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat 7:19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Ɓwabunda pǝlǝa ɗì Yohana ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝ mana ado sǝm nǝ̀ pa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohana earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat ndanǝ adaura ɓari ka, ɓǝ̀ nyesǝ ɓe ɓǝ̀ pè ɓwa mǝnana pa nǝi raka. Ɓwa mǝnana nǝ girlina ka, ɓǝ̀ pè aɓwana mǝnana à pa nǝi raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Amǝ'ak boalo-cemi gbal ka à yiu ama ɓǝà pakkia wia batisǝma. Pǝlǝa à ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, mana sǝm nǝ̀ pa?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk 7:29</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yohana pǝlǝa nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kǝa ak gìr mǝnana kútì mana à kasǝa wun ngga ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Aɓea soje ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝ sǝm ngga, mana sǝm nǝ̀ pa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kǝa kùmsǝkun kǝɓwa ɗàng, wu kǝa ɓunbî kǝɓwa cau ɓà arǝì ɗàng. Wu do amur kǝ boalo zongŋo ma'wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ɓwapǝndǝa kwaki kiria, nǝ tsǝkɓalǝu, à kǝ ndali nǝ ɓabumia ko Yohana nda Kǝrǝsti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mezaya&gt;&gt;</char></note> Mǝ'amsǝban. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Pǝlǝa Yohana earia wia kat ama, &lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ pakka wun batisǝma nǝ mur. Sǝ ɓeɓwa ndakam kútiǎm nǝ gulo, nda nǝ̀ yiu ka. Anggur-nkura male ka, ǝn kārǝa mǝ nǝ panzǝia ɗang. Yì ka, nǝ̀ yia pakka wun batisǝma nǝ Bangŋo Mǝfele andǝ bǝsa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Kwar sarǝgir male nda buì. Nǝ̀ yia esǝki katǝra, nǝ̀ ram mǝsǝsa a bà male, sǝ kwá ka nǝ̀ pisǝì nǝ bǝsa mǝnana pà nǝ̀ limgi raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Anggo nǝ aɓea cau pas sǝ Yohana kwarkir ɓwapǝndǝa sǝ hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban abania.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Sǝ lang Yohana gim murǝm Hirǝdus ace twal Hirǝdiya, mala mǝ'eambi, andǝ acilia ɓealɓikea mǝnana pakkia ka, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hirǝdus tsǝa à bwal Yohana à oasǝi a ndàkurban. Mǝno ka ɓè cauɓikea na Hirǝdus pa amur amǝnana angŋa dǝmba pangŋǝnia ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">À pakki Yesu Batisǝma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Lang à ndarǝ pakki aɓwabundǝa kat batisǝma, sǝ Yesu gbal ka à pangŋǝni wi batisǝma, sǝ nda ban pak hiwi ka, kara kùli mǝnna, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Bangŋo Mǝfele sulǝ amurí nǝ nggunrǝu kǝla kutu. Gi Ɓakuli pur nǝ kùli na ama, &lt;&lt;A nda Munem mǝnana ǝn nggǝ earceo ka, ban kǝ ɓoaram a rǝo kǝ̀rkǝ́r.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Tite 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Ang 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isha 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:17">Mar 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tau mǝnana Yesu pur kam ngga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu ka ndanǝ pǝlǝa kǝla lumi-tàrú sǝ tita túró mala Ɓakuli. Aɓwana twali ama yì ka, nda muna mala Yisǝfu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yisǝfu ka nda muna mala Heli,<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli nda muna mala Matat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Matat nda muna mala Lawi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Lawi nda muna mala Melki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Melki nda muna mala Janayi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Janayi nda muna mala Yisǝfu.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yisǝfu nda muna mala Matatiyas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Matatiyas nda muna mala Amos,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amos nda muna mala Nahum,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahum nda muna mala Esǝli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Esǝli nda muna mala Naggai.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Naggai nda muna mala Ma'at,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Ma'at nda muna mala Matatiyas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Matatiyas nda muna mala Semeyi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeyi nda muna mala Yosek,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Yosek nda muna mala Yahuda.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yahuda nda muna mala Yoanan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Yoanan nda muna mala Resa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa nda muna mala Jerubabel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Jerubabel nda muna mala Shaltiyel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Shaltiyel nda muna mala Neri.<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri nda muna mala Melki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Melki nda muna mala Addi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Addi nda muna mala Kosam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosam nda muna mala Elmadam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Elmadam nda muna mala Er.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er nda muna mala Jesǝwa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Jesǝwa nda muna mala Eliyeza.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyeza nda muna mala Jorim.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Jorim nda muna mala Matat.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matat nda muna mala Lawi.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi nda muna mala Shimiyon.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Shimiyon nda muna mala Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yahuda nda muna mala Yisǝfu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yisǝfu nda muna mala Yonam.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yonam nda muna mala Iliyakim.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim nda muna mala Meliya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Meliya nda muna mala Menna.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Menna nda muna mala Matata.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Matata nda muna mala Natan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Natan nda muna mala Dauda.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dauda nda muna mala Jeshi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Jeshi nda muna mala Obet.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Obet nda muna mala Boaza.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boaza nda muna mala Salmon.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Salmon nda muna mala Nashon.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon nda muna mala Aminadap.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadap nda muna mala Adǝmin.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Adǝmin nda muna mala Arni.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Arni nda muna mala Hezǝron.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Hezǝron nda muna mala Parisa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Parisa nda muna mala Yahuda.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yahuda nda muna mala Yakupu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakupu nda muna mala Ishaku.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Ishaku nda muna mala Ibǝrayim.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Ibǝrayim nda muna mala Tera.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Tera nda muna mala Naho.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naho nda muna mala Seru.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Seru nda muna mala Reyu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reyu nda muna mala Pele,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Pele nda muna mala Eba.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eba nda muna mala Shela.<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela nda muna mala Kenan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenan nda muna mala Arfakza.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Arfakza nda muna mala Shem,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Shem nda muna mala Nuhu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Nuhu nda muna mala Lamek.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek nda muna mala Metusela.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Metusela nda muna mala Inok.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Inok nda muna mala Jared.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Jared nda muna mala Mahalale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalale nda muna mala Kenan.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan nda muna mala Enosh.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enosh nda muna mala Set.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Set nda muna mala Adamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">sǝ Adamu nda muna mala Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Shetan kārǝki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu lùmsǝ nǝ Bangŋo Mǝfele, nyàrî Nggeasala Jodan ngga, Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli um nǝi a pǝɗanban a njenza. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Akanó ka Shetan camarǝ karǝkì nongŋo lumi-ine. Aɓalǝ amǝno yì anonggio ka li kǝgìr ɗang. A masǝlǝata anongge ka nzala wali.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shetan ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ a nda Muna mala Ɓakuli ka, ne mǝnia yì tali ka ɓǝ̀ pǝlǝ nɗǝmo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu nyesǝi wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;À gilǝ a Malǝmce mala Ɓakuli ama, &lt;Ɓwa pà nǝ̀ au nǝ girlina nǝmurǝì ɗang.</char>&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Nggur 8:3</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Shetan loasǝi um nǝi a nggea ban mǝ'dāhre, sǝ lǝmdǝì wi anzali-murǝm mala ɓanza kat aɓa kuɓimǝsǝu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Pǝlǝa Shetan ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ po arǝcandǝa malea andǝ ɓoarɓwa malea kat, acemǝnana à panamia. Mǝ nǝ gandǝ pe koyan mǝnana ǝn earce pe wi ka. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Sǝ ɓǝa kū`ndǝó, a gusǝlǝam ngga, agir man nǝ̀ duk amo yia kat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu nyesǝi wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;À gilǝ a Malǝmce mala Ɓakuli ama,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt; &lt;Peri aban Mǝtalabangŋo</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="wj">Ɓakuli mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">
    <char style="wj">sǝ wu kpate yì nǝmurǝì.</char>&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nggur 6:13</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Shetan nyare loasǝi um nǝi a Urǝshalima, kya tamsǝi a ɓong Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, sǝ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ a nda Muna mala Ɓakuli ka, ta zurro a nzali. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10-11" />Acemǝnana Malǝmce mala Ɓakuli bang ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10-11">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ɓakuli nǝ̀ tsǝk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10-11">amǝturonjar male aceo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10-11">ɓǝa yalo caca;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10-11">à nǝ̀ mbalǝkio a ɓabuia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10-11">ace mǝnana wu kǝa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10-11">tul kusǝo arǝ tali raka.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10-11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Ang 91:11-12</ref></char>.</note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu nyesǝi wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;À gilǝ aɓa Malǝmce mala Ɓakuli ama, &lt;Ce a kārǝki Mǝtalabangŋo Ɓakuli mo ɗang.</char>&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Nggur 6:16</ref></char>.</note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Lang Shetan malǝna kārǝki Yesu ka, pǝlǝa gǝshì banì zuku.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu nyare a Galili aɓa rǝcandǝa mala Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli. Cau male akiban kat aɓa nzali mǝno. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Kànìgìr arǝ andakpapi malea, sǝ koyan ngga ɓwangsǝki.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">À ɓinǝ Yesu a Nazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu kutio a Nazarat la mǝnana gul kam ngga. A pwari Sabbat, pwari usǝlǝo mala amǝ Yahudi ka, Yesu kutio a ndakpapi kǝla mǝnana pakki ka. Lo came nǝ̀ ɓal cau aɓa Malǝmce. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Pǝlǝa à pe wi Malǝmce mala Ishaya Mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli. Lang mǝnni ka pǝlǝa kum ban mǝnana à gilǝa ama,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Bangŋo mala Mǝtalabangŋo</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">nda a muram,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana tàrnám</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">ɓǝ̀n hamnǝ Cau Mǝɓoarne </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">a ban amǝ'tǝ̀r.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Tasǝam ɓǝ̀n yi hamnǝ </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">cau mala panzǝban </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">a ban aɓwana mǝnana </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">à kùria ka.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝà nyesǝi ante </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">mǝsǝu sǝnban,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">sǝ ɓǝà pusǝ aɓwana </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">mǝnana à nda aɓata </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">parban ngga a gung.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀n hama ama </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">
    <char style="wj">pwari mana Ɓakuli nǝ̀ </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:19">
    <char style="wj">amsǝ aɓwana male </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">
    <char style="wj">nǝi ka yina.&gt;&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isha 61:1-2</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Pǝlǝa kar Malǝmce pè mǝ ɗenyi nǝia, ɓunte do. Mǝsǝ ɓwapǝndǝa mǝnana a ndakpapi ka kàr arǝì kat. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Pǝlǝa tita nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝnia yì cau ɓá Malǝmce mala Ɓakuli kir wun oè ka, lùmsǝ̀nà yalung.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Ko yan ngga bang cau mǝɓoarne amurí, sǝ à pak ndali arǝ sǝlǝ nacau male mǝɓuɓɓuki. Pǝlǝa à ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Nggearǝì ka, muna mala Yisǝfu nda man re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 4:23">
    <char style="wj">Ɓafo ka wun nǝ̀ nam mǝnia yì kun-nacau ka, ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝsonzǝo, sonzǝ ɓamuro!&gt;&gt; Ɗǝm ngga wun nǝ̀ nam ama, &lt;&lt;Agir mǝnana sǝm ok ama a pakkia a Kapanahum ngga, pea kani a là mo.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ən nggǝ bangga wun mǝsǝcau, kǝ mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli pà kàm mǝnana à earnǝi a là male ka ɗàng.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:43">Yoh 4:43</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 4:44">44</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun mǝsǝcau ama, amā-lú ndakam pas a nzali Isǝrayila a nza mala Iliya mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli a bàkú mǝnana mbulo came pǝlǝa tàrú nǝ tsùrú, sǝ nggea nzal-gula kpa a nzali kat ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Amur 17:1</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><char style="wj">Kat anggo ka Ɓakuli tasǝ Iliya a ban kǝɓwa ateà ɗàng, she a ban ɓe mā-lú a Zarefat, a bu-nzali Sidon kano kuko.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Amur 17:8-16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><char style="wj">Amǝdakali ndakam pas a nzali Isǝrayila a nza mala Elisha mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli, kat anggo ka Ɓakuli sonzǝ kǝɓwa ateà ɗàng, she kǝ Naaman, bǝri ɓwa Suriya.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2Amur 5:1-14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Aɓwana mǝnana kat a ndakpapi ka bumia lúllô lang à ok amǝnia yì acau ka. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Pǝlǝa à lo à ramgi ta Yesu, à pusǝì anzǝm la, à um nǝi amur muna-nkono mǝnana la malea cam amurí ka, ama à nǝ̀ ramte ɓǝ̀ kpa. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kara gya kutio a nre ɓwabundǝa, bwal njar male aban o.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pusǝ akukwar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Pǝlǝa Yesu sulǝo aban ká Kapanahum, ɓè la aɓa bu-nzali Galili. A pwari usǝlǝo ka tita kani aɓwana gìr. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />À ndali nǝ kanigìr male acemǝnana cau male ka ndanǝ rǝcandǝa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Aɓa ndakpapi ka, ɓeɓwa ndakam nǝ kukwar arǝì. Lo mak'zwalo bàng-bàng kǝ na ama, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Oi! Mana a alkite arǝ sǝm, we Yesu Ɓwa Nazarat. A yiu ace wal sǝm le? Ən súrǝ́nà rǝo, a nda Ɓwa Mǝfele mala Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu sà arǝì ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Gìr kuno più! Purî rǝì!&gt;&gt;</char> Pǝlǝa kukwar loasǝi me a nzali a ɓadǝm ɓwapǝndǝa kat, pǝlǝa purî rǝì, tsǝki wi penye ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ɓwapǝndǝa kat ndali, à kǝ nea rǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ulang ya kanigir nda man? Nǝ nacau sà'arǝban andǝ rǝcandǝa mǝgule sǝ kǝ pusǝ akukwar!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Kara cau mala Yesu akiban kat a bu-nzali malea.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu twalia aɓwana pas <optbreak /> ban rǝkwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu pǝlǝa purî ɓá Ndakpapi kutio a ɓala mala Shiman. Nkil Shiman ngga ɓauwa gandǝi nongsǝi. Pǝlǝa à zǝmbi Yesu ɓǝ̀ sonzǝi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu kū`ndǝó amurí sǝ gim ɓauwa, pǝlǝa ɓauwa sùlǝî rǝì. Kara long nǝ lo àkǝ̀ banì pea wia girlina.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Lang pwari nda rǝ kpa ka, ɓwapǝndǝa yiu nǝ amǝkwánó ɗàngɗáng, pǝlǝa tsǝk buì amur koyan aɓalǝia ka, twalia wia ban rǝkwana kat. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Ɗǝm ngga akukwar purî rǝ aɓwana pas, à kǝ loasǝ già ama, &lt;&lt;A nda Muna mala Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt; Yesu gimbia, eare ama ɓǝà na kǝ cau ɗàng, acemǝnana à sǝlǝna ama yì ka, nda Kǝrǝsti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mezaya.&gt;&gt;</char></note> Mǝ'amsǝban.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hamnǝ cau mala Ɓakuli <optbreak /> arǝ andakpapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Nǝ tadǝmbari ka Yesu lo o a ban mǝnana kǝɓwa pà kàm raka. Ɓwapǝndǝa camarǝ alte. Lang à kumǝni ka, à ɓariki à nǝ̀ kàsǝ̀kúni acemǝnana ɓǝ̀ kǝa nyia ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Dumǝnam púp mǝ hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli arǝ aɓea lá gbal, acemǝnana àkǝ̀ ce sǝ à túrǎm.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Pǝlǝa kutio aban hamnǝ cau arǝ andakpapi, a nzali Yahudi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu tunǝ alaggana mǝdǝmbe male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matiu 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Markus 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1">Mat 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mar 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4:1</ref></char>.</note> Ɓè pwari mwashat Yesu naban came a kun Garang Jenasaret, ɓwapǝndǝa nggiki kàrì aɓalǝu aban ok cau mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Mǝsǝì kpa arǝ awaru ɓari a kun mur. Amǝtalea kpashia, à ndaban lákkí andámbú malea. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Pǝlǝa Yesu eauwe aɓa waru man mwashat ka, mala Shiman. Ne wi ama ɓǝ̀ tasǝ ta waru a ɓá mùr bǝti nǝ kunmur. Pǝlǝa dum nǝ do a waru sǝ kǝ kani aɓwana gir.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Lang malǝna cau ka, pǝlǝa ne Shiman ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Soa waru ɓǝ̀ kya ban mǝlime a mùr, sǝ wu túr ndámbú ace bwal nji.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Shiman eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, sǝm mal dù aban tanni, sǝ ko sǝm bwal kǝgìr ɗàng. Sǝ acemǝnana awu nǝ na ka, mǝ nǝ túr ndámbú.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Lang à túrna ndámbú ka, à bwal nji lùmsǝ ndámbú, gandǝa ndámbú tita sana. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Pǝlǝa à tunǝ aɓia mǝnana aɓa ɓe waru ka, ɓǝà yi bwalia wia. À yì lumsǝ amǝnia yì awaru ɓari ka nǝ nji, gandǝa awaru tita ko a mùr.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Lang Shiman Bitǝrus sǝn mǝnia yì gir ka, kpa a ɓadǝm Yesu sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nda yan sǝ awu nǝ came abanam, Mǝtalabangŋo, mim ngga mǝ nda mǝ'cauɓikea.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Yì andǝ aɓi ka à ndali nǝ làkkì mala nji mǝnana à bwal ka. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Anggo gbal sǝ aɓi amǝtúró mala Shiman, yia Jemis andǝ Yohana, amuna mala Zabadi ndali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Yesu pǝlǝa ne Shiman ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakko ɗang, twal ado ka, aɓwana na a nǝ nggǝ bwalia ɓǝa yiu abanam ngga, anji na ɗang.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Pǝlǝa à yì kpashi awaru a nza, sǝ à nying koya gir ka, à o atà Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu twali mǝdakali ban <optbreak /> kwano male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matiu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Markus 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />A ɓekǝ pwari ka Yesu nda a ɓè là. Ɓè ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝ kwánó dakali ka yiu a banì. Lang sǝn Yesu ka, kara yi ɓunno a ɓadǝmbi, sǝ zǝmbi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, ɓǝ̀ a nǝ ear ka, a nǝ gandǝ twàlâm-ban dakali mǝnia a rǝàm ngga, ɓǝn ɓoarnsari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu lǝmdǝ buì je, ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən earǝna, dakali mo ka à langŋǝ́nì, ɓǝ̀ rǝo malâ.&gt;&gt;</char> Àkǝ̀ banì kara dakali malâ. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu pǝlǝa ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kǝa ne kǝɓwa ce ɗàng, bwal njar kyane a ban pǝris ɓǝ̀ pelǝkio; sǝ wu pa ɓoro mǝnana Musa tsǝa ama ɓǝa pà ka, ace mǝnana koyan ngga ɓǝ̀ sǝlǝ ama rǝo sonzǝna.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-13">Pǝris 14:1-13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kat andǝ amani ka cau amur Yesu akiban, gandǝa ɓwabundǝa yiu ace ok cau male andǝ kum twalban akwánó mǝnana a rǝia ka. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Sǝ pak ka Yesu kǝ o arǝ ban mǝnana kǝɓwa pà kàm raka ace pak hiwi.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu twali ɓeɓwa ban rǝkwana <optbreak /> mala rǝwuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ɓè pwari mwashat Yesu ka nda ban kanigir, amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa mǝnana à purkio arǝ amuna-là ɗàngɗáng aɓalǝ abu-nzali Galili andǝ Yahudi, andǝ Urǝshalima ka, à ndakam aban do. Sǝ Bangŋo mala Ɓakuli ka nda te ace sonzǝ amǝ rǝkwana. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Aɓea ɓwana yiu nǝ mǝkwánó rǝwuna, à twali a kala. À ɓariki à nǝ̀ kútí nǝi a ɓala, à nǝ̀ nggá nongsǝi a ɓadǝm Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Lang à kum njar mǝnana à nǝ̀ kútí nǝi raka, ace làkkì mala ɓwabundǝa ka, à pǝlǝa à eauwe amur kurǝm, à mǝn ban, sǝ à sùlǝì andǝ kala male a ɓadǝm Yesu aɓalǝ aɓwana.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Lang Yesu sǝn gūliarǝu malea ka, pǝlǝa ne mǝkwánó ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓiam, à twalǝno ban acauɓikea mo.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Amalǝm Nggurcau andǝ amǝ Farisi tita ndali nǝ ɓabumia ama, &lt;&lt;Yana mǝnia yì ɓwa kǝ ak bancame mala Ɓakuli ka! Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli nǝmurǝì raka, yana nǝ̀ twalban cauɓikea!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu súrǝ̀ ɗenyicau malea pǝlǝa ɗia ma, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ace mana sǝ wu kǝ ɗikiban a ɓabum wun amur man yì cau ka?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" /><char style="wj">Mǝ ye nda kwano kútì ɓì, ɓǝà na ama, &lt;À twalǝno ban acauɓikea mò le&gt; ko ɓǝà na ama, &lt;Lo, wu gya?&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu sǝlǝ ama Muna mala Ɓwa ka ndanǝ rǝcandǝa amur ɓanza nǝ̀ twalban cauɓikea ka, mǝ nǝ lǝmdǝa wun.&gt;&gt;</char> Pǝlǝa ne mǝkwánó rǝwuna ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Lo, twal kala mò o a ɓala!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Anggo ka kara lo cam nǝ came a ɓadǝmbia, twal kala mǝnana nongŋo amurí ka, o a ɓala, kǝ ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Koyan ngga ndali, sǝ à kǝ ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli. Muria kàrria kǝ̀rkǝ́r, à na ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm sǝnǝna agir gyamiban yalung.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tunǝ Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Anzǝm man ngga Yesu puro pǝlǝa sǝn mǝ'ak boalo-cemi, lùllǝì ama Lawi, dumǝna aɓa mǝdanki cemi. Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Lo, yiu atàm.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lawi par buì lo, nying girbunda kat o atè.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Pǝlǝa Lawi tunǝ pakkiɗire mǝgule mala li girlina ace Yesu a ɓala male. Sǝ pas aɓalǝ aɓwabundǝa mǝnana aban li ateà ka amǝ'ak boalo-cemi na. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Sǝ aɓea amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau malea nggwani aban alaggana mala Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ wu kǝ lili, wu kǝ nuki agir wunǝ amǝ'ak boalo-cemi andǝ amǝ'cauɓikea, aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ kpata Nggurcau mala Musa raka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu earia wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Aɓwana mǝnana rǝia bang ngga à alkiyita mǝsonzǝo ɗang, amǝ rǝkwana na à alkiyita mǝsonzǝo ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" /><char style="wj">Ən yiu ace tunǝ amǝ'cauɓoarna ɗang, ǝn yiu ace amǝ'cauɓikea ɓǝa nyare aban Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝ Farisi andǝ <optbreak /> amalǝm Nggurcau <optbreak /> ɗì Yesu amur gilmùr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matiu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Markus 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Aɓea ɓwana ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Alaggana mala Yohana ka à kǝ gilmùr, sǝ à kǝ pak hiwi tùtù. Anggo gbal sǝ alaggana mala amǝ Farisi kǝ pa. Sǝ amo yì alaggana ka à came arǝ li sǝ à kǝ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu earia wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu nǝ̀ tsǝk agyajam mala bura-māfela ɓǝa gilmùr yi mǝnana nda tea più ka le?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" /><char style="wj">Pwari na kǝ yiu ka, mǝnana à nǝ̀ twal bura-māfela a rǝia ka. Amǝno yì pwari ka sǝ à nǝ̀ gilmùr.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Pǝlǝa nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka, ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 5:36">
    <char style="wj">Kǝɓwa pà nǝ̀ san kun nggubyau mǝbǝshe, sǝ nǝ̀ mbàkìnà mǝ'e nǝi ɗàng. Ɓǝ̀ pè anggo ka, sanǝna nggubyau mǝbǝshe, sǝ mbàkì mana sannì arǝ nggubyau mǝbǝshe ka pà nǝ̀ ak rǝarǝia andǝ mǝ'e ɗang.</char><verse eid="LUK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ kǝɓwa pà nǝ̀ so mur anap mǝbǝshe aɓa du mǝ'e nǝ̀ funyi kúni ɗang. Ɓǝ̀ pè anggo ka mùr-anap mǝbǝshe mǝno ka nǝ̀ ar du, nǝ̀ sukkio, sǝ du ka nǝ̀ ueɓà.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" /><char style="wj">Mùr-anap mǝbǝshe ka aɓa du mǝbǝshe sǝ à nǝ̀ soé.</char><verse eid="LUK 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ kǝɓwa pà nǝ̀ nu mur anap mǝ'e, sǝ nǝ̀ earce mǝbǝshe ɗang. Acemǝnana nǝ̀ na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ'e ɓoaro kútì mǝbǝshe.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɗiban amur pwari Sabbat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matiu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Markus 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />A ɓe pwari Sabbat, pwari usǝlǝo mala amǝ Yahudi, Yesu ar aɓalǝ aɓaban-mǝsa. Alaggana male kǝ harki kir mǝssa sǝ à kǝ bik a ɓabuia à kǝ she.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nggur 23:25</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Aɓea amǝ Farisi bang ama, &lt;&lt;Palang sǝ wu kǝ pak gir mǝnana ɓoaro ɓǝa pe a pwari usǝlǝo raka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu earia wia ma, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu malaká ɓal gir mǝnana murǝm Dauda pe, yi mǝnana yì andǝ aɓwana mana atè nzala walia ka re?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><char style="wj">Mǝnana Dauda kutio a Nda mala Ɓakuli, twal bǝredi mǝfele, mǝnana nzongcau tsǝa ama kǝ apǝris na nǝmurǝia à nǝ̀ li ka, pǝlǝa li sǝ pe aɓwana mǝnana atè ka à li.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sam 21:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:9">Pǝris 24:9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Muna mala Ɓwa ka Mǝtalabangŋo na amur Pwari Sabbat.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓwa mǝnana buì wu ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matiu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Markus 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />A ɓe pwari Sabbat ɗǝm ngga Yesu kutio a Ndakpapi aban kanigir. Ɓè ɓwa nakam mǝnana buì mǝlì wu ka. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa camarǝ alta cau mǝnana à nǝ̀ tsǝki Yesu arǝì ka. À tsǝki wi mǝsǝu à nǝ̀ sǝni ko nǝ̀ twalban rǝkwana a pwari Sabbat, pwari usǝlǝo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Sǝ Yesu ka súrǝ́nà rǝ ɗenyicau malea, pǝlǝa ne mǝbuwuna ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Lo, yiu cam a ɓadǝm ɓwapǝndǝa kat.&gt;&gt;</char> Nda lo came abanì. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ma, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ ɗì wun, mǝ ye na Nggurcau mala Musa eara sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm pè a pwari Sabbat? Ɓǝà pak mǝɓoarne le ko ɓǝà pak mǝɓane, ɓǝà amsǝ yilǝmu le ko ɓǝà kiɗiki?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Pǝlǝa sǝnia kàrìban kat sǝ ne mǝbuwuna ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Sárǝ́ buo.&gt;&gt;</char> Pǝlǝa sárǝ́ buì, kara buì sonzǝ àkǝ̀ banì. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Sǝama amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa ka bumia lul kǝ̀rkǝ́r, à tita banggia rǝia gìr mǝnana à nǝ̀ pak nǝ Yesu ka.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tàr alaggana lum-nong-ɓari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Aɓalǝ anonggio mǝno ka, Yesu o a bum nkono nǝ̀ ká pàk hiwi. Bankwari aban hiwi a ban Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ban fana ka tunǝ alaggana male rambia pǝlǝa tàr lum-nong-ɓari mǝnana tunǝia ama amǝ'mishan ngga. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />À nda ka</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Shiman (mǝnana tsǝki wi lullǝu ama Bitǝrus ka),</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">andǝ Andǝru (mǝ'eam Bitǝrus),</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">andǝ Jemis,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">andǝ Yohana,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">andǝ Filip,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">andǝ Batalomi,<verse eid="LUK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />andǝ Matiu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">andǝ Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">andǝ Jemis (muna mala Alfiyus),</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">andǝ Shiman (mǝnana à tunǝki ama ɓwa mana earkiyi ace la male raka),<verse eid="LUK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />andǝ Yahuda (muna mala Jemis),</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">sǝ Yahuda Iskariyoti (mǝnana yi kúrkúró nǝ Yesu ka).<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aɓwana ok cau mala Yesu <optbreak /> sǝ twalia wia ban arǝkwana.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matiu 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Lang à sùlǝ́nì múr nkono ka, Yesu yi came a ɓe palban. Aɓea alaggana male ndakam pas aban rambǝa. Aɓwabundǝa pas mǝnana à purkio aɓa nzali Yahudi, andǝ Urǝshalima andǝa mǝnana a bu-nzali mala amǝ Taya andǝ Sidon mana a kun nggeamùr ka, à ndakam gbal. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />À yiu ace ok cau male andǝ kum sonzǝban mala arǝkwana malea. Amǝnana gbal akukwar kǝ pea wia tanni ka, akukwar purî rǝia kat. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Aɓwana kat ɓariki ama à nǝ̀ je rǝì, acemǝnana rǝcandǝa kǝ puro arǝì kǝ sonzǝia kat.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsǝkbu andǝ caukwanban</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matiu 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu loasǝ mǝsǝì sǝn amǝtè sǝ nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">Wu ndanǝ tsǝkbu </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">mala Ɓakuli</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">wun amǝ'tǝ̀r,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana Domurǝm</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">mala Ɓakuli ka</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">ma'wun na.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />
    <char style="wj">Wu ndanǝ tsǝkbu </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">mala Ɓakuli,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">yì wun mǝnana wu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">kǝ ok nzala ado ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana à nǝ̀</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">ɗǝmsǝ wun.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">Wu ndanǝ tsǝkbu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">mala Ɓakuli,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">wun man wu kǝ </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">ɓua ado ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana wun nǝ̀</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">ngga oalo.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <char style="wj">Wu ndanǝ tsǝkbu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">mala Ɓakuli,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">wun mana ɓwapǝndǝa</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">kǝ ɓinǝ mǝsǝ wun,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">à kǝ tar wun </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">kǝla amǝɓane,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">à kǝ sanggi wun,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">à kǝ tunǝa wun </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">ɓealɓikea, atàcau </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">mem ngga!</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Bit 4:14</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />
    <char style="wj">Wu pak bumpwasǝa a mǝno yì pwari ka, wu yalke nǝ banɓoarnado, acemǝnana a kùli ka tangnakusǝ wun ngga mǝgule na. Anggo sǝ atárrià pakki amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6:23 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Acau 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Atúró 7:52</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝa ma caukwanban </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">na nǝ wun,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">wun amǝkume,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana wu angŋa</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">dǝmba wu kumǝna </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">ma'wun yì girikiban!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban na nǝ wun</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">mǝnana wu ɗǝmna ado ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana nzala</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">nǝ̀ wal wun.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban na nǝ wun</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">mana wu kǝ oal ado ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana wu nǝ̀ keban, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">wu nǝ̀ ɓua.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban na nǝ wun </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">mǝnana koyan ngga </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">kǝ ɓwangsǝ wun ngga,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">acemǝnana anggo sǝ akeâ</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">a pwarian ɓwangsǝ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">amǝ'ɓangnǝa mǝ'nyir nì.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu earce aɓi wun amǝbura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matiu 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝama ǝn nggǝ bangga wun, wun mǝnana wu kǝ oem ngga: Wu earce aɓiwun amǝbura, aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ ɓinǝmǝsǝ wun ngga, wu pakkia wia mǝɓoarne.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" /><char style="wj">Aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ su wun ngga, wu tsǝkia wia bu. Aɓwana mǝnana ce wun kǝ shiria ka, wu pakkia wia hiwi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa kweo a takiro ka, pǝlǝi wi ɓe takiro gbal. Sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓwa ak nggea daura mo a rǝo ka, ce a ginǝì wi ɓǝ̀ twal muna-daura mo ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" /><char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana kat zǝmbǝo ka, pe wi. Sǝ ɓǝ̀ koyan twalgir mǝnana mona ka, kǝa na ama a nǝ é ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><char style="wj">Pakki aɓwana gir mǝnana a kǝ earce ama ɓǝa pakko ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝà aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ earce wun, à nda wu earki cea ka, ya tsǝkbu nda wun nǝ̀ kùmô aɓalǝi? Ko nggearǝ &lt;&lt;amǝ'cauɓikea&gt;&gt; ka à kǝ earce aɓwana mǝnana amǝ'earcea na ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ kǝ aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ pakka wun pepè, à nda wun nǝ̀ pakkia wia mǝɓoarne ka, ya tsǝkbu nda wun nǝ̀ kùmô aɓalǝi? Ko nggearǝ &lt;&lt;amǝ'cauɓikea&gt;&gt; ka anggo sǝ à kǝ pa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ aɓwana mǝnana wu pākia wia tangna ka, à nda kǝ amǝnana wu kǝ tsǝkɓalǝ wun arǝia ama à nda à nǝ̀ gandǝ mbwe wun tangnê ka, ya tsǝkbu nda wun nǝ̀ kùmô aɓalǝi? Ko nggearǝ &lt;&lt;amǝ'cauɓikea&gt;&gt; ka à kǝ peâ &lt;&lt;amǝ'cauɓikea&gt;&gt; tangna acemǝnana ɓǝà yi mbwea kat gìr mǝnana à pa ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" /><char style="wj">Wun ngga, wu earce aɓiwun amǝbura, wu pakkia wia mǝɓoarne. Wu pea wia tangna, sǝ wu kǝa tsǝkɓalǝu ama à nǝ̀ mbwe wun ɗàng. Sǝ tangnakusǝ wun nǝ̀ gulo, sǝ wun nǝ̀ duk amuna mala Tár wun Ɓakuli mǝnana Karban nǝ Gulo kat ka. Acemǝnana yì ka, kǝ lǝmdǝ ɓwamuru male, ko aban amǝtǝmbu andǝ amǝ'ɓealɓikea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" /><char style="wj">Wu duk amǝ sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr, kǝla mǝnana Tár wun ngga ndanǝ mǝsǝswatǝr ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu kǝa tsǝki kǝɓwa cau <optbreak /> arǝì ɗang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matiu 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <char style="wj">Wu kǝa wu sǝn cauɓikea mala aɓwana ɗang, sǝ wun gbal ka à pà nǝ̀ sǝn cauɓikea ma'wun ɗàng. Wu kǝa ɓashi aɓwana ɗàng, sǝ à pà nǝ̀ ɓashia wun gbal ɗàng. Wu twalbani, sǝ à nǝ̀ twala wun banì.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" /><char style="wj">Wu pǎ, sǝ à nǝ̀ pà wun gbal. Kārè mǝɓoarne mǝnana à pàrrí, sǝ à dǝkǝri kǝ sukki ka, nda à nǝ̀ solǝa wun ngga. Acemǝnana tasau mana wu kārǝia aɓwana nǝi ka, kǝ nda à nǝ̀ kārǝa wun nǝi ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu nyare nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 6:39">
    <char style="wj">Nte nǝ̀ gandǝ bwalì nte gara le? Yia kǝm ngga à pà nǝ̀ kpa a tūli re?</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6:39 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref>
      </char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><char style="wj">Mǝ'eaulǝki gìr ka kútí malǝm male ɗàng. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana à kanǝnì wi gìr pepè ka, nǝ̀ pa kǝla malǝm male.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoh 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />
    <char style="wj">Palang sǝ mǝsǝo ueo arǝ kǝkar mǝnana a mǝsǝ ɓio ka, sǝ a tsǝkiro arǝ gbǝlang nggun mǝnana a mò yì mǝsǝu ka ɗàng?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" /><char style="wj">Palang sǝ awu nǝ ne mǝ'eambo ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ'eambǝam, came mǝ pyaupo kǝkar mǝnana a mǝsǝo ka,&gt;&gt; yi mǝnana a gandǝ sǝn gbǝlang nggun mana a mò yì mǝsǝu raka? We mǝ'swarki ɓamuru! Pusǝ gbǝlang nggun mǝnana a mǝsǝo ka peatu, sǝ a nǝ gandǝ sǝnban pepè mǝnana a nǝ pyau kǝkar mǝnana a mǝsǝ ɓio ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">À kǝ súrǝ̀ nggun arǝ ɓǝle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matiu 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />
    <char style="wj">Nggun mǝɓoarne pà nǝ̀ pusǝ ɓǝle mǝɓane ɗàng. Sǝ nggun mǝɓane pà nǝ̀ pusǝ ɓǝle mǝɓoarne gbal ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" /><char style="wj">Koya nggun ngga à kǝ súrǝì arǝ ɓǝle. Aɓwana kǝ tūki ɓǝla-vwari arǝ nggun-zwe ɗang, ko ɓǝla-nɓau aɓalǝa ankwarki ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝɓoarne ka, mǝɓoarne mǝnana lùmsǝ ɓabumi ka, nda kǝ puro a kúni ka. Sǝ ɓwa mǝɓane ka kǝ pusǝ mǝɓane mǝnana lùmsǝ ɓabumi ka. Gìr mǝnana lùmsǝ ɓabum ɓwa ka, nda kǝ pur a kúni ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat 12:33</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:34">34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ amǝɓa ɓari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matiu 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <char style="wj">Ace mana sǝ wu kǝ tunǝam ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, Mǝtalabangŋo,&gt;&gt; sǝ wu kǝ pak gìr mǝnana ǝn bangga wun ngga ɗàng?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" /><char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana kǝ yiu abanam, kǝ kwakikiri arǝ cau mem, sǝ kǝ tsǝi aɓa túró ka, mǝ nǝ lǝmdǝa wun lang sǝ ɓwe pa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" /><char style="wj">Yì ka, nda kǝla ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ ɓak ɓala male ka, tǝm tūli mǝlime, sǝ kwakita kusǝɓǎ amur tali. Lang mùr longŋa yiu akiban ngga, mùrɓangŋa yi wal ɓǎ man, sǝ ko dǝurǝ ɗang, acemǝnana à kwákítè amur tali.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana ok cau mem sǝ tsǝi aɓa túró raka, nda kǝla ɓwa mǝnana ɓak ɓala amur sala, ko tǝm kusǝì raka. Lang mùrɓangŋa yi wal mǝnia yì ɓala ka, kara ɓala kanggia kpa gbǝrǝrǝm.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Gūliarǝu mala ɓwamǝgule soje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matiu 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Lang Yesu malǝna banggi aɓwana amǝnia yì acau ka, pǝlǝa kutio o a Kapanahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Aɓa mǝnia yì la ka guro mala ɓe ɓwamǝgule soje mala amǝ Roma, mǝnana earkiyi ace raka, nongkwánó yi bwal kun-lú. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Sǝ lang ɓwamǝgule soje man ok ce Yesu, túr aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ Yahudi a baní, ɓǝà zǝmbi wi ɓǝ̀ yiu ɓǝ̀ yi twali guro male ban rǝkwana. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />À yiu a ban Yesu à yì zǝmbi wi nǝ ɓabumia mwashat ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia yì ɓwa ka ɓoaro wu bwalì wi kàm! <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Yì ka, kǝ earce nzali ma'sǝm, ɗǝm ngga ɓakka sǝm Ndakpapi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu pǝlǝa bwal njargula aban ká andǝia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Gbàshìnà ban ɓala ka, ɓwamǝgule soje man túr agyajam male ɓǝà ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, kǝa pè ɓamuro tanni ɗang, acemǝnana ǝn kārǝa wu kutio a ɓala mem ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Sǝ ǝn sǝni ka ǝn kārǝa mǝ nǝ ká a bano ɗàng. Bangcau àkǝ̀ ban mǝnana a ndakam ngga, sǝ guro mem nǝ̀ kum rǝcandǝa. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Acemǝnana mim nǝ ɓamúràm ngga, mǝ nda aɓata ɓwa, nǝ asoje a ɓatam. Ɓǝ̀ ǝn ne man ama, &lt;O&gt; ka, nǝ̀ ká, sǝ ɓǝ̀ ǝn ne ɓwa mǝno ama, &lt;Yiu&gt; ka, nǝ̀ yiu gbal. Ɓǝ̀ ǝn ne guro mem ama, &lt;Pak mǝnia ka&gt; nǝ̀ pè.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Lang Yesu ok man yì cau ka, ndali kǝ̀rkǝ́r, pǝlǝ rǝì aban ɓwabundǝa mǝnana à kǝ yiu atè ka, nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ na wun, ǝn malaká kum gūliarǝu mǝgule ulang man aɓa nzali Isǝrayila ɗang!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Lang aɓwana mǝnana à túriá à nyarǝna a ɓala ka, à kya kum guro man, rǝì bǎng.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu loasǝ lú-muna mala mā-lú</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />A nzǝmi bǝti ka, Yesu o a la mǝnana à tunǝki ama Nayi ka. Alaggana male andǝ aɓwabundǝa kǝ̀rkǝ́r o atè. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Lang gbàshìnà kun la ka, à je andǝ aɓea ɓwana mǝnana à twalǝna lú-mǝlagga à nǝ̀ nggǝ purni ka. Yì lú ka ndà kǝ̀ muna-ɓwabura mwashat a bu nggè. Sǝ nggè ka mā-lú na. Ɓwabunda pas mǝnana a le ka à puro atè. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Lang Mǝtalabangŋo sǝn ɓwama man ngga, mǝsǝswatǝr male bwali, pǝlǝa ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ce a ɓua ɗang!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Pǝlǝa kutio tsǝk buì arǝ kal-lú. Amǝ twal lú pǝlǝa à cam gǝs. Sǝ Yesu na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Lagga, ǝn nggǝ no ama wu lo!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Lú kara lo dum nǝ do, tita nacau, pǝlǝa Yesu nyesǝi pe nggè.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ko yan ngga gir nî karmuri, pǝlǝa à ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli, à kǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓè mǝɓangnǝa mǝgule pusǝna rǝì aban sǝm. Ɓakuli yina ace amsǝ aɓwana male!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Cau mala gir mǝnia Yesu pe ka, akiban aɓa nzali Yahudi andǝ acili alá mǝnana à kàrì banì ka.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mǝbatisǝma turban atà Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matiu 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Alaggana mala Yohana yi banggi wi agir mǝnana kat Yesu pea ka. Pǝlǝa Yohana tunǝ aɓwana ɓari ateà, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />sǝ tasǝia aban Mǝtalabangŋo ɓǝa kya ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A nda Kǝrǝsti Mǝ'amsǝban, mǝnana sǝm nggǝ kundǝ ka le, ko ɓǝ̀ sǝm kundǝ ɓeɓwa ɗàng?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Lang aɓwana man yina aban Yesu ka, à yì na ama, &lt;&lt;Yohana Mǝbatisǝma túr sǝm a bano, ɓǝ̀ sǝm yì ɗio ama, &lt;A nda Kǝrǝsti Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana sǝm nggǝ kundǝ ka le, ko ɓǝ̀ sǝm kundǝ ɓeɓwa ɗàng?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Àkǝ̀ banì Yesu twalia aɓwana pas ban akwánó andǝ arǝpangŋa malea, pusǝki akukwar arǝ aɓwana, sǝ mǝn mǝsǝ ante. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Pǝlǝa ne aɓwana mǝnana Yohana túriá ka ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu nyare wu kya banggi Yohana agir mǝnana wu sǝn andǝ mǝnana wu ok ka. Ante kǝ sǝnban, aman à gbakǝri a kusǝia ka à lo à kǝ gya, amǝkwánó-dakali ka à kǝ twalia wia ban dakali malea, amǝkir'ara kǝ okban, à kǝ loasǝ alú, sǝ Cau Amsǝban ngga à kǝ hamnǝi a ban amǝ'tǝ̀r.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isha 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" /><char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana makgìr cau mem raka ndanǝ tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Anzǝm o mala aɓwana mǝnana Yohana túriá ka, Yesu tita nea ɓwapǝndǝa acau amur Yohana ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Lang wu puro wu wari a ban Yohana aɓa pǝɗanban a njenza ka, mana gir nì nda wu waria sǝne? Ndǝrdangŋa mǝnana gung kǝ dǝurǝki ka nda le? Awo!</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ nda raka, mana wu waria sǝne? Ɓè ɓwa na mǝnana makki adaura mǝɓoarne arǝì ka le? Awo! Aɓwana mǝnana à makkiyi adaura mǝɓoarne sǝ à nda aɓa banɓoarna mala kume ka, à nda malea a palta.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" /><char style="wj">Sǝ mana wu waria sǝne? Mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli na le? E, ǝn nggǝ na wun, yì ka, kútì mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><char style="wj">Yohana nda ɓwa mǝnana Malǝmce bangcau amurí ama:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt; &lt;Mǝ nǝ tasǝ mǝturonjar mem </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">ɓǝ̀ ako dǝmba,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">mǝnana nǝ̀ gilǝkio njargula</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">sǝ a nǝ yiu ka.&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />
    <char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun, aɓalǝ aɓwana mǝnana kat à ɓǝlia a ɓanza man ngga, kǝɓwa pà kàm kútì Yohana nǝ gulo ɗang. Sǝama ɓwa mǝnana nda mǝkyauwe kat aɓata Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka ndanǝ gulo kútì.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Ɓwapǝndǝa kat, ko nggearǝ amǝ'ak boalo-cemi, lang à oangŋa cau mala Yesu ka, à ear kat ama, njargula mala Ɓakuli ka mǝɓoarne na, acemǝnana Yohana nǝ̀ pakkia wia batisǝma. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Sǝ amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm nggurcau ka à ginǝ kàné mala Ɓakuli mǝnana acea ka, acemǝnana à ɓinǝ ama ɓǝ̀ Yohana ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakkia wia batisǝma ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:29-30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu lidǝmba nǝ cau ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 7:31">
    <char style="wj">Arǝ man sǝ mǝ nǝ kànì aɓwana mǝnana a nza man ngga? À nda kǝla mana?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" /><char style="wj">À nda kǝla amuna mǝnana à do a kun limo, à kǝ akia rǝia cau ama:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt;<char style="wj">Sǝm twangga wun ntetu,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">sǝ wu ta'nggwam ɗang;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">sǝm tuka wun nggyal ɓua-lú,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">sǝ wu ɓua ɗàng!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />
    <char style="wj">Yohana Mǝbatisǝma ka yiu kǝ li nɗǝmo ɗàng, kǝ nu mùr-anap ɗàng. Sǝ wu na ama, &lt;&lt;Ndanǝ kukwar atè.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" /><char style="wj">Muna mala Ɓwa yiu kǝ li, kǝ nu, nyare wu na ama, &lt;&lt;Wu sǝn nggea mǝ'lǐgula, mǝ nukiagir, gyajam mala amǝ'ak boalo-cemi andǝ &lt;amǝ'cauɓikea.&gt; &gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" /><char style="wj">Kat andǝ amani ka sǝlǝe mala Ɓakuli ka, yi lǝmdǝ rǝì mǝsǝcau na aɓalǝ atúró mala aɓwana mǝnana à é ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a ɓala mala Shiman <optbreak /> ɓwa Farisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ɓè ɓwa aɓalǝ amǝ Farisi tunǝ Yesu arǝ girlina pwarikpǝra. Pǝlǝa Yesu wari a ɓala mala ɓwa Farisi man kya do aban li. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />A là mǝno ka ɓè ɓwama nda kam mǝnana à súrǝì nǝ do aɓa cauɓikea, mā-gyatarǝu na ka. Lang ok ama Yesu nda ban li a ɓala mala ɓwa Farisi ka, yiu nǝ muna-dù mǝ'ɓoarjamnì mana à lumsǝì nǝ mùrú mǝ'rǝmɓoarne, mana kúrè candǝ ka. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Yiu yi kūndǝ nǝ ban akusǝ Yesu a nzǝmi, sǝ kǝ ɓua; liu anzǝm kusǝ Yesu nǝ mǝrǝm, esǝkia nǝ nyang múrí, sǝ kùria arǝì nǝ abui; camarǝ jeki akusǝ Yesu tùtù nǝ mburkuni, sǝ kǝ hasǝia nǝ mùrú mǝ'rǝmɓoarne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mat 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mar 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh 12:3</ref></char>.</note> <figure style="fig" alt="A woman wipes Jesus' feet with her hair." file="WA03839b.tif" size="col" loc="LUK 7:38" copy="Graham Wade" ref="7:38">Ɓwama esǝki Yesu akusǝi nǝ nyang múrí.</figure><verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ɓwa Farisi mǝnana tunǝ Yesu arǝ girlina ka sǝn mǝnia ka. Pǝlǝa na nǝ ɓabumi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa man ngga mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli na ka, ɓǝ́ súrǝ́nà rǝ ɓwa mǝnana jekiyi rǝì, sǝ koya ulang ɓwama nda man ngga, acemǝnana mǝ'cauɓikea na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu eari wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Shiman, mǝ ndanǝ cau mǝnana mǝ nǝ no ka.&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Pǝlǝa pe eare ama, &lt;&lt;Nam ce, Malǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓè ɓwa kǝ kpata aɓwana ɓari tangna. Ɓwa mwashat ka ak mǝsǝboalo gbǝman-tongno, sǝ ɓeɓwa ka lumi-tongno nda ak ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" /><char style="wj">Yia kǝm ngga à gandǝ mbwe ka tangna man ɗang. Mǝpa-tangna pǝlǝa twalia wia ban mǝno yì atangna ka. Sǝ ado ka yana aɓalǝia nǝ̀ earce nǝ̀ kutibanì?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Shiman eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;A sǝne mem ngga ɓwa mǝnana tangna male kpǝm sǝ à twali wi banì ka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yàwá! A nani pepè.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Pǝlǝa pǝlǝ rǝì a ban ɓwama man, sǝ ne Shiman ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;A sǝn mǝnia yì ɓwama ka? Ən kutio a ɓala mo, a pam mur lákkí akusǝu ɗang. Sǝ ɓwama man ngga liupam akusǝam nǝ mǝrǝm male. Sǝ kǝ esǝkia nǝ nyang muri.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" /><char style="wj">A gingsǝam nǝ nu kunam ɗàng, sǝ mǝnia yì ɓwama ka, kutio mem mǝni ɗār ka, ko aulǝa tù kúni arǝ nu ka kusǝam ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" /><char style="wj">A hasǝam mùrú a ɓamuram ɗàng, sǝ yì ka, hasǝam mùrú mǝ'rǝmɓoarne arǝ akusǝam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" /><char style="wj">Ace mani ka, ǝn nggǝ banggo, earcearǝu male mana gul kpǝm ngga, lǝmdǝ ama, acauɓikea mǝgule male ka à twalǝni wi bania kat. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana à twali wi banì bǝti ka, earcearǝu male gbal ka nda bǝti.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu pǝlǝa ne ɓwama mǝno ka ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;À twalǝno ban acauɓikea mo.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Acili aɓwana mǝnana a ban li ka, a tita nea rǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Man yì ɓwa ka nda yana, mǝnana kǝ gandǝ twalban cauɓikea ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Pǝlǝa Yesu ne ɓwama mǝno ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Paɓamuru mô amsǝno; o atà dorǝpwala mô.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Amamǝna mana à pe Yesu <optbreak /> gbasha ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Tù anzǝm man ngga Yesu gya arǝ alá mǝgulke andǝ amuna-là ɗàngɗáng aban hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli. Alaggana male man lum-nong-ɓari ka, à nda atè. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Mat 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mar 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luk 23:49</ref></char>.</note> Aɓea mamǝna mǝnana à pusǝ akukwar arǝia sǝ à twalia wia ban arǝkwana ka, à nda gbal atè. Amǝnia yì amamǝna ka à nda ka Maryamu (mǝnana à tunǝki ama Ɓwa Magdala), mana à pusǝ akukwar tongno-nong-ɓari arǝì ka, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />andǝ Joana mālá Kuza, mǝnana kǝ ɗenyi nǝ ɓala mala Murǝm Hirǝdus ka, sǝ Suzana andǝ acilia pas. À kǝ pakki Yesu andǝ alaggana male gbasha nǝ agirkuma malea.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ mǝɓeale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matiu 13:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Lang ɓwabundǝa na arǝ ramba sǝ aɓwana na rǝ purkio arǝ alá ɗàngɗáng aban yiu aban Yesu ka, Yesu pǝlǝa nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓè mǝ'rya wari a ɓeale. Nda ban kok mǝsǝɓeale ka, aɓea sukkio amur njargula. Aɓwana parkia a ɓakusǝia sǝ amuna-nyal mana a kùli ka à yì tarkia.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" /><char style="wj">Aɓea sukkio amur tali, lang à purna ka kara à ime, acemǝnana à kum banpwala ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" /><char style="wj">Aman sukkio aɓalǝ azwe, sǝ à gulo andǝia ka, kara zwe sorǝkia.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" /><char style="wj">Sǝ aman ngga à sukkio amur nzali mǝɓoarne. À puro, à gulo, à kya ɓǝla, komǝyenani ka pusǝ ɓǝle kútì mǝnana à ɓeali ka kusǝ gbǝman.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu bangŋǝna mǝnia yì cau ka, pǝlǝa loasǝ gi na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝ kir okban ngga ɓǝ̀ ǒ.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝngi ɓá kanicau mala mǝɓeale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-12">Matiu 13:10-12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Markus 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:18-23">13:18-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Alaggana mala Yesu ɗì ama, mana nda ɓá mǝnia yì kanicau ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">Wun ngga à pana wun súrǝ̀ gir ɓá sǝmbǝrǝa mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli. Sǝ mala acili aɓwana ka, ǝn nggǝ nea wia nǝ kanicau ace mǝnana ɓǝà lùmsǝ cau ɓá Malǝmce mǝnana ama:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;À nǝ̀ soa mǝsǝia, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">sǝ à pà nǝ̀ sǝn kǝgìr ɗàng;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">À nǝ̀ kwaki kiria aban okban,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">sǝ ce pà nǝ̀ kpakia wia ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isha 6:9</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />
    <char style="wj">Mǝnia ka ndà ɓá man yì kanicau: Mǝsǝɓeale ka nda cau mala Ɓakuli.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" /><char style="wj">Amǝsǝɓeale mǝnana à kpa mur njargula ka, à nda ka aɓwana mǝnana à ǒ, sǝ Shetan yiu yi pwan cau mǝnana a ɓabumia ka, ace mǝnana ɓǝà kǝa pà ɓamuria ɓǝà kum àwá ka ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" /><char style="wj">Amǝnana à kpa amur tali ka, à nda ka aɓwana mǝnana à ok cau ka, à é nǝ bumpwasǝa, sǝ cau kum kutio a ɓabumia ɗàng. Paɓamuru malea ka banì sau ɗang, pwari kārǝkiban yiu ka kara à kpa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" /><char style="wj">Amǝsǝɓeale mǝnana à kpa aɓalǝ azwe ka, à nda ka aɓwana mǝnana à ak cau mala Ɓakuli, sǝ nǝnzǝ́mò ka aɗenyicau mala doɓanza andǝ alta kume, sǝ bumpina arǝ kum banɓoarnado mala gìr ɓanza, yi tsǝia ko à ɓǝl ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" /><char style="wj">Sǝ amǝsǝɓeale mǝnana a nzali mǝɓoarne ka, à nda ka aɓwana mǝnana à ok cau sǝ à bwali nǝ ɓabum mǝɓoarne mǝɓafoe ka. À lidǝmba aɓa gandǝrǝu, sǝ cau pusǝ ɓealu mǝɓoarne aɓalǝia.</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ pitǝla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Markus 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa pà nǝ̀ tsǝk bǝsa a pitǝla sǝ nǝ̀ kùmsǝi wi nkenye amurí, ko nǝ̀ oasǝi a tǝta gado ɗàng. Nǝ̀ gyari a kùli ace aɓwana mǝnana à nǝ̀ kútí ka ɓǝà sǝn tǎlaban.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:16 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11:33</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />
    <char style="wj">Kǝgìr pà kàm a sǝmbǝrǝa mǝnana à pà nǝ̀ pusǝ ce raka, sǝ kǝgìr pà kàm mǝnana à nǝ̀ gir ce, mǝnana à pà nǝ̀ súrǝì ko tè pà nǝ̀ pur raka.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />
    <char style="wj">Wu tsǝkiru arǝ gir mǝnana wu kǝ ok ka. Ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝi ka, à nǝ̀ tsǝki wi ɓe amurí. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana pànǝi raka, ko mǝnana kǝ sǝni kǝla ndanǝi ka, à nǝ̀ é arǝì.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nggea Yesu andǝ amǝ'eambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matiu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Markus 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Pǝlǝa nggea Yesu andǝ amǝ'eambi yiu a baní, sǝ ace làkkì mala aɓwana ka à bwal bani ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Pǝlǝa ɓeɓwa ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Nggo andǝ amǝ'eambo ka, à nda ban came a nza, à kǝ earce sǝno.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nggem andǝ amǝ'eambam ngga, à nda ka ɓwana mǝnana à kǝ ok cau mala Ɓakuli sǝ à kǝ tsǝi aɓa túró ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tamsǝ nggea gung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matiu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Markus 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />A ɓè pwari mwashat Yesu ne alaggana male ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu fani sǝm nǝ̀ eauwe a ɓè nkaring nggeamùr.&gt;&gt;</char> Pǝlǝa à eauwe a waru aban ká. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />À nda rǝ o ka, Yesu koa ntulo. Kara nggea gung mǝcandǝe longŋǝna ɓua a nggeamùr, ɓǝ́ kongsǝna waru. Yia ka à nda aɓa nggea tanni mǝgule.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Alaggana wario à kya loasǝkì a ntulo ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, Ɓwamǝgule, sǝm ndo sǝm nǝ̀ ko!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu lo pǝlǝa sà arǝ gung andǝ mur mǝnana gung kǝ loasǝki ka. Kara gung kur kǝkǝs, ban nyare pwal ɗǝong. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu pǝlǝa ɗì alaggana male ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Gūliarǝui ma'wun nda ke?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ɓangciu pakkia wia, à ndali pǝlǝa à ɗì rǝarǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ya ɓwa nda man, mǝnana sa arǝ gung andǝ mur, pǝlǝa à oki wi ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pusǝ kukwar arǝ ɓeɓwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matiu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Markus 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu andǝ alaggana male samsǝa à yàllî nggeamùr Galili à kya kpasha a bu-nzali mala amǝ Gerasin. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Lang Yesu nǝ̀ eauwe a nza ka, kara ɓè ɓwabura ndya, mǝnana ndanǝ akukwar arǝì ka. Ɓwabure pur amǝno yì la ka. Ɓwabure ka banì sauwuna oasǝ agir-nggūrǝu arǝì ɗàng, sǝ dukiyi a ɓala ɗàng, akiyi rǝì aɓalǝ aɓembe. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Lang nǝ̀ sǝn Yesu ka, kara mak'zwalo bàng-bàng, yi kpa a ɓadǝmbi, loasǝ gi kǝ̀rkǝ́r ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ǝn pakko, Yesu, Muna mala Ɓakuli mana Karban kat ka? Ən nggǝ zǝmbo, kǝa pam tanni ɗàng!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ne anggo acemǝnana Yesu angŋǝna dǝmba sàrǝ̀nà amǝnia yì akukwar ka ɓǝà purî rǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka. Kusǝ pas ka abangŋo mǝɓane man kǝ lo arǝì. Sǝ kat andǝ amani ama aɓwana nǝ̀ taka akusǝi andǝ abui nǝ anko andǝ ansolo, sǝ à nǝ̀ tamsǝ aɓwana ɓǝà yállí ka, nǝ̀ kasǝki ansolo, nǝ̀ ɓungia anko. Pǝlǝa akukwar nǝ̀ um nǝi a ɓabondo.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu ɗì ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Lùllǝò a mana?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Pǝlǝa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Lullǝam nda Pas.&gt;&gt; Bang anggo acemǝnana akukwar pas sǝ à kùtí a rǝì. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Akukwar nì camarǝ zǝmbi Yesu ama ɓǝ̀ kǝa tasǝia aɓa tūli-tàtǝkǝtè<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tūli-tàtǝkǝtè: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tūli mǝnana lime male ka masǝlǝate pà kàm ɗang. Nda ban mǝnana à kǝ kasǝ kun akukwar kam à kǝ pea wia tanni ka.</char></note>, yì tūli-bǝsa ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />A girǝi bania anggo ka, nggea domwan mala atǝmbǝrǝm-ɓala ndakam, aban likiali a bum-nkono. Akukwar nì zǝmbi Yesu ama ɓǝ̀ earia wia ɓǝà kya kutio arǝ atǝmbǝrǝm-ɓala mǝno, pǝlǝa earia wia ɓǝà kyane. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Lang akukwar purî rǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka, à kya kutio arǝ atǝmbǝrǝm-ɓala. Kara domwan man kat giɓi nǝ mire a pal nkono à kya ɓunno a kun gwanyi mǝ'dāhre, à sukkio aɓa anggeamùr, à ko kat à wu mbǝtǝp.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Lang amǝ'yál atǝmbǝrǝm-ɓala sǝn gìr mǝnana kumban ngga, à sarǝa mire aban o, à kya bangce a la andǝ acilia ban aɓa bu-nzali mǝno. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ɓwabunda puro aban ká sǝn gìr mǝnana kumban ngga. Lang à yina a ban Yesu ka, à yì kum mǝnia yì ɓwa mǝnana akukwar purî rǝì ka, aban do a ɓadǝm Yesu nǝ agir-nggūrǝu arǝì, ɗenyicau male nyarǝna arǝì, sǝ ɓangciu pakkia wia.<verse eid="LUK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Aɓwana mǝno à sǝn gir nî nǝ mǝsǝia ka, à kanî aɓwana ce pusǝo mǝnana à pusǝ akukwar arǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ɓwabunda mǝnana kat a bu-nzali mǝno mala amǝ Gerasin ngga, à zǝmbi Yesu ama ɓǝ̀ upi nzali malea, acemǝnana ɓangciu pakkia wia kǝ̀rkǝ́r.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:37">Lang Yesu eauwe a waru, nǝ̀ nyare nǝ̀ o ka, <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />ɓwa mǝnana akukwar purî rǝì ka zǝmbi wi ama, nǝ̀ o atè. Sǝ Yesu ɓinǝe, ne wi ama, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" /><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nyare a la ma'wun kya na ce nggea gìr mǝgule mǝnana Ɓakuli pakko wi ka.&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Pǝlǝa mǝnia yì ɓwa ka nyare o a la malea, camarǝ bang ce gìr mǝnana Yesu pakki wi ka.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muna Jarus andǝ ɓwama <optbreak /> mǝ rǝkwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matiu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Markus 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Lang Yesu nyarǝna ka, ɓwabundǝa gingsǝi, acemǝnana à nda ban kundǝe. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Pǝlǝa ɓeɓwa, lùllǝì ama Jarus, ɓwamǝgule mala Ndakpapi, yiu yi kpa a ɓadǝm Yesu, kǝ ɓuakia rǝì ama ɓǝ̀ yiu atè a ɓala male, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />acemǝnana kǝ mǝɓoarnsarile mwashat ɓǝ̀rɓǝ̀r, mǝnana ndanǝ apǝlǝa lum-nong-ɓari ka, kúni malanǝ̀ kùmsǝó.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu bwalǝna njargula aban ká, ɓwabundǝa mǝnana lo atè ka nggiki kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ɓè ɓwama nda aɓalǝia, mǝnana pak apǝlǝa lum-nong-ɓari nkila na aban sukkio arǝì. Mal girkuma male a ban amǝ'sonzǝo, sǝ kǝɓwa gandǝ sonzǝe ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ɓwama man kar nǝ nzǝm Yesu, je kun daura male, anggo ka kara sukkio mala nkila male came.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu ɗiban ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yana ɓwe jem?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Koyan ngga na ama ndà ɗang. Pǝlǝa Bitǝrus na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, ɓwabundǝa kārǝio aɓalǝu, sǝ à kǝ ramgio, sǝ a kǝ ɗiban ama, &lt;Yana ɓwe jem?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Sǝ Yesu ka bang ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓè ɓwa jenam, ǝn sǝlǝa, acemǝnana ǝn ok rǝcandǝa puro arǝàm.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Lang ɓwama man sǝnǝni te ndo nǝ̀ pur ka, puro rǝì kǝ ɓǝla, yi kpa a ɓadǝm Yesu. A ɓamǝsǝ ɓwabundǝa kat, bang tǝr gir mana tsǝi sǝ je Yesu, andǝ kúmó mǝnana kum rǝpwala àkǝ̀ banì ka. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Sǝ Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓoarnsarilem, gūliarǝu mô arǝàm twalǝno ban rǝkwana mò, o aɓa rǝpwala.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu na arǝ nacau più ka, ɓeɓwa pur nǝ ɓala mala Jarus, yì ɓwamǝgule mala Ndakpapi. Yi ne Jarus ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓoarnsarileo pangŋǝna lú. Kǝa pe Malǝm tanni ɓà ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Lang Yesu ok ce ka, ne Jarus ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakko ɗàng, we ka tamsǝ ɓabumo, rǝ munio nǝ̀ malâ.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Lang à yì bwalǝna ɓala mala Jarus ka, Yesu eari kǝɓwa kutio atè ɗàng, she kǝ Bitǝrus, sǝ Yohana andǝ Jemis, sǝ tár muna andǝ ngge. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Anggo ka ɓwapǝndǝa kat à nda rǝ ɓua sǝ à kǝ keban ace. Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu kǝa ɓua ɗàng, muna ka wu ɗàng, nda a ntulo!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Kara à oali oalo kyauwikiban, acemǝnana à sǝlǝna ama muna ka wuna. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Pǝlǝa Yesu bwal muna a garabui, sǝ na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Munem, lo!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Yilǝmi muna kara nyare, sǝ par buì lo cam nǝ came. Yesu pǝlǝa nea wia ama, ɓǝà pe wi girlina ɓǝ̀ li. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Atár muna andǝ ngge ndali kǝ̀rkǝ́r. Pǝlǝa Yesu nunkiria, ama ɓǝà kǝa ne kǝɓwa ce gìr mǝnana kumban ngga ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu túr alaggana male <optbreak /> lum-nong-ɓari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matiu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Markus 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu tunǝ amǝ'mishan male mǝnana lum-nong-ɓari ka, sǝ pea wia rǝcandǝa andǝ gara amur akukwar kat sǝ ɓǝa twalban rǝkwana. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Pǝlǝa tasǝia ɓǝa kya hamnǝ ce Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli, sǝ ɓǝa twali aɓwana ban rǝkwana. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Atúró 13:51</ref></char>.</note> Nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu kǝa twal kǝgìr a bu wun ace gya ma'wun ɗàng. Wu kǝa twal gara-gya, ko luru, ko girlina, ko boalo, ko aɓea agir-nggūrǝu ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" /><char style="wj">Koya ɓala wu sulǝ kam ngga, wu kǝa ɗeki ɓalae ɗàng, she ɓǝ̀ wu nyìngŋǝ̀nà le ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ aɓwana ak wun raka, ɓǝ̀ wun nǝ̀ nying le ka wu kǝtǝri tú mǝnana a kusǝ wun ngga, acemǝnana ɓǝ̀ nakún wun amúrià.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Pǝlǝa à lo à ara arǝ amuna-là aban hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban andǝ twali aɓwana ban rǝkwana a koya ban.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hirǝdus ndali nǝ acau <optbreak /> mana oki ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matiu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Markus 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Hirǝdus, murǝm Galili ok ce agir mǝnana à kǝ pak kat ka, muri zurǝì, acemǝnana aɓea aɓwana kǝ̀ na ama, Yohana nda à loasǝi a ɓembe ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Aɓea ɓwana ka à kǝ na ama Iliya mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli nda yi pusǝrǝi ka, nyare aɓea ka ama, ɓekǝ mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli mǝnana a pwarian ngga nda long nǝ yilǝmu ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Hirǝdus ka bang ama, &lt;&lt;Yohana ka ǝn tsǝa à kasǝ meali, sǝ yana ɓwe nda mǝnia ɗǝm ǝn nggǝ oki amǝnia yia acau amurí ka?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa alta sǝn Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu li nǝ aɓwana á-tongno</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matiu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Markus 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Lang amǝ'mishan nyarǝna ka, à yì banggi Yesu agir mǝnana kat à pak ka. Pǝlǝa umia, yia nǝmurǝia, a ɓè la mǝnana à kǝ tunǝi ama Beseda ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ɓwabunda ok ce, kara à pwan rǝia à o atè. Yesu gingsǝia, sǝ nea wia cau amur Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli, sǝ aɓwana mǝnana à yiu sǝ à nda aɓa rǝkwana ka, twalia wia ban arǝkwana malea.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Lang pwari mala nǝ̀ kpa ka, alaggana mala Yesu man lum-nong-ɓari ka, à sungŋo a baní à yì ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɗeki ɓwabundǝa ɓǝa o arǝ amuna-là, ɓǝa kya alta girlina andǝ ban nongŋo, acemǝnana ban mǝnia sǝm ndakam ngga ɓabondo na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Sǝ Yesu ka nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu pea wia girlina ɓǝa li.&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Pǝlǝa à ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝgìr mǝnana sǝm ndanǝi ka, kǝ bǝredi tongno nda andǝ amǝnji ɓari. She ɓǝ̀ do ama ɓǝ̀ sǝm kya kur girlina ace ɓwabundǝa man kat ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Aburana mǝnana a banì ka à bwal á-tongno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Pǝlǝa Yesu ne alaggana male ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu tsǝia ɓǝa do mbop-mbop lumi-tongno-tongno.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Anggo sǝ alaggana tsǝia, koyana le ka dum nǝ do. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu twal abǝredi mǝnia tongno andǝ anji ɓari ka, pǝlǝa loasǝ múrí a kùli pak yàwá, sǝ ɓwanggia, pè alaggana male ɓǝà gaki ɓwabundǝa. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Yia kat à li à ɗǝmngya. Alaggana pwan cili aɓwangine mǝnana à ueo ka arǝ azace lum-nong-ɓari.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cau mǝnana Bitǝrus na <optbreak /> amur Yesu ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matiu 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Markus 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ɓè pwari ndakam Yesu ka nda ban pak hiwi nǝmurǝì, sǝ alaggana male yiu atè, pǝlǝa ɗia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓwabunda kǝ na ama, Mǝ nda yana?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />À eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Aɓea ɓwana ama a nda Yohana Mǝbatisǝma, aɓea ka ama a nda Iliya, mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli, sǝ aɓea ka ama a nda ɓè mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli atà mǝnana a pwarian ngga, mǝnana nyare yiu nǝ yilǝmu ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mar 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luk 9:7-8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu nyare ɗia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Sǝ wun, a bangŋe ma'wun ngga, mǝ nda yana?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Bitǝrus eare ama, &lt;&lt;A nda Kǝrǝsti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mezaya.&gt;&gt;</char></note> Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana Ɓakuli turi ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Yoh 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ce tanni andǝ lú male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matiu 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Markus 8:30--9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu nunkiria nǝ rǝcandǝa ama, ɓǝa kǝa ne kǝɓwa ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Pǝlǝa na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Dumǝna púp Muna mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ kum tanni arǝ agir pas, sǝ akapana, andǝ agbani pǝris, andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau ka à nǝ̀ ɓinǝi. À nǝ̀ wal-luí, sǝ aɓa tàruià nongŋo ka nǝ̀ lo nǝ yilǝmu.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Pǝlǝa nea aɓwana kat ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat kǝ earce yiu atàm ngga, nǝ̀ ɓinǝ ɓamúrì,</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nǝ̀ ɓinǝ ɓamúrì: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;nǝ̀ būrǝce ɓamúrì.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <char style="wj">nǝ̀ twal nggun-gangndǝi male ko aya pwari ka nǝ̀ kpatam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana kǝ earce amsǝ yilǝmi ka, nǝ̀ ɗwanyibanì, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana turta yilǝmi acem ngga, nǝ̀ amsǝi.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh 12:25</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" /><char style="wj">Mana gir nì nǝ̀ purî ɓwa yi mǝnana ɓǝ̀ kum ɓanza kat, sǝ ɗwanyi yilǝmi ko yilǝmi kiɗiki ka?</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ kǝsǝkya kǝ pakki ɓwa arǝàm sǝ arǝ cau mem ngga, kǝsǝkya nǝ̀ pakki Muna mala Ɓwa arǝì, a pwari mǝnana nǝ̀ yiu nǝi, aɓa ɓoarɓwa male andǝ ɓoarɓwa mala Tárrí andǝ mala amǝturonjar mǝfele ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar 8:38</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ bangga wun mǝsǝcau, aɓea ɓwana mǝnana à nda ban came kani ka, à pà nǝ̀ wu ɗàng, she ɓǝà sǝnǝna Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nggaɗirǝu mala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matiu 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Markus 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Bit 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char>.</note> Kǝla anzǝm nongŋo tongno-nong-tàrú, mǝnana Yesu nakiyi acau man ngga, tunǝ Bitǝrus andǝ Yohana andǝ Jemis, pǝlǝa à eauwe amur ɓe nkono ace pak hiwi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Lang nda rǝ pak hiwi ka, ɓamǝsǝi twalo nggaɗi, sǝ agir-nggūrǝu male ka à pwasǝ tyal-tyal, kǝla linzama mala tǎlaban. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Kara aɓwana ɓari, Musa andǝ Iliya yiu, à kǝ nacau nǝi. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />À pusǝ rǝia aɓa ɓoarɓwa mala kùli, aban nacau andǝ Yesu. À bang cau amur lú male, mǝnana nǝ̀ yia lùmsǝo a Urǝshalima ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Sǝ Bitǝrus andǝ aɓi ka à kongŋa malea a nggea ntulo. Lang mǝsǝia nǝ̀ sa ka, à sǝn ɓoarɓwa mala Yesu andǝ aɓwana mǝnia ɓari aban came andǝi ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Lang amǝnia yì aɓwana nda ban nying Yesu à nǝ̀ o ka, Bitǝrus pǝlǝa ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, ndanǝ ɓoaro mǝnana sǝm nda kani ka. Sǝm nǝ̀ gilǝ agumli tàrú, mwashat ka nda aceo, mwashat ace Musa, sǝ mǝnia mwashat ka nda ace Iliya.&gt;&gt; Sǝ yì ka, súrǝ̀ cau mǝnana nakiyi ka ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Nda aban nacau più ka, pǝrɓang sulǝo gìr múrià, pǝlǝa ɓangciu pakkia wia mǝnana pǝrɓang yi gìr múrià ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Gì Ɓakuli pur nǝ ɓá pǝrɓang na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka Munem na, nda mǝnana ǝn tarì ka, wu kwakikir wun arǝì.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isha 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Lang giu nanacau ka, kara à sǝn Yesu nǝmurǝì. Alaggana man bwal ce arǝarǝia, à ne kǝɓwa ce gir mǝnana à sǝn aɓalǝ anongge ka ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pusǝ kukwar arǝ muna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matiu 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Markus 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ban fana ka, lang Yesu andǝ alaggana mǝnia tàrú sùlǝ́nì múr nkono ka, ɓwabundǝa yiu rambǝa a ban Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ɓè ɓwa aɓa ɓwabundǝa loasǝ gì ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm! Ən nggǝ zǝmbo, ɓwamur munem, nda kǝ̀ munem mwashat! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Ɓè bangŋo mǝɓane kǝ lo à rǝì, sǝ kǝ tsǝì kǝ yasǝlǝban nǝ mak'zwalo bàng-bàng. Kǝ turi aɓa dǝurǝki rǝì wak gandǝa ntāra nǝ̀ gupi a kúni. Kani lo arǝì anggo, pà nǝ̀ eare nǝ̀ nyi ɗàng she ɓǝ̀ sokkina te pà nî tanni kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ən zǝmbi alaggana mô ɓǝà pusǝì, sǝ à gandǝi ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Sǝ Yesu pǝlǝia wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wun a nza man ngga wu nda wu pak murcandǝa sǝ wu ɗwanyi paɓamuru a ban Ɓakuli ka! Banem nǝ̀ sau lang aban do sǝnǝa wun sǝ wun nǝ̀ kànì pak ɓè kǝgìr? Nǝ̀ ngga ká a ya pwari sǝ mǝ nǝ nggǝ twal gandǝrǝu nǝ wun?&gt;&gt;</char> Pǝlǝa ne ɓwabure ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yinǝ munio kani.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Lang muna longŋǝna aban yiu ka, kara kukwar loasǝi gwarrì a nzali, turi aɓa mǝɓulɓul mǝ'kǝ̀rkǝ́r nì. Pǝlǝa Yesu pyau kukwar, kukwar purî rǝ muna, sǝ Yesu nyesǝì pè tárrí. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Yia kat ka à ndali nǝ gulo mala rǝcandǝa mala Ɓakuli.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu na ce lú male ɗǝm</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matiu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Markus 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Lang ɓwabundǝa kat nda rǝ ndali nǝ agir mǝnana Yesu pè ka, ne alaggana male ama, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" /><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu kwaki kir wun arǝ cau mǝnana mǝ nǝ bangga wun ado ka: Muna mala Ɓwa ka à ndo à nǝ̀ me a ɓabù aɓwana amǝɓinǝ mǝsǝì.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Sǝ alaggana ka à súrǝ̀ ɓá mǝnia yì cau ka ɗàng. Ceì sǝmbǝrǝia wia à gandǝ bwalte ɗàng, sǝ ɓangciu pakkia wia ɓǝa ɗì amurí.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yana nda ɓwamǝgule kat?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matiu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Markus 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Makgìr lo aɓalǝ alaggana mala Yesu amur koyana aɓalǝia nda ɓwamǝgule kat. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu súrǝ́nà ɗenyicau malea, pǝlǝa loasǝ ɓè muna tamsǝi a nkanggari,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh 13:20</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />sǝ nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Koyana sǝ ɓǝ̀ ak muna kǝla mǝnia ace lullǝam ngga, angŋǝnam, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana em ngga, angŋǝna Tárrám mǝnana tasǝam ngga. Ɓwa mǝnana kutibanì kat a nongsǝmúrû aɓalǝ wun ngga, nda ɓwamǝgule ma'wun kat.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓwa mana camba wun a <optbreak /> nggaro raka ma'wun na</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Markus 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Pǝlǝa Yohana ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, sǝm sǝn ɓeɓwa aban pusǝ akukwar nǝ lùllǝò sǝ sǝm ne wi ɓǝ̀ came, ɓǝ̀ kǝa pè ɗàng, acemǝnana pà aɓalǝ sǝm ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu kǝa tamsǝi ɗàng, ɓwa mǝnana pà a nggaro nǝ wun raka, ma'wun na.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝ Samariya ɓinǝ ak Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Lang pwari mǝnana Yesu nǝ̀ nyarni aban o a kùli gbashìnà ka, Yesu tsǝk muri aban ká a Urǝshalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Pǝlǝa tasǝ amǝ'na-túrbân à aki dǝmba aban ká a ɓè muna-là mala amǝ Samariya ɓǝà kya gilǝki ban-sulǝo. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Sǝ aɓwana mala mǝno yì muna-là ka à gingsǝi ɗàng, acemǝnana yì ka, tsǝk muri aban ká nǝ Urǝshalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Alaggana male, Jemis andǝ Yohana, à sǝni anggo ka pǝlǝa à ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, ɓǝ̀ sǝm tunǝ bǝsa a kùli ɓǝ̀ yi pisǝ aɓwana mǝnia ka le?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2Amur 1:9-16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu pǝlǝ rǝì sà arǝ Jemis andǝ Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Pǝlǝa à kutio à o a ɓè muna-là.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝkpata Yesu nǝ mburkun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:19-22">Markus 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />À nda ban ká a njargula ka, ɓeɓwa ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ kpato ko ayaban a nǝ ká kàm ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Amǝ'nzǝgban ngga à ndanǝ atūli malea, sǝ amuna-nyal mǝnana a kùli ka à ndanǝ anda, sǝ Muna mala Ɓwa ka pànǝ ban mǝnana nǝ̀ usǝlǝ kam ngga ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Pǝlǝa ne ɓeɓwa ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yiu atàm.&gt;&gt;</char> Sǝ ɓwe ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, cam peatu, mǝ kya tsǝkban tárrám.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɗeki alú ɓǝa tsǝk alú malea, sǝ we ka kyane kya hamnǝ Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nyare ɓeɓwa bang ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ kpato, Mǝtalabangŋo, sǝama cam peatu mǝ nyare mǝ kya tsǝk amǝɓala mem a ndà.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:61 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Amur 19:20</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana nda ban rya nǝ andá, sǝ kǝ kar mǝsǝi a nzǝmi ka, kārǝa nǝ̀ kum Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ɗang.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu túr amǝkpate lumi <optbreak /> tongno-nong-ɓari <optbreak /> nǝ mǝsǝì ɓari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Anzǝm mǝnia ka, Mǝtalabangŋo twal aɓea ɓwana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari nǝ mǝsǝì ɓari atà amǝkpate, sǝ tasǝia ɓari-ɓari ɓǝa aki dǝmba o arǝ alá andǝ aban mǝnana yì ka, nǝ̀ ká kam ngga. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 10:2">
    <char style="wj">Túró pwan gir ɓaban ngga ndakam kǝ̀rkǝ́r, sǝ amǝtúró ka à làkkì ɗàng. Ace mani ka, wu zǝmbi Mǝtala ɓaban ɓǝ̀ tasǝ amǝtúró a ɓaban.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat 9:37</ref>
      </char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><char style="wj">Wu kyane! Ən nggǝ tasǝ wun kǝla amuna-nzur aɓalǝ anvwa-bondo.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mat 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mar 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Wu kǝa twal boalo, ko luru gya, ko ankura, a bu wun ɗàng, sǝ wu kǝa makki kǝɓwa kún a njargula ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" /><char style="wj">Ko ya ɓala na wu kútí kam ngga, wu tite nǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ dorǝpwala sulǝo a ɓala man.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ mǝ'earce dorǝpwala na a ɓalae ka, makkun ma'wun ɓǝ̀ do amurí. Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pà kàm raka, makkun ma'wun ɓǝ̀ nyare atà wun.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><char style="wj">Wu do a ɓalae, wu li, wu nu koya gir à pà wun kam ngga, acemǝnana mǝtúró ka ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ kum tangnakusǝi. Wu kǝa wu turkio arǝ aɓala ɗang.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Tim 5:18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ ya là wu kútí kam, sǝ à ak wun ngga, wu li komana à pà wun ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" /><char style="wj">Wu twalia wia ban arǝkwana mǝnana abanì ka, sǝ wu nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli yina aban wun tù.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Kor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Tim 5:18</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">La mǝnana wu kútí kam, sǝ à ak wun raka, wu puro arǝ akula malea wu na ama,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" /><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ko nggearǝ tú la ma'wun mǝnana a kusǝ sǝm ngga, sǝm nggǝ kǝtǝrikia wuni. Sǝ wu sǝlǝ ama: Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka yina aban wun tù!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun, a pwari ɓashi ka, ɓashi mala Ɓakuli amur mǝno yì la ka nǝ̀ candǝe nǝ̀ kútì mala amǝ Sodom.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Tite 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10:15</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala mana à earnǝ <optbreak /> Cau Amsǝban raka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matiu 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban nǝ we, Korazin! Caukwanban ne we gbal Beseda! Ɓǝa agir-ndǝlǝki mǝnana à pakkia aɓalǝ wun, à pangŋǝnia a Taya andǝ Sidon ngga, ɓǝ à pwanǝna nzali ɗiɗyal, à makkina anggubyau keban a rǝia, nǝ tāpì aɓa tú.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-8">Isha 23:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezǝk 26:1--28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jol 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zak 9:2-4</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" /><char style="wj">Gìr'kwanrǝu mana nǝ̀ yiu amur wun a pwari ɓashi ka, nǝ̀ ɓike nǝ̀ kútì mǝnana nǝ̀ yiu amur amǝ Taya andǝ amǝ Sidon ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><char style="wj">Sǝ we Kapanahum ngga! A kǝ́ sǝni kǝla à nǝ̀ loasǝo aban ká kùli le? Awo! À nǝ̀ túrǒ a nzali àkǝ̀ ɓá tūli-lú!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isha 14:13-15</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />
    <char style="wj">Wun amǝ kpatam, ɓwa mǝnana kwakikiri arǝ wun ngga, nda ban kwakikiri a rǝam, ɓwa mǝnana ginǝ wun ngga, ginǝnam, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana ginǝam ngga, ginǝna Tárrám mǝnana tasǝam ngga.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyare mala amǝ kpata Yesu <optbreak /> mana túriá ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Amǝkpata Yesu mǝnana lumi-tongno-nong-ɓari mǝsǝì ɓari ka à nyar nǝ bumpwasǝa à yiu à yì na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, nggearǝ akukwar ka à kǝ oka sǝm aɓa lùllǝò!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Pǝlǝa Yesu pea wia eare ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən sǝn Shetan pur a kùli aban kpa kǝla li'nzama mala mbulo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><char style="wj">Ən pana wun rǝcandǝa wu parki an'yau andǝ agenye sǝ wu limurǝm amur bangŋo mala ɓi'wun mǝbura, kǝgìr pà nǝ̀ kum wun ɗang.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Ang 91:13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ban ɓǝ̀ kǝa ɓoara wun ama akukwar kǝ oka wun ɗang, wu pak bumpwasǝa ama alullǝ wun ngga à gilǝnia a kùli.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bum Yesu pwasǝo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matiu 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Amǝno yì pwari ka, Yesu lùmsǝ nǝ bumpwasǝa aɓa Bangŋo Mǝfele sǝ bang ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən ɓwangsǝkio we Dâ, Mǝtala kùli andǝ nzali, acemǝnana a sǝmbǝrǝ amǝnia yì agir ka arǝ amǝ'sǝlǝe andǝ amǝ'súrǝ̀e, sǝ a lǝmdǝia aban amuna mǝkèke. E, Dâ, mǝnia ka nda gir mǝnana pwasǝ bumo ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Girbunda kat ka Tárrám nyìngŋǝ́nàm mia a buam. Kǝɓwa súrǝ̀ koyan nda Muna ɗang, she kǝ Ɓakuli Tárrú nǝmurǝì, sǝ kǝɓwa pà kàm súrǝ̀ koyan nda Tárrú ɗang, she kǝ Muni, andǝ aɓwana mǝnana Muni tarkia ama nǝ̀ lǝmdǝí abania ɓǝa súrǝì ka.&gt;&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoh 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Pǝlǝa pǝlǝ rǝì a ban alaggana male, nea wia zàng ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Amǝsǝu mǝnana à kǝ sǝn gìr mǝnana wu kǝ sǝni ka, à ndanǝ earmúrú a ban Ɓakuli!</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ama, amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli andǝ amurǝma ka, à kǝ earce ama à nǝ̀ sǝn gìr mǝnana wu kǝ sǝni ka, sǝ à kùmô à sǝni ɗàng. À kǝ̀ earce ok cau mǝnana wu kǝ oe ka, sǝ à kùmô à oè ɗàng!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ ɓwa Samariya <optbreak /> ɓwa mǝɓoarne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12:28-34</ref></char>.</note> A ɓekǝ pwari ka, ɓè mǝ'sǝlǝ Nggurcau mala Musa lo nǝ̀ kārǝki Yesu. Pǝlǝa ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, mana mǝ nǝ pa sǝ mǝ nǝ kum yilǝmu mǝnana málá male pà kàm raka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu eari wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mana ɗe à gilǝa aɓa Nggurcau? Lang sǝ a kǝ ɓalli?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ɓwe eare ama, &lt;&lt; &lt;Earce Ɓakuli mô nǝ ɓabumo kat, nǝ yilǝmo kat, nǝ rǝcandǝa mô kat, nǝ ɗenyicau mò kat&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Nggur 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Pǝris 19:18</ref></char>.</note>; sǝ wu &lt;earce ɓio mǝkunɓala kǝla mǝnana a earce ɓamúrò ka.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Pǝris 19:18</ref></char>.</note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu eari wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;A bangŋǝna mǝsǝcau. We ka, pàk anggo, awu nǝ auwa.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Pǝris 18:5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Sǝ yì ka, earce nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama ɓwarki raka, pǝlǝa ɗì Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Yana nda ɓiam?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu ne wi ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 10:30">
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa lo a Urǝshalima aban ká Jeriko, kara amǝ'ɓǝmbǝriban kasǝ a kúni. À swárkì wi agir-nggūrǝì, à walki ue bǝti ɓǝ́ wuna, sǝ à o à ɗeki.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" /><char style="wj">Anggo ka ɓè Pǝris twalǝna kǝ njargule aban ká. Mǝsǝì nǝ̀ yia kpa arǝì ka, kara kyanggi wi o a o male.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" /><char style="wj">Sǝ anggo gbal ka ɓeɓwa Lawi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓwa Lawi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amǝ Lawi ka à nda ka pǝris, amǝ pak túró aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli.</char></note> <char style="wj">twal kǝ njarnì, lang yiu yi bik banì ka mǝsǝì kpa arǝì, kara twal ɓè njar ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2Acau 28:15</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa-kúnɗàngna, ɓwa Samariya kar àkǝ̀ njargule, nǝ̀ yia sǝn ɓwa man ngga, mǝsǝswatǝr bwali.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" /><char style="wj">Pǝlǝa kyang a baní, soapi wi mùrú andǝ mùr-anap amur anpenye, sǝ marǝki wi anpenye nǝ bugir. Twali tsǝì anzǝm ndambǝritso male. Wari nǝi a ban-sulǝo kya ɗenyinǝi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" /><char style="wj">Ban fana ka pusǝ boalo, dinari</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dinari: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinari nda mǝsǝ bolo-azǝrfa.</char></note> <char style="wj">ɓari pè mǝɗenyi nǝ ban-sulǝo, ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɗenyi nǝ mǝnia yì mǝkwánó ka. Gìr mǝnana kat a kasǝi amurí kútì mǝnia ka mǝ nǝ yia mbweo ɓǝ̀n nyarna ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />A masǝlǝate ka Yesu ɗì ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Atà aɓwana mǝnia tàrú ka, yana a ɗenyicau mò, nda lǝmdǝ dokunɓala arǝ ɓwa mǝnana kpa a bu amǝ'ɓǝmbǝriban ngga?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Mǝ'sǝlǝ Nggurcau eare ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana lǝmdǝì wi ɓwamuru ka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kyane kya pa anggo.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wari a ɓala mala Marta <optbreak /> andǝ Maryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:12">Yoh 11:12</ref>
      </char>.</note> Lang Yesu andǝ alaggana male bwalna njar ka, à yì bik ɓè muna-là a ban mǝnana ɓè ɓwama, lùllǝì ama Marta, gingsǝia, ea a ɓala male ka. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marta ka ndanǝ mǝ'eambi muna-ɓwama lùllǝì ama Maryamu, yi do a ɓadǝm Mǝtalabangŋo Yesu aban ok kànìgìr male. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Sǝ Marta ka nyesǝ ɗenyicau male arǝ atúró mǝnana ɓoaro ɓǝà pea ka. Pǝlǝa yiu a ban Yesu yi ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, kǝgìr oasǝo arǝ atúró mǝnana mǝ'eambam nyinggam a kikilam ngga re? Ne wi ɓǝ̀ bwalàm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mǝtalabangŋo Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Marta, Marta, ɓabumo pi sǝ a kǝ pe rǝo tanni arǝ agir pas.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" /><char style="wj">Sǝ kǝgìr mwashat nda à earkiyi ce ka, ndà kǝ mǝɓoarne mǝnia Maryamu twali ka, sǝ kǝɓwa pà nǝ̀ é arǝì ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Kànìgìr mala Yesu amur hiwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matiu 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ɓè pwari mwashat Yesu na ban pak hiwi a ɓe ban. Lang malǝna ka, ɓeɓwa atà alaggana male ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, kania sǝm pak hiwi, kǝla mǝnana Yohana kani alaggana male ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ wu nǝ̀ pak hiwi ka, wu na ama:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt; &lt;We Tár sǝm </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">mǝnana a kùli ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">lùllǝò ka ɓǝà gusǝlǝi,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Domurǝm mò ɓǝ̀ yiu.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />
    <char style="wj">Pà sǝm girlina mala </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:3">
    <char style="wj">yalung andǝ mala </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:3">
    <char style="wj">koya pwari ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />
    <char style="wj">Twala sǝm ban </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">acauɓikea ma'sǝm,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">kǝla mana sǝm gbal </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">ka sǝm nggǝ twali </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">aɓwana mǝnana</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">à kǝ pakka sǝm </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">cauɓikea, banì ka.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">Kǝa ká nǝ sǝm aɓa </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">kārǝkiban ɗang.&gt; &gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 11:5">
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝà bang ama ɓeɓwa atà wun ngga ndanǝ gyajam, sǝ wari a baní nǝ ɓadu kya ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓeam, pam tangna bǝredi tàrú.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" /><char style="wj">Ɓè gyajam mem twal bǝri yiu abanam, sǝ ǝn panǝ kǝgìr mǝ nǝ pe wi ɗang.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ gyajam male eari wi nǝ ɓakurǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝa tāki kiram ɗang! Kunkurǝm ngga à gìrnì, sǝ mim sǝnǝ amunem ngga, sǝm nongŋa nǝ nongŋo, pà mǝ nǝ gandǝ lo mǝ nǝ po kǝgìr ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ama, ko ɓǝ̀ pà nǝ̀ gandǝ lo nǝ̀ pe wi bǝredi, acemǝnana yì ka, gyajam male na ka, raka, sǝ ace pitau mala ɓwa mǝno ka, nǝ̀ lo nǝ̀ pe wi gir mǝnana kat pàktǝle ka. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />
    <char style="wj">Ace mani ka ǝn nggǝ na wun ama: Wu zǝmba, à nǝ̀ pa wun. Wu alte, wu nǝ̀ kùmô. Wu wal kunkurǝm, à nǝ̀ mǝnba wuni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana ɓwa mana kat zǝm ngga, à nǝ̀ pe wi, ɓwa mana alte ka, nǝ̀ kùmô. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana gbal kat wal kunkurǝm ngga, à nǝ̀ mǝnbi wi.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />
    <char style="wj">Wun aɓwana mǝnana wu nda ka tárrú ka, yana aɓalǝ wun mǝnana ɓǝ̀ muni zǝmbi wi nji, nǝ̀ pe wi n'yau ka?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" /><char style="wj">Ko ana raka, ɓǝ̀ zǝmbi wi nki-nggu ka, kara nǝ̀ pe wi genye?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ wun, amǝ'ɓealɓikea, wu sǝlǝ pe amuna ma'wun aɓoro mǝɓoarne ka, sǝ koshi Tár wun mana a kùli ka! Yì ka, aɓa njar mǝnana wori mǝno ka nǝ̀ pea aɓwana mǝnana à zǝmbi wi ka, Bangŋo Mǝfele!</char><verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rǝcandǝa mala Yesu ka <optbreak /> pur nǝ kǝshe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matiu 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Markus 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />A ɓekǝ pwari ka, Yesu na rǝ pusǝ kukwar arǝ ɓeɓwa mǝnana kǝ gandǝ nacau raka. Lang kukwar nì purna ka, ɓwa mǝnana kǝ nacau raka, kara nacau, ɓwabundǝa ndali. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Sǝ aɓea aɓwana aɓalǝia na ama, &lt;&lt;Kwei, yi mǝnana gbal nǝ Be'elzebul, murǝm mala akukwar sǝ kǝ pusǝ akukwar ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Aɓea ɓwana kǝ earce tambi Yesu gbǝ́lî, pǝlǝa à ne wi ama ɓǝ̀ lǝmdǝia wia gir'ndali mǝnana nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama yì ka, pur nǝ ban Ɓakuli ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8:11</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Sǝ Yesu sǝlǝna rǝ ɗenyicau malea, pǝlǝa nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 11:17">
    <char style="wj">Nzali murǝm mǝnana kat gaki ka, pà nǝ̀ cam ɗang, sǝ ɓala mǝnana gaki ka, pà nǝ̀ cam ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ Shetan gau rǝì ka, palang sǝ domurǝm male nǝ̀ came? Ən bang anggo, acemǝnana wu na ama nǝ Be'elzebul sǝ ǝn nggǝ pusǝ akukwar.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ ǝn nggǝ pusǝ akukwar nǝ Be'elzebul ka, amǝkpata wun ngga, nǝ mana sǝ à kǝ pusǝia? Ɓǝ̀ nda ana ka, à dumǝna wun amǝ'ɓashi nǝ ɓamuria.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ nǝ rǝcandǝa mala Ɓakuli sǝ ǝn nggǝ pusǝ akukwar ka, Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli yina aban wun.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ ɓwabura-ɓwa mǝnana kùrna rǝì nǝ girbura sǝ nda kǝ yál ɓala male ka, ɓala male nǝ̀ duk ɗwal, kǝgìr pà nǝ̀ je ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓeɓwa mǝnana kútì nǝ rǝcandǝa yiu arǝì, yi gandǝi ka, nǝ̀ ak agirbura mǝnana gulikiyi a rǝia ka, sǝ nǝ̀ pwan girkuma arǝì.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana pà atàm raka, ɓiam-mǝbura na, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana bwalàm ramge raka, nda aban mesǝki.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9:40</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ kukwar purî rǝ ɓwa ka, kǝ gāli arǝ aban-ima, ace alta ban usǝlǝo. Sǝ ɓǝ̀ kum raka, nǝ̀ ne ɓamúrì ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ nyare a ɓala mǝnana ǝn ɗeki ka.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ yi kumi à esǝkini, ɓoarnansari gǝraɗau ka,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" /><char style="wj">pǝlǝa nǝ̀ nyare nǝ̀ nggá yiu nǝ aɓea kukwar tongno-nong-ɓari mǝnana à kútì nǝ ɓealɓikea ka, à nǝ̀ yia kutio à nǝ̀ dukam. Do mala ɓwe adyan ngga nǝ̀ ɓiki kǝ̀rkǝ́r nǝ̀ kútì mǝdǝmbe.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu na rǝ naki amǝnia yì acau ka, kara ɓe ɓwama aɓa ɓwabundǝa loasǝ gi ama, &lt;&lt;Tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli na amur nggeau mǝnana ɓǝ̀lo sǝ a nu kiure ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu pa eare ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;E, ɓafo, sǝama, tsǝkbu pwala mala Ɓakuli ka nda amur aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ ok cau male, sǝ à kǝ kpate ka!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gir'lǝmdǝa mǝpandali <optbreak /> mala Yunana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matiu 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Markus 8:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Lang ɓwabundǝa nǝ̀ nggǝ làkkì ka, Yesu na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 11:29">
    <char style="wj">Nza mǝnia ka mǝɓealɓike na, kǝ earce sǝn gir'ndali. Sǝ kǝ gir'lǝmdǝa mǝpandali pà kàm à nǝ̀ pe wi ɗang she kǝ gir'lǝmdǝa mala Yunana.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar 8:12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" /><char style="wj">Kǝla mǝnana Yunana duk gir'lǝmdǝa aban amǝ Nineva ka, anggo sǝ Muna mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ do aban mǝnia yì nza ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Yun 3:4</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><char style="wj">A pwari ɓashi ka, mā-murǝm mala amǝ Sheba nǝ̀ came andǝ aɓwana mǝnana a nza man ngga, sǝ nǝ̀ yinǝ kasǝ-ɓashi amúrià, acemǝnana yì ka, lo a masǝlǝata nzali ɓanza kuko sǝ yiu ace ok sǝlǝe mala Solomon. Sǝ ado ka Ɓwa mǝnana kútì Solomon ngga ndya ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Amur 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Acau 9:1-12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><char style="wj">A pwari ɓashi mala Ɓakuli ka amǝ Nineva nǝ̀ came andǝ aɓwana mǝnana a nza man ngga, sǝ à nǝ̀ yinǝ kasǝ-ɓashi amúrià. Acemǝnana yia amǝ Nineva ka à pwanzali à ɗeki buia arǝ acauɓikea malea, nǝ hama mala Yunana, sǝ ado ka Ɓwa mǝnana kútì Yunana ka ndya ka!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yun 3:5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alta tǎlaban mǝ'mǝsǝcaunì</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matiu 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa pà nǝ̀ tsǝk bǝsa a pitǝla sǝ nǝ̀ sǝmbǝrǝi, ko nǝ̀ kùmsǝî wi nkenye ɗàng. She nǝ̀ gyari a kùli, ace mǝnana aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ kutio a ɓala ka ɓǝà sǝn tǎlaban.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" /><char style="wj">Mǝsǝo nda pitǝla mala rǝò. Ɓǝ̀ mǝsǝo nda bǎng ngga, rǝò kat ka nǝ̀ lùmsǝ nǝ tǎlaban. Sǝ ɓǝ̀ amǝsǝo ɓoar raka, rǝò kat ka lùmsǝ̀nà nǝ pǝndǝa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" /><char style="wj">Sǝ we ka, tsǝkiro, ɓǝ̀ tǎlaban mô ɓǝ̀ kǝa duk pǝndǝa ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ rǝò kat ka lùmsǝ nǝ tǎlaban, kǝ pǝndǝa pa kàm ko bǝti raka, nǝ̀ ta kat kǝla mǝnana pitǝla kǝ po tǎlaban ngga.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pusǝta aɓwana-mǝgule <optbreak /> mala amǝ Yahudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Markus 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Anzǝm mǝnana Yesu malǝna naki acau ka, ɓeɓwa Farisi tunǝi arǝ girlina. Pǝlǝa Yesu wario kya do nǝ̀ li girlina. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Lang ɓwa Farisi sǝn Yesu tita li girlina sǝ lak buì kǝla mǝnana nggurcau malea bang raka, kara ndali kǝ̀rkǝ́r nǝ mani. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Pǝlǝa Mǝtalabangŋo ne wi ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 11:39">
    <char style="wj">Wun amǝ Farisi ka wu kǝ lak nzǝm kwar andǝ nzǝm tasau, sǝ ɓabum wun ngga lùmsǝ nǝ mɓali andǝ ɓealɓikea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" /><char style="wj">Wun amǝ ɗwanyi sǝlǝe! Nggearǝ Ɓakuli mǝnana pak ɓālǝi ka nǝ̀ pak nzǝmi mbo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" /><char style="wj">Wu pè amǝ'tǝ̀r agir mǝnana wu ndanǝia ka nǝ ɓabum wun mwashat, sǝ ko mana ma'wun kat ka nǝ̀ dupa wun nǝ ɓoarnsari.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban nǝ wun, amǝ Farisi! Acemǝnana wu kǝ pa mwashat aɓa lum mala ambuzang andǝ ambulara andǝ acilia agirpwala, sǝ wu būrǝce kpata gìr aɓa mǝsǝcau andǝ earce Ɓakuli. Amǝnia ka à nda ka agir mǝnana wu nǝ̀ pa rǝcandǝa a rǝia ka, sǝ acili agir mǝno ka wu nǝ̀ pea gbal.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11:42 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Pǝris 27:30</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban nǝ wun, amǝ Farisi! Acemǝnana wu kǝ earce aban-do mǝɓoarne aɓalǝ andakpapi andǝ makkun aɓalǝ alimo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" /><char style="wj">Caukwanban nǝ wun! Acemǝnana wu nda kǝla aɓembe mǝnana à ɓǝà raka, gandǝa aɓwana kǝ gya amúrià, à kǝ pǝndǝkea, aɓa ɗwanyi sǝlǝe.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Ɓè ɓwa aɓalǝ amǝ'sǝlǝgir Nggurcau mala Musa eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, ɓǝ̀ a bang ana ka, a sangŋa sǝm gbal!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu pa eare ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 11:46">
    <char style="wj">Wun amǝsúrǝ̀ Nggurcau mala Musa, caukwanban nǝ wun! Acemǝnana wu kǝ parì aɓwana twalo mǝnana à pà nǝ̀ gandǝ twale raka, sǝ wun nǝ ɓamurǝ wun ngga, ko munabu wun mwashat ka wu pà nǝ̀ loasǝi ama wu nǝ̀ tsǝkia wia ɗang.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban nǝ wun! Acemǝnana wu gilǝki ce aɓembe mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli, sǝ aká wun na à wal-luia.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" /><char style="wj">Anggo ka wu earǝna nǝ gir mǝnana aká wun pè ka. Yia na à wal-lú amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli ka, sǝ wu nda wu gilǝki ɓak aɓembe malea ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" /><char style="wj">Mǝnia ka nda cau mǝnana Ɓakuli bang amur wun ngga, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ tura wun ban nǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa andǝ amǝ'mishan, aɓea ka wun nǝ̀ wal-luia sǝ acilia ka wun nǝ̀ pea wia tanni.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" /><char style="wj">Ace mani ka, nkila mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli mǝnana à sukki ɗiɗyal, twal a tita ɓanza ka, à nǝ̀ ɗice a bu aɓwana mǝnana a nza man ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><char style="wj">Tite nǝ nkila mala Habila yi bwal ban nkila mala Zakariya, mǝnana à wal-lui a nre gyangŋan andǝ Ban Mǝfele ka. Ɓafo ǝn nggǝ bangga wun, à nǝ̀ ɓashia aɓwana mǝnana a nza man ngga acea kat!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Tite 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-22">2Acau 24:20-22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />
    <char style="wj">Caukwanban nǝ wun, wun amalǝm Nggurcau! Wu ak kunɓala mala sǝlǝgir. Wun nǝ ɓamur rǝ wun ngga wu kútí ɗang, sǝ wu kasǝkun aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ earce kutio ka!</char><verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Lang Yesu nyìngŋǝ̀nà banì ka, amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa tita ɓinǝ mǝsǝì kǝ̀rkǝ́r, à cam arǝì nǝ ɗike amur acau pas. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />À kǝ̀ alta bwale aɓa cau mǝnana nǝ̀ pur a kúni ka.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Nunkiru andǝ ɓakɓabum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-31">Matiu 10:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Anggo ka, lang ɓwabundǝa mǝnana làkkì malea nda á-pas à yì ramǝna a ban Yesu, gandǝa à kǝ parki rǝarǝia ka, Yesu tita nacau peatu nǝ alaggana male ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 12:1">
    <char style="wj">Wu parkir wun arǝ yis</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">yis: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝnia ka nda kanigir mala swarkiban ko ɓǝmbǝri aɓwana.</char>
    </note> <char style="wj">mala amǝ Farisi. Mǝ nda ban nacau amur kúnɓárína malea.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mar 8:15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><char style="wj">Kǝ gìr pà kàm mǝnana gire sǝ à pà nǝ̀ ndǝli raka, sǝ koya gir'sǝmbǝrǝa ka à nǝ̀ pusǝ ce.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" /><char style="wj">Ace mani ka, cau mǝnana wu ne a pǝndǝa ka, à nǝ̀ ok ce bwāng, sǝ mǝnana wu sheri aɓa kiru aɓa ndà-nongŋo ka, à nǝ̀ hamnǝ ce amur akurǝm.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />
    <char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun, wun agyajam mem, wu kǝa ɓanggi aɓwana mǝnana à nǝ̀ wal-lú ɓwa, sǝ anzǝmi ka à pànǝ kǝgìr mǝnana à nǝ̀ pàk ka ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" /><char style="wj">Mǝ nǝ lǝmdǝa wun rǝ ɓwa mǝnana wun nǝ̀ ɓanggi wi ka. Wu ɓanggi Ɓakuli, mǝnana ɓǝ̀ walna ɓwa ka, ndanǝ rǝcandǝa mǝnana nǝ̀ ramta ɓwa a lú-bǝsa ka. Ɓafo, ǝn nggǝ na wun, wu ɓanggi wi!</char><verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />
    <char style="wj">Nggearǝì ka amǝpuɗeng tongno mbo sǝ à kǝ kúria kwapo ɓari? Kat andǝ amani ka kǝ ɓè pà kàm mǝnana Ɓakuli lorǝi ka ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" /><char style="wj">Wu sǝni! Ko nggearǝ anyang ɓamuru wun ngga à ɓalnia kat. Ace mani ka, ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakka wun ɗàng, wu kútí amǝpuɗeng kat nǝ ɓoarɓwa.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bang paɓamuru mô amur Yesu <optbreak /> a ɓadǝm ɓwapǝndǝa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matiu 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ən nggǝ bangga wun, ɓwa mǝnana kat bang paɓamuru male arǝàm a ɓadǝmbǝ aɓwana ka, mim Muna mala Ɓwa ka mǝ nǝ bangce gbal ama yì ka, mem na a ɓadǝmbǝ amǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana kat makgìr súrǝàm a ɓadǝm ɓwapǝndǝa ka, mǝ nǝ makgìr súrǝè gbal a ɓadǝm amǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana kat bangcau mǝɓane amur Muna mala Ɓwa ka, à nǝ̀ twali wi banì, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana na caukyauwikiban amur Bangŋo Mǝfele ka, à pà nǝ̀ twalbani ɗàng.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:31">Mat 12:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mar 3:29</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Ɓǝà wari nǝ wun aɓalǝ andakpapi, a ɓadǝmbǝ amǝ'ɓashi andǝ amurǝma ka, ɓǝ̀ ɓalǝ wun ɓǝ̀ kǝa kasǝkia arǝ pǝlǝcau, ko mana wun nǝ̀ na ka ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana àkǝ̀ banì, Bangŋo Mǝfele nǝ̀ kania wun cau mǝnana wun nǝ̀ na ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ mǝkume <optbreak /> mǝ ɗwanyi sǝlǝe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Ɓè ɓwa aɓa ɓwabundǝa ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, ne mǝ'eambam ɓǝ̀ sǝm gau gǝna mǝnana tár sǝm nyingga sǝm ngga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu pǝlǝi wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓwabura, yana ciem mǝ'ɓashi ko mǝgaugir anre wun?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Pǝlǝa ne ɓwabundǝa ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu parkir wun, wu yál rǝ wun arǝ koya ulang kikil ka, acemǝnana làkkì mala agirkuma mala ɓwa ka, nda yilǝmi ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Pǝlǝa nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 12:16">
    <char style="wj">Ɓaban mala ɓè mǝkume pusǝ girlina kǝ̀rkǝ́r.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" /><char style="wj">Pǝlǝa ne ɓamúrì ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ado mǝ nǝ pa? Ən panǝ ban mǝnana mǝ nǝ ram girlina mem kàm ngga ɗàng.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda gìr mǝnana mǝ nǝ pàk ka, mǝ nǝ arki abá mem sǝ mǝ nǝ ɓakki amǝgulke, mǝ nǝ so girlina andǝ acili agirkuma mem kàm.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" /><char style="wj">Sǝ mǝ nǝ ne yilǝmem ama, &lt;A ndanǝ gǝna kǝ̀rkǝ́r aban ramba mǝnana nǝ̀ twalki apǝlǝa pas ka, panzǝ rǝò, lìli, nu, sǝ wu pak banɓoarnado.&gt; &gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Sǝ Ɓakuli ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;We gǝm ɓwa! Àkǝ̀ bu du mǝnia ka, à nǝ̀ twal yilǝmio a rǝò. Sǝ agirbunda mǝnia a rambi ɓamuro ka, à nǝ̀ duk mala yana?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />A masǝlǝate ka Yesu bang ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Anggo sǝ nǝ̀ kum ɓwa mǝnana rambi ɓamúrì gǝna, sǝ yì ka, mǝ'tǝ̀r na aban Ɓakuli ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓabum wun ɓǝ̀ kǝa kiɗiki ɗàng <optbreak /> wu gūlì arǝ Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matiu 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu pǝlǝa ne alaggana male ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 12:22">
    <char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ama ɓabum wun ɓǝ̀ kǝa pi ace gìr mǝnana wun nǝ̀ li ace do nǝ yilǝmu, andǝ mǝnana wun nǝ̀ oasǝo arǝ wun ngga ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana yilǝmu ka kútì girlina, sǝ nggūrǝu gbal ka kútì agir-nggūrǝu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" /><char style="wj">Wu sǝna arǝ agang'lang pé! À kǝ̀ ɓealɓeale ɗang, à kǝ ram girɓaban ɗang, ko nggearǝ ban tsǝk girlina ko bà ka à pànǝi ɗàng. Kat andǝ amani ka Ɓakuli kǝ linǝia. Sǝ ɓoarɓwa ma'wun aban Ɓakuli ka kútì mala amuna-nyal!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" /><char style="wj">Sǝ yana aɓalǝ wun ɗe mǝnana ɗenyicau mala ɗwanyi nǝ̀ tsǝk yilǝmi nǝ̀ sauwa a ɓanza nǝ bu-pwari mwashat ka? Kǝɓwa pà kàm ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pà wu nǝ̀ gandǝ pak gìr mǝkyauwe kǝla mǝnia raka, palang sǝ wu kǝ pisǝ ɓalǝ wun arǝ acilia?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />
    <char style="wj">Wu sǝni, lang sǝ apwasǝo-bondo kǝ gulo! À kǝ̀ pak túró ko à kǝ pyau nkonggúr ɗàng. Sǝ ǝn nggǝ na wun ama, nggearǝ Murǝm Solomon aɓa kume andǝ gulo male kat ka oasǝ agir-nggūrǝu kǝla malea ɗàng.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Amur 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Acau 9:3-6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ anggo sǝ Ɓakuli kǝ ɗenyi nǝ abondo mǝnana à ndya à kǝ sǝnia yalung, sǝ li ka à turnia a bǝsa ka, sǝ nǝ wun? Pà nǝ̀ pakka wun mǝnana kútì malea ka re? Gūliarǝu ma'wun kyau fat!</char><verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ ɓabum wun ɓǝ̀ kǝa pi ace agir mǝnana wun nǝ̀ li, ko wun nǝ̀ nu ka ɗàng, wu kǝa pak ɗenyicau amurí ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" /><char style="wj">Amǝɓanza ka à kǝ ɓangŋa atà amǝnia yì agir kat ka. Sǝ Tár wun sǝlǝna ama wu kǝ pak-tǝla amǝnia yì agir ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" /><char style="wj">Wu alta Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli a dǝmba nǝ ko man ngga, sǝ amǝnia yì agir ka à nǝ̀ pà wunia gbal.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kume aɓa bangŋo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matiu 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />
    <char style="wj">Domwan mǝkyauwe, ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakka wun ɗàng, acemǝnana Tár wun ngga ban kǝ ɓoari wi ɓǝ̀ pà wun agir mǝɓoarne mala Domurǝm male.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" /><char style="wj">Wu makki agirkuma ma'wun, wu pè amǝ'tǝ̀r boale. Wu kumbi ɓamur rǝ wun andaboalo mǝnana à kǝ sangi raka, sǝ wu tsǝk kume ma'wun a kùli aban mǝnana pà nǝ̀ amsǝa, sǝ amǝn'í pa nǝ̀ gbashì, ko tatǝmdi nǝ̀ kiɗiki raka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana ban mana kume mò ndakam ngga, akàm sǝ ɓabumo nǝ̀ pa.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuna-ɓala mǝnana à <optbreak /> dum nǝ tsǝkiru ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matiu 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <char style="wj">Wu kur rǝwun ace túró, apitǝla ma'wun ɓǝà kǝ ta.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:35 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25:1-13</ref>
      </char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><char style="wj">Kǝla aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ kundǝmur mǝtala-ɓala malea ɓǝ̀ nyàrî ban pakkiɗire isǝban ngga. Acemǝnana ɓǝ̀ nyarǝna sǝ yi walkina kunɓala ka, à nǝ̀ lo a kaurǝa, à nǝ̀ mǝnbi wi.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:34-36">Mat 13:34-36</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" /><char style="wj">Ban nǝ̀ ɓoari amǝno yia amuna-ɓala ka, yì mǝnana ɓǝ̀ mǝtala-ɓala yiu yi kumia andǝ amǝsǝia ka. Ən nggǝ na wun ɓafo, nǝ̀ kur rǝì, nǝ̀ nea wia ɓǝà do, sǝ nǝ̀ pea wia girlina.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" /><char style="wj">Ban nǝ̀ ɓoari amǝno yì amuna-ɓala ka, yì mana mǝtala-ɓala malea yi kumia aɓa gilǝrǝu ka, ko ɓǝ̀ yiu nǝ ɓadu, ko ɓǝ̀ nggu mala nǝ̀ ɓua ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Wu sǝlǝ ama, ɓǝ̀ mǝtala-ɓala sǝlǝna rǝ bu-pwari mǝnana mǝn'í nǝ̀ yiu nǝi ka, pà nǝ̀ eare mǝn'í nǝ̀ kutio a ɓala male ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" /><char style="wj">Sǝ wun gbal ka, wu do nǝ kur-rǝu, acemǝnana Muna mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ yiu a bu-pwari mǝnana wu tsǝk ɓalǝu ama nǝ̀ yiu nǝi raka.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muna-ɓala mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì andǝ <optbreak /> mana pànǝ mǝsǝcau raka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matiu 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Bitǝrus ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, sǝm nda a nakiya sǝm mǝnia yì kanicau ka le ko a ndaban ne aɓwana kat?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mǝtalabangŋo Yesu eare ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 12:42">
    <char style="wj">Yana nda muna-ɓala mǝnana mǝsǝle na, à nǝ̀ earnǝi ka? Yì ka, nda ɓwa mǝnana mǝtala-ɓala male nyinggi wi ɓala a buì, ɓǝ̀ pè acilia amuna-ɓala girlina ɓǝ̀ pwari malea pangŋǝna ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" /><char style="wj">Mǝno yì muna-ɓala ka ndanǝ banɓoarnado yi mǝnana ɓǝ̀ mǝtala-ɓala male nyare yi kumi ndaban pak túró mǝnana à pe wi ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ɓafo, mǝtala-ɓala male nǝ̀ yia tsǝì amur girkuma male kat.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ muna-ɓala ne ɓamúrì ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtala-ɓala mem ngga pà nǝ̀ nyar tù ɗàng.&gt;&gt; Sǝ ɓǝ̀ kùtí a wal amuna-ɓala, aburana andǝ amamǝna, kǝ li, kǝ nu, sǝ kǝ wal-wale ka,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" /><char style="wj">mǝtala-ɓala mala mǝno yì muna-ɓala ka, nǝ̀ nyare a bu-pwari mǝnana muna-ɓalae tsǝkbum raka, a pwari mǝnana pànǝ sǝlǝe raka. Nǝ̀ yia koè, nǝ̀ kasǝki wi anpenye, sǝ nǝ̀ nyesǝi aɓalǝ amǝ'ɗwanyi kpata mǝsǝcau.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />
    <char style="wj">Muna-ɓala mǝnana súrǝ̀ kani mala mǝtala-ɓala male, sǝ kur rǝi ace, ko pak kǝgìr ace raka, à nǝ̀ koè kǝ̀rkǝ́r.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana sǝlǝ ɗang sǝ pak gìr mǝnana ɓoaro ɓǝà koè ace ka, à nǝ̀ koè bǝti. Ɓwa mǝnana à pè wi kpǝm ngga, à nǝ̀ alte a buì kpǝm. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana à pè wi kàm kpǝm ngga, à nǝ̀ ɗice a buì gbal kàm kpǝm.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nda tǝ́r gakkya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matiu 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />
    <char style="wj">Ən yiu ace soa bǝsa a ɓanza. Eare mem ngga ɓǝ́ bǝshe ka ndaban earke!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><char style="wj">Mǝ ndanǝ batisǝma mala tanni mǝnana à nǝ̀ pakkam ngga, ado ka ndaban pisǝam a ɓalǝam, she ɓǝà pàngŋǝ̀nì ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mar 10:38</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" /><char style="wj">Wu kǝ sǝni kǝla ǝn yiu ace yinǝ dorǝpwala a ɓanza le? Awo! Ən nggǝ na wun, gakkya na ǝn yiu nǝi ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" /><char style="wj">A dǝmba ka, àkǝ ɓala mǝ'mwashati mǝnana aɓwana kàm tongno ka, à nǝ̀ gakki rǝia. Aman tàrú ka à nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ aman ɓari ka, amǝnana ɓari ka à nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ amǝnana tàrú ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><char style="wj">Tárrú nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ muna-ɓwabura male, sǝ muna-ɓwabura gbal ka nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ tárrí. Nggeau nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ muna-ɓwama male, sǝ muna-ɓwama gbal ka nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ ngge. Nggeau nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ mālá muni, sǝ ɓwama nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ nggea burí.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Súrǝ̀ agir-lǝmdǝa mala <optbreak /> masǝlǝata apwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matiu 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu ne ɓwabundǝa ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 12:54">
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ wu sǝn pǝrɓang aban eauwe, nǝ njar-nzali ka, wu kǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Mbulo ndo nǝ̀ nya,&gt;&gt; sǝ nǝ̀ nya gbal.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ gung njar-kunmur ɓua ka, wu na ama &lt;&lt;Ban ndo nǝ̀ pi yalung,&gt;&gt; sǝ ban nǝ̀ pi gbal.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" /><char style="wj">Wun amǝ'kúnɓárína! Wu súrǝ̀ kusǝpa mala agir mǝnana a nzali andǝ bumkuli ka, sǝ palang sǝ wu gandǝ súrǝ̀ kusǝpa mala agir-lǝmdǝa mala nza ma'sǝm man ɗang?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilǝki nre wun wunǝ ɓeomǝbura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matiu 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />
    <char style="wj">Palang sǝ wu gandǝ gakkita mǝɓoarne andǝ mǝɓane ɗàng?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ a ndaban o a ndaɓashi wunǝ ɓwa mǝnana wulio ka, ɓariki wu gilǝki cau wunǝi amur njargula, ɓǝ̀ ana raka nǝ̀ nungio aban ká a ban mǝ'ɓashi, sǝ mǝ'ɓashi nǝ̀ tasǝ takwaro a ban amǝ'munagara, sǝ yià ka à nǝ̀ ramto a ndàkurban.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun, a pà wu nǝ purî ban mǝno ka ɗàng, she ɓǝà kpǝrina tà lǝpan mò ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Pǝlǝ nzǝ́mó arǝ cauɓikea ko wu kiɗiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />A pwari mǝno ka, aɓea ɓwana nakam àkǝ̀ banì, à ne Yesu cau mala amǝ Galili mǝnana à ndarǝ pa gir'nkila aban Ɓakuli sǝ Bilatus tsǝa à wal-luia ka. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 13:2">
    <char style="wj">Wu kǝ sǝni kǝla amǝnia yì amǝ Galili à walia ka à nda ka amǝnana à kútí acili amǝ Galili nǝ cauɓikea ka le?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" /><char style="wj">Awo! Ən nggǝ na wun, ɓǝ̀ wu nying pakki acauɓikea, wu nyare aban Ɓakuli raka, wu nǝ̀ wú kat gbal.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" /><char style="wj">Ko aɓwana mǝnana lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú mǝnana ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhre kpa a múrià à wú a Silowam ngga, wu kǝ sǝni kǝla à kútìban nǝ cauɓikea a Urǝshalima kat le?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" /><char style="wj">Awo! Ən nggǝ na wun, ɓǝ̀ wu nying pakki acauɓikea wu nyare aban Ɓakuli raka, wu nǝ̀ wú kat gbal.</char><verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ vwari mana kǝ ɓǝl raka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 13:6">
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa ndanǝ nggun vwari a ɓaban male. Waria alta ɓǝle sǝ ko kya kum ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ne ɓwa mǝnana kǝ yál ɓaban ngga ama, &lt;&lt;Pǝlǝa tàrú yalung mǝ ndarǝ nyarki kani ace alta ɓǝla vwari mǝnia ka, sǝ ko ǝn kum ɗang. Kasǝi turi! Ace mana sǝ nǝ̀ nggǝ kiɗiki nzali ɓà?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ mǝ'yál ɓaban ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtala-ɓala, ɗeki ɓǝ̀ pǝlǝa mǝnia ka ɓǝ̀ malâ, mǝ nǝ kwarki nzali mǝnana a tǝte ka, sǝ mǝ nǝ soapi wi ciunda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ pusǝ ɓǝle aɓa pǝlǝa mǝnana kǝ yiu ka, yàwá! Ɓǝ̀ ɓǝl ɗǝm raka, sǝ wu kasǝi.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu twalban rǝkwana a pwari Sabbat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />A pwari usǝlǝo mala amǝ Yahudi ka, Yesu na aban kani aɓwana gir aɓa ɓe ndakpapi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Ɓè ɓwama nakam kukwar gbakǝri pǝlǝa lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú. Kàrrì kàngkàng, gandǝ sárǝ́ rǝì ɗang ko bǝti. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Lang Yesu nǝ̀ sǝni ka, pǝlǝa tunǝi ama ɓǝ̀ yiu a dǝmba, sǝ ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓwama, à panzǝno a bu mǝnia yì kwánó mo ka.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Pǝlǝa tsǝk abui arǝì, anggo ka, kara sárǝ́ pǝrapǝra, kǝ ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Sǝ ɓwamǝgule ndakpapi ka bumi lúllô, acemǝnana Yesu twalban rǝkwana a pwari usǝlǝo ka. Ne aɓwana mana à ram ngga ama, &lt;&lt;Anongŋo ndakam tongno-nong-mwashat ace túró. Wu yiu ɓǝà twala wun ban arǝkwana ma'wun aɓalǝ amǝno yì apwari ka, wu kǝa yiu a pwari usǝlǝo ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:9">Pur 20:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Nggur 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mǝtalabangŋo pǝlǝi wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wun amǝ'kúnɓárína! Ko yan aɓalǝ wun ngga kǝ panzǝ jamnda ko ndambǝritso male a domwan kǝ um nǝi a pe wi mùr a pwari usǝlǝo re?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ado ka, mǝnia yì ɓwama, Mǝkà Ibǝrayim, mǝnana Shetan kùrrì pǝlǝa lum-bwamdǝ-tongno-nong-tàrú ka, à pà nǝ̀ panzǝi a pwari usǝlǝo re?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Lang bangŋǝna anggo ka, kara kǝsǝkya pakki aɓi-mǝbura. Sǝ aɓwana ka banɓoaria wia nǝ agir-ndǝlǝki mǝnana pea ka.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ mǝsǝ musta andǝ yis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Matiu 13:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Markus 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Pǝlǝa Yesu ɗiban ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka nda kǝla mana? Mǝ nǝ kànì arǝ mana?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" /><char style="wj">Nda kǝla mǝsǝ musta mǝnana ndya mǝní bǝti, mǝnana ɓeɓwa twali kya ɓeali a ɓaban male ka. Gulo kya pǝlǝa nggun sǝ amuna-nyal mana a kùli ka à yì bwal ndà arǝ abuí.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Nyare ɗiban ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Arǝ mana sǝ mǝ nǝ kani Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" /><char style="wj">Nda kǝla yis mǝnana ɓè ɓwama twal bǝti, sùrǝì andǝ muku mǝsǝbondo alkama tasau tàrú, pǝlǝa loakio aki ɓālǝi kat ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunkurǝm mǝɓweari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matiu 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu kutio arǝ alá andǝ amuna-là aban kani aɓwana gìr, dǝshi muri aban ká Urǝshalima. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Pǝlǝa ɓeɓwa ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, aɓwana bǝti na à nǝ̀ amsǝia ka le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu nea wia ama:<verse eid="LUK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />
    <char style="wj">Wu ɓariki wu kutio a kunkurǝm mǝnana ɓwear ka, ǝn nggǝ na wun, acemǝnana aɓwana pas à nǝ̀ ɓariki ama à nǝ̀ kutio, sǝ à pà nǝ̀ gandǝi ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ mǝtala-ɓala longŋǝna sǝ girǝna kunɓala ka, wun nǝ̀ cam nǝ nza sǝ wun nǝ̀ nggǝ walki kunɓala aban zǝmba ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, mǝnba sǝm kunɓala!&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">Sǝ yì ka, nǝ̀ eare ama, &lt;&lt;Ən súrǝ̀ wun ɗang, sǝ ǝn súrǝ̀ ban mǝnana wu pur kam ngga ɗang!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ wun nǝ̀ na ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm li, sǝ sǝm nu, sǝnǝa wun, sǝ a kanì aɓwana gir arǝ anreɓala ma'sǝm.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ nǝ̀ eara wun ama, &lt;&lt;Ən súrǝ̀ wun ɗang, sǝ ǝn súrǝ̀ ban mǝnana wu pur kam ngga ɗang. Wu upi banam, wun amǝ'ɓealɓikea!&gt;&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:27 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:8">Ang 6:8</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:28 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Akàm wun nǝ̀ nggǝ ɓua nǝ nǝmnggi munabu wun, ɓǝ̀ wu sǝna Ibǝrayim, andǝ Ishaku andǝ Yakupu andǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli kat aɓa Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli, sǝ wun ngga à ɗekina wun nǝ nza ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" /><char style="wj">Ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ pur nǝ njar-takuli, nǝ njar-nzali, nǝ njar-nza andǝ njar-kunmur, à nǝ̀ yia do aban lìli banɓoarnado a Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mat 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" /><char style="wj">A pwari mǝno ka, aɓea aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ gusǝlǝ cea ado ka à nǝ̀ kyauwikia, sǝ aɓea aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ kyauwikia ado ka à nǝ̀ gusǝlia.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10:31</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pak bumkiɗikea amur Urǝshalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matiu 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Anggo ka aɓea amǝ Farisi yiu aban Yesu à yì ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Nying ban mǝnia ka, o a ɓe ban ɗàng. Hirǝdus kǝ earce wal-luio.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 13:32">
    <char style="wj">Wu kyane wu kya ne mǝno yì mǝ'nyamshaminu ka ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ pusǝ akukwar, mǝ nǝ twali aɓwana ban rǝkwana yalung andǝ li, sǝ a tàruià nongŋo ka, mǝ nǝ masǝlǝta túró mem.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" /><char style="wj">Kat andǝ amani ka, mǝ nda amur gya yalung andǝ li sǝ liawo. Mǝsǝcau ka à nǝ̀ wal-lú kǝ mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli sǝ pà aɓa Urǝshalima ɗang re!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />
    <char style="wj">Wun amǝ Urǝshalima! Wun amǝ Urǝshalima! Wun mǝnana wu kǝ wal-lú amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli ka. Aɓwana mǝnana à túriá aban wun ngga wu kǝ ɓukkia nǝ atali, ɓǝa wú. Kusǝ shen Mǝ nda ban earce ram wun aban mǝ'mwashati, kǝla mǝnana nggu kǝ ramgi amuni aɓata ankpamtari ka, sǝ wu ear ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><char style="wj">Wu sǝni, Ndàmǝgule ma'wun ngga, Ɓakuli ginǝkina wuni, nongŋǝna atàrǝì. Ən nggǝ na wun, pà wu nǝ̀ nyare wun nǝ̀ sǝnam ɗǝm ɗàng. She pwari mǝnana wun nǝ̀ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwangsǝban mala Ɓakuli na amur ɓwa mǝnana kǝ yiu aɓa lullǝ Mǝtalabangŋo ka!&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ang 118:26</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu twalban rǝkwana <optbreak /> a pwari Sabbat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />A ɓè Sabbat, pwari usǝlǝo mala amǝ Yahudi ka, Yesu kutio aban lili a ɓala mala ɓè ɓwamǝgule Farisi. Kara aɓwana tsǝki wi mǝsǝu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Àkǝ̀ ɓadǝmbi ka ɓeɓwa ndakam, nǝ kwánó tú. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu ɗì amǝ Farisi andǝ amǝ súrǝ̀ Nggurcau ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nggurcau mala Musa eare ama ɓǝà twalban rǝkwana a pwari Sabbat le, ko ɓǝà kǝa twal ɗàng?&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ban pwalo ateà ɗǝong. Pǝlǝa Yesu tsǝk buì arǝ ɓwabure, twali wi ban rǝkwana, sǝ tasǝi ɓǝ̀ o.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Pǝlǝa ɗia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yan aɓalǝ wun mǝnana ɓǝ̀ muni ko jamnda male kpa a tūli a pwari Sabbat ka, pà nǝ̀ pusǝì a kaurǝa raka?&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12:11</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Sǝ yia ka ko à kum cau na amur mǝnia ka ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kànìgìr amur nongsǝmúrû</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Lang Yesu sǝn aɓea abǝri mǝnana à tunǝia a ban li girlina à nǝ̀ nggǝ alta ban-do mǝɓoarne ka, pǝlǝa nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka. Bangŋa ama:<verse eid="LUK 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PRO 25:6">Pas 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa tunǝo a lìli isǝban ngga, kǝa alta buno mǝɓoarne ɗàng, acemǝnana yakǝla à tunǝna ɓeɓwa mǝnana kutio nǝ ɓoarɓwa ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ nda anggo ka, ɓwa mǝnana tunǝ wun kǝm ngga nǝ̀ yia nô ama, &lt;&lt;Lo, nyinggi mǝnia yì ɓwa ka ban.&gt;&gt; Nǝ kǝsǝkya sǝ awu nǝ nyare aban yiu a ban-do mǝnana a nzǝ́mò ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝà tunǝo a lìli mǝgule ka, kya do a buno mǝnana a nzǝ́mò ka. Ɓwa mǝnana tunǝo ka ɓǝ̀ yiu sǝ ɓǝ̀ yi nô ama, &lt;&lt;Gyajam, lo kya dǝmba.&gt;&gt; Anggo ka a nǝ kum gulo a ban aɓeo abǝri mǝnana à tunǝ wun wunǝia ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><char style="wj">Mǝnia nda acemǝnana koya ɓwa na mana twal ɓamur rǝì ka, à nǝ̀ nyesǝi ɓà, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana nongsǝ ɓamur rǝì ka, à nǝ̀ gusǝlǝi.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk 18:14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yesu pǝlǝa ne ɓwa mǝnana tunǝban ngga ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 14:12">
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ a tunǝban ace ligirlina banɓoarnado ko pakkiɗire ka, ce a tunǝ agyajam mô, ko amǝ'eambo, ko aɓǝla mô, ko aɓeo amǝ murkala amǝ kume ɗàng. Ɓǝ̀ a pa anggo ka, yia ka à nǝ̀ tunǝo gbal a malea, sǝ anggo ka lǝmdǝna ama à mbweno a kunì.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ a nǝ tunǝban ace ligirlina banɓoarnado ka, tunǝ amǝ'tǝ̀r, amǝkusǝu-wuna, agbakǝre, andǝ ante.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" /><char style="wj">Anggo sǝ a nǝ kum tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli. Acemǝnana à pà nǝ̀ gandǝ mbweo raka, a nǝ nggá kum mbweban mô a pwari mǝnana amǝ'ɓealɓoarna nǝ̀ loapi ɓembe nǝi ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ dapi mala ligirlina <optbreak /> banɓoarnado mǝgule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matiu 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Lang ɓeɓwa mǝnana atà Yesu aban lili nǝ̀ ok ana ka, ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ ligirlina lǐ mǝgule a Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka, ndanǝ tsǝkbu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu eari wi ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 14:16">
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa ndakam pak girlina banɓoarnado mǝgule. Turkiban arǝ aɓwana pas.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" /><char style="wj">Lang pwari ligirlina kārǝ́na ka, tasǝ guro male ɓǝ̀ kya ne aɓwana mana à tunǝia lǐ ka ama, ɓǝa yiu, ko mana le ka à malǝna pe.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ yia kat ka à alkita anjar puro. Mǝdǝmba na ama, &lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ loa kur ɓaban, mǝ nǝ ká sǝne. Pà mǝ nǝ bwal ɗang, pakkam munyi.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa ka na ama, &lt;&lt;Ən kúr anda-rya lum, ǝn nggǝ um nǝ o a mwamia, pà mǝ nǝ bwal ɗang, ida pàkkam munyi.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa na ɗǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Ən loa isǝ ɓwama, pà mǝ nǝ gandǝ ká ɗang.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />
    <char style="wj">Guro nyare yi ne mǝtala-ɓala male acau mǝno kat. Mǝtala-ɓala ka bumi lúllô, pǝlǝa banggi guro male ama, &lt;&lt;Nyare o amur anjargula andǝ anreɓala, kyane kya tunǝki amǝ'tǝ̀r, amǝ kusǝ-wuna, ante andǝ agbakǝre.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa guro nyare yi ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, gir mǝnana a na ce ka à pangŋǝni, sǝ cili ban ndakam.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa mǝtala-ɓala ne guro ama, &lt;&lt;Puro o amur anjargula mǝgulke andǝ amǝkèke, kya ɓuaki arǝ aɓwana ɓǝa yiu, ace mǝnana ɓala mem ɓǝ̀ yi lùmsǝ ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun, aɓwana mǝnana à túrià ban ngga, kǝɓwa pà kàm ateà nǝ̀ ok girlina mem a kúni ɗàng!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwanrǝu mala do kpata Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matiu 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Aɓwabundǝa pas nda ban ká andǝa Yesu, sǝ pǝlǝ rǝì nea wia ama:<verse eid="LUK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana kat kǝ earce kpatam, sǝ ginǝ tárrí andǝ ngge, andǝ māmí, andǝ amuni, andǝ amǝ'eambi aburana andǝ amamǝna raka, pà nǝ̀ gandǝ duk mǝkpatam ɗàng. E, ɓwa pà nǝ̀ duk mǝkpatam ɗàng ɓǝ̀ ɓwe ginǝ ce nggearǝ yilǝmi acem raka. </char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref>
      </char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓwa twal nggun-gangndǝi male yiu atàm raka, pà nǝ̀ gandǝ duk mǝkpatam ɗang.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">Yana atà wun mǝnana earce nǝ̀ ɓak ndà-kulí mǝ'dāhre, sǝ pà nǝ̀ do peatu nǝ̀ ɓalbumi nǝ̀ sǝni ko ndanǝ boalo mǝnana nǝ̀ malǝna mǝno yì túró nǝi ka ɗàng?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ pa anggo raka sǝ kwakina tà kusǝɓǎ, sǝ gandǝ masǝlǝe raka, ko yana sǝ sǝni ka, nǝ̀ oali.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" /><char style="wj">À nǝ̀ nggǝ bang ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia yì ɓwa ka tita ɓǎ sǝ gandǝ male ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />
    <char style="wj">Ya murǝm nani nǝ asoje á-lum, nǝ̀ ká lwa arǝ ɓe murǝm mǝnana nǝ asoje á-lumi-ɓari ka, sǝ pà nǝ̀ do peatu nǝ̀ ɓalbumi nǝ̀ sǝni ko nǝ̀ gandǝ came a kún ɓi, mǝnana nǝ asoje á-lumi-ɓari ka ɗàng?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ pà nǝ̀ gandǝi raka, ɓǝ̀ ɓì nda kuko ka, nǝ̀ gbara nǝ̀ turban ɓǝà zǝmba ace gilǝki cau.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" /><char style="wj">Anggo gbal ɓǝ̀ koyan aɓalǝ wun sǝ nying girbunda male kat raka, pà nǝ̀ gandǝ duk mǝkpatam ɗàng.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />
    <char style="wj">Tuɓamur ka gìr mǝɓoarne na, sǝ ɓǝ̀ cyauwe male purrínì rǝì ka, mana nǝ̀ tsǝì sǝ nǝ̀ cyàu ɗǝm?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" /><char style="wj">Pà nǝ ɓoaro ko a ɓaban ko a gìgí ɗang; ueo sukkio mǝnana à nǝ̀ sukki ka.</char></para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 14:35">
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝ kir okban ngga, ɓǝ̀ o!</char><verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ nzur mana ɓwàr ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-14">Matiu 12:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Aɓe fara ka amǝcemi andǝ amǝ'cauɓikea na aban rambǝa kat à nǝ̀ kwaki kiria arǝ Yesu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Luk 5:29-30</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Sǝ amǝ Farisi andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa ka à kǝ nggwani ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia yì ɓwa ka kǝ do atà amǝ'cauɓikea, kǝ lili andǝia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka:<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝa twali ama ɓe kǝɓwa aɓalǝ wun ndanǝ anzur gbǝman. Ɓǝ̀ mwashat ateà ɓwàr ka, ɓwe pà nǝ̀ ɗeki amǝnia lumi-tongno-nong-ine nǝ mǝsǝi tongno-nong-ine ka aban likiali nǝ̀ ká alta mǝno mwashat ɓwàr ka, she ɓǝ̀ kumǝni ka re?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ kumǝni ka, nǝ banɓoarnado sǝ nǝ̀ twali a kwari,</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" /><char style="wj">aban o a la. Nǝ̀ tunǝ agyajam male andǝ amǝkunɓala, sǝ nǝ̀ nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu bwalàm pak banɓoarnado, ǝn kumǝna nzur mem mǝnana ɓwàr ka!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ama, anggo gbal a kùli ka bumpwasǝa nda kam kǝ̀rkǝ́r ace mǝ'cauɓikea mwashat mǝnana nying acauɓikea male nyare aban Ɓakuli ka. Mǝno yì bumpwasǝa ka kútì mana ndakam amur amǝ'cauɓoarna mǝnana lumi-tongno-nong-ine nǝ mǝsǝi tongno-nong-ine mana à ɓwarki tanjar raka.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ mǝsǝboalo mana ɓwàr ka</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ko ɓǝa twali ama ɓe ɓwama na nǝ amǝsǝ-boalo lum, sǝ ɓǝ̀ mǝnia mwashat ɓwar arǝì ka, pà nǝ̀ tsǝk bǝsa a pitǝla nǝ̀ esǝki ɓala, sǝ nǝ̀ alban pepe she ɓǝ̀ kumǝni ka re?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀ kumǝni ka, nǝ̀ tunǝ agyansari male andǝ amǝkunɓala nǝ̀ nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu bwalàm pak banɓoarnado! Ən kumǝna boalo mem mǝnana ɓwàr ka.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ama anggo gbal, bumpwasǝa nakam aban amǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli ace mǝ'cauɓikea mwashat mǝnana ginǝki acauɓikea male, nyare aban Ɓakuli ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ muna-ɓwabura <optbreak /> mana ɓwàr ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Pǝlǝa Yesu lidǝmba aban na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 15:11">
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwabura nakam nǝ amuna-burana ɓari.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" /><char style="wj">Mǝkyauwe mala ɓi ne tárrí ama, &lt;&lt;Dâ, pam kāmbe mem mala kume mo.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa tárrí gapia wia kume male aɓalǝu.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />
    <char style="wj">Anzǝm anonggio shen ngga, ɓwa mǝkyauwe kùr twalo male kat, kara twal bǝri o a ɓe la a bansauwa. Akanó ka kya kasǝ kume male aɓa do mǝɓane.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" /><char style="wj">Anzǝm mǝnana kiɗikina kume male kat ka, nggea nzala yi kpa a mǝno yì nzali ka, kara kutio aɓa tǝ̀r mǝcandǝe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" /><char style="wj">Pǝlǝa o kya alta túró aban ɓeɓwa a la mǝno ka. Sǝ ɓwa mǝno ka tasǝi a domwan mala agirkusǝu male ɓǝ̀ kǝ pea atǝmbǝrǝm-ɓala girlina.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" /><char style="wj">Rǝi ɓǝl pǝrpǝr arǝ nggunì girlina mǝnana atǝmbǝrǝm-ɓala kǝ li ka ama nǝ̀ li, sǝ kǝɓwa pe wi ɗang.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />
    <char style="wj">Yi nyare a ɗenyicau male ka na ama, &lt;&lt;Amǝtúró mǝnana à kǝ li a ɓabù tárrám ka girlina gandǝia ɓà, sǝ mǝ ndya nzala kǝ wal-luem ngga!</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" /><char style="wj">Mǝ nǝ nyare, mǝ nǝ o aban tárrám, mǝ nǝ ne wi ama, &lt;Dâ, ǝn pangŋǝni Ɓakuli cauɓikea sǝ ǝn pangŋǝno cauɓikea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" /><char style="wj">Ən kārǝa ɓǝa tunǝam ama mǝ nda munio ɗǝm ɗang, nyesǝam kǝla ɓe mǝtúró-ɓala mo.&gt; &gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa lo nyare aban o aban tárrí.</char></para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 15:20">
    <char style="wj">Nda kuko malaká bik ban tárrí ɗang, mǝsǝ tárrí kpa arǝì, kara mǝsǝswatǝr male bwali. Lo nǝ mire aban ká aban muni, kya kurrì zǝp.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />
    <char style="wj">Muni ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Dâ, ǝn pangŋǝni Ɓakuli cauɓikea, sǝ ǝn pangŋǝno. Ən kārǝa ɓǝà tunǝam ama munio ɗǝm ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">15:21</char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Ən kārǝa ɓǝà tunǝam ama munio ɗǝm ɗàng: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Aɓea malǝmce mǝnana à gilǝia nǝ bu ka à bang mǝnia ama: </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">Nyesǝam mǝ duk mwashat atà aguro mo.</char>
    </note><verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ tárrí ka ne amǝ'túró-ɓala male ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yinǝi wi nǝ daura mǝ'ɓoarjamnì mǝnana kútì a ɓi ka, wu turi wi arǝì. Wu oasǝi wi girmunabu, wu oasǝi wi ankura a kusǝì.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" /><char style="wj">Wu bwal lo-jamnda mǝ'nyane, wu wali. Sǝm nǝ̀ lìli, sǝm nǝ̀ pangŋǝni banɓoarnado.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana mǝnia yì muna-ɓwabura mem ngga wú, sǝ lo; ɓwaro, sǝ à kumi.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa à tita pakkiɗire.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />
    <char style="wj">Anggo ka, muni mǝgule na a ɓabondo. Nyarna nǝ̀ yia gbashi rǝ ɓala ka, ok walki anggwam andǝ nggyal andǝ tāki'anggwam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" /><char style="wj">Pǝlǝa tunǝ ɓe mǝtúró-ɓala ɗì, mana à pakkiyia.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" /><char style="wj">Mǝtúró-ɓala eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ'kyauweo na yiu ka, nda tárró wal jamnda mǝ'nyane, acemǝnana nyarǝna yina bǎng, yi kumǝni.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ muna mǝgule ka bumi lúllô, ginǝ kutia ɓala. Tárrí puro yi kumi, camarǝ ɓuakia rǝì.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ne tárrí ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝn apǝlǝa mǝnia pas mǝ nda ban pakko túró kǝla guro, ko ǝn mgbikio kiru arǝ cau mo àkǝ̀ pwari ɗang. Kat andǝ amani anggo ka, ko kǝ muna-mbul mǝnana a nǝ pam ama ɓǝ̀ ǝn twani ɓǝ̀ sǝm pakkiɗire sǝnǝ agyajam mem ngga, pà kàm ɗang!</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" /><char style="wj">Lang munio mǝnia nyarǝna, a nzǝm mana kiɗikina gǝna mo arǝ amā-gyatarǝu ka, a yi wali wi muna jamnda mǝ'nyane!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa tárrí ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Munem, sǝm nda a tarǝ sǝm sǝnǝ we, sǝ gìr mǝnana kat mem na ka, mo na.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" /><char style="wj">Ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ sǝm pak banɓoarnado andǝ bumpwasǝa, acemǝnana mǝnia yì mǝ'kyauweo ka wú, sǝ adyan ngga longŋǝna nǝ amǝsǝì; ɓwaro, sǝ à kumǝni.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ mǝɗenyi nǝ <optbreak /> agirkuma mǝkutani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu ne alaggana male ɓe kanicau ɗǝm ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 16:1">&lt;&lt;Ɓè mǝkume ndanǝ ɓwa mǝnana kǝ ɗenyi nǝ agirkuma male ka. À kya oasǝki muri ama mǝnia yì ɓwa ka kǝ kiɗiki kume male. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Pǝlǝa tunǝi ɗì ama, &lt;Ya cau nda man ǝn nggǝ o a muro ka? Bǝlam ɓá túró mo, acemǝnana a pà nǝ duk mǝɗenyi nǝ agirkuma mem ɗǝm ɗàng.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />&lt;&lt;Mǝɗenyi nǝ agirkuma pak ɗenyicau ama, &lt;Mana ado mǝ nǝ pa? Mǝtala-ɓala mem ndo nǝ̀ pǝram arǝ túró. Ən panǝ rǝcandǝa mǝ nǝ rikrya ɗang, sǝ kǝsǝkya kǝ pakkam arǝ zǝmgi agir. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ado ka, ǝn súrǝ́nà rǝ gir mǝnana mǝ nǝ pak ka, ace mǝnana ɓǝa pǝrnam arǝ túró ka, aɓwana nǝ̀ em arǝ aɓala malea ka.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Pǝlǝa tunǝ amǝtangna mala mǝtala-ɓala male mwashat-mwashat. Ɗi mǝdǝmba ama, &lt;Shen nda mǝtala-ɓala mem kǝ kpato?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />&lt;&lt;Pǝlǝa eari wi ama, &lt;Du mùrú gbǝman tongno-nong-tàrú na.&gt;</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 16:6">&lt;&lt;Mǝɗenyi nǝ agirkuma ne wi ama, &lt;Twal malǝmce tangnê, do a kaurǝa gilǝ gbǝman ine.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />&lt;&lt;Pǝlǝa ɗì ɓaria ama, &lt;Shen sǝ à kǝ kpato?&gt;</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Yì ka, eare ama, &lt;Mǝssa tasau á-mwashat.&gt;</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Oaso ne wi ama, &lt;Twal malǝmce tangnê, nyesǝi gilǝ gbǝman-tongno-nong-tàrú.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Mǝtala-ɓala ɓwangsǝ mǝɗenyi nǝ agirkuma mǝ'ɗwanyi mǝsǝcau nì mǝno ace kutan male. Acemǝnana aɓwana amǝkpata ɓanza mǝnia ka à ndanǝ kutan aɓa do malea arǝarǝia à kútì aɓwana mǝnana amǝkpata Ɓakuli na ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu lidǝmba nǝ cau ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 16:9">&lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ bangga wun, wu pak túró nǝ gǝna mala ɓanza, wu bwal agyajam nǝi, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ gǝne umna ka, Ɓakuli nǝ̀ ak wun gbal arǝ aɓala mǝnana à pà nǝ̀ kiɗiki raka.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana à gandǝ earnǝi arǝ gir mǝkyauwe ka à nǝ̀ earnǝi arǝ mǝgule gbal. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana pànǝ mǝsǝcau arǝ mǝkyauwe raka, pà nǝ̀ dum nǝ mǝsǝcau arǝ mǝgule gbal ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Sǝ ɓǝà pà nǝ̀ earnǝ wun nǝ bwal gǝna ɓanza raka, yana nǝ̀ earnǝ wun arǝ gǝna mǝɓafoe? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Sǝ ɓǝà earnǝ wun nǝ kume mala ɓeɓwa raka, yana nǝ̀ pà wun kume mǝnana ma'wun na ka?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Kǝ muna-ɓala pà nǝ̀ pakki amǝtala-ɓala ɓari turoɓala ɗàng. Ko nǝ̀ ginǝmǝsǝ man mwashat ka sǝ nǝ̀ earce ɓe, ko ana raka, nǝ̀ pa ɓamúrì aɓata ɓwa man mwashat ka, sǝ nǝ̀ būrǝce ɓe. Pa wu nǝ̀ pa ɓamur wun aban Ɓakuli andǝ boalo yia kǝm ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref></char>.</note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Sǝ yia amǝ Farisi mǝnana amǝ earce boalo na ka, à nǝ̀ ok mǝnia yì acau ka, à sonzǝkì Yesu nggê. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 16:15">&lt;&lt;Wu nda ka aɓwana mǝnana wu kǝ lǝmdǝì acili aɓwana ama wu nda ka amǝɓoarne, sǝ Ɓakuli ka súrǝ́nà ɓabum wun. Gìr mǝnana ɓwapǝndǝa gusǝlǝi kǝ̀rkǝ́r ka mǝɓeami na a ban Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aɓea kanigir mala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matiu 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Kaniama Yohana Mǝbatisǝma nǝ̀ tita hama ka, anggurcau mala Musa andǝ acau ɓá malǝmce mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli nda à kǝ lǝmdǝa wun njar ka. Sǝ adyan ngga Bǝsa Cau Mǝɓoarne mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ndya à kǝ hamnǝi ka, sǝ koyan ngga kǝ ɓariki kǝ̀rkǝ́r nǝ kutio kam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Sǝ mǝnia ka lǝmdǝ ama Nggurcau mala Musa ɗwanyini rǝcandǝa male ɗàng, ko aɓa ɓè kǝcau ndok. Ndǝrmya mala kùli andǝ nzali ka, nda halku amur mǝnana ɓè kǝcau ndok ɓǝ̀ ndǝrmi aɓa Nggurcau mala Musa ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat 5:18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana pǝr māmí sǝ al ɓè ka nda rǝ pak cauɓikea nongnǝban a nza nǝ doɓala, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana al ɓwama mana à pǝri ka nda rǝ pak cauɓikea nongnǝban a nza nǝ doɓala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Kor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝkume andǝ Liazaro</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />&lt;&lt;Ɓè mǝkume ndakam mǝnana agir-nggūrǝu male ka boalea candǝ kǝ̀rkǝ́r, sǝ koya pwari ka kǝ do aɓa rǝpwala. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />À kǝ̀ nongsǝ ɓe mǝ'tǝ̀r a kunɓala male, lùllǝì ama Liazaro, mǝnana npenye aki rǝì kat ka. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Rǝi kǝ ɓǝla arǝ li gìr mǝnana ɓwano kpa a ɓadǝm mǝkume ka. Nggearǝ anvwa ɗǝm à yiu à kǝ lenzǝki anpenye male.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;A masǝlǝate ka mǝ'tǝ̀r man yi wú, amǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli yi twali à um nǝi a ban Ibǝrayim. Mǝkume gbal ka wú pǝlǝa à tsǝkbani. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Yilǝmi o a ɓanza mala alú,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ɓanza mala alú: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Hades, ban mana alú kǝ uekám aban kundǝ ɓashi ka.&gt;&gt;</char></note> a ban mana kya kutio aɓa kwanban mala tanni mǝ'kǝ̀rkǝ́r nì ka, loasǝ mǝsǝì sǝn Ibǝrayim kuko andǝ Liazaro a nkanggari. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Pǝlǝa tunǝ Ibǝrayim ama, &lt;Dâ Ibǝrayim, sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr mem sǝ wu tasǝ Liazaro ɓǝ̀ oasǝ munabuì a mùr ɓǝ̀ lipam ta'mealam nǝi, acemǝnana mǝ nda aɓa tanni kǝ̀rkǝ́r aɓa bǝsa mǝnia!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Sǝ Ibǝrayim eari wi ama, &lt;Munem, ɗenyi ama do mo a ɓanza ka a kum agir mo amǝɓoarne, sǝ Liazaro ka kum agir mǝɓane, sǝ ado ka ndya kum banɓoarnado kani ka, sǝ we ka a nda aɓa tanni mǝkwanbanì kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ko ɓǝ̀ cè mǝnia nda raka, nre sǝm sǝnǝa wun ngga nggea tūli ndakam, acemǝnana aɓwana mana à earce lo kani à nǝ̀ ká a ban wun ngga, ɓǝa kǝa gandǝi ɗàng. Sǝ aɓwana mana gbal à nǝ̀ lo kano aban yiu a ban sǝm ngga ɓǝa kǝa gandǝi ɗàng.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />&lt;&lt;Mǝkume na ama, &lt;Sǝ ɓǝ̀ nda na ka ǝn nggǝ zǝmbǝo, Dâ, túr Liazaro a ɓala mala tárrám, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />akanó ka mǝ ndanǝ amǝ'eambu tongno. Ɓǝ̀ kya nunkiria, ace mǝnana yia gbal ka ɓǝà kǝa yiu a mǝnia yì ban tanni nggea mǝɓike ka ɗàng.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />&lt;&lt;Ibǝrayim eari wi ama, &lt;A Musa andǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">A Musa andǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko: Akanìgìr andǝ amalǝmce mala Musa andǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli.</char></note> nda kano a bania, ɓǝa kwaki kiria a rǝia.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />&lt;&lt;Mǝkume ne wi ama, &lt;Awo, Dâ Ibǝrayim, ɓǝ̀ ɓwa lo a ɓembe sǝ wari a bania ka, à nǝ̀ pwanzali, à nǝ̀ ɗeki buia arǝ acauɓikea malea.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />&lt;&lt;Pǝlǝa Ibǝrayim ne wi ama, &lt;Ɓǝà ok à Musa andǝ amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli raka, ko ɓǝ̀ ɓwa lo a ɓembe ka à pà nǝ̀ oè ɗàng!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nacau amur twalban cauɓikea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matiu 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Markus 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu ne alaggana male ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 17:1">Agir mǝnana à nǝ̀ tsǝk aɓwana à nǝ̀ kpa aɓa cauɓikea ka dumǝna púp à nǝ̀ yiu. Sǝa ma caukwanban nǝ́ ɓwa mǝnana amǝnia yì agir à pur nǝ bani ka. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa nǝ̀ tsǝk mwashat atà amǝnia yì amuna ɓǝ̀ pak cauɓikea ka, kǝpǝna ɓǝa ɗurri ɓwe taligo a meali sǝ ɓǝa ramte aɓa nggeamùr. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ace mani ka wu tsǝkir wun.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 17:3">Ɓǝ̀ mǝ'eambo pakko cauɓikea ka, gimbi, sǝ ɓǝ̀ vwaki buì arǝ cauɓikea male pwanzali ka, twali wi banì.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ko ɓǝ̀ pakko cauɓikea kusǝ tongno-nong-ɓari aɓa pwari mǝ'mwashati, sǝ nyar kusǝ tongno-nong-ɓari a bano yi pwanmbo nzali ka, twali wi banì.<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Pǝlǝa Amǝ'mishan ne Mǝtalabangŋo ama, &lt;&lt;Tsǝk paɓamuru ma'sǝm ɓǝ̀ gulo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Mǝtalabangŋo pea wia eare ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 17:6">Ko ɓǝ̀ gūliarǝu ma'wun kyauwe kǝla mǝsǝ musta ka, wun nǝ̀ gandǝ banggi nggea nggun mǝnia ka ama, &lt;&lt;U, kya kpa aɓa nggeamùr!&gt;&gt; Sǝ yì ka, nǝ̀ kpata cau ma'wun.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Ɓǝà twali ama ɓeɓwa nda kam aɓalǝ wun mana ndanǝ muna-ɓala mǝnana wari a rya a ɓaban ko a yál anzur ka. Ɓǝ̀ mǝnia yì muna-ɓala ka ndo kǝ nyàrî ɓabondo nǝ nyare ka, mǝtala-ɓala male nǝ̀ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Farǝo, yiu do lìli le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Pa nǝ̀ ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Pakkam girlina peatu, wu yi tsǝkami a ɓadǝmbam, ɓǝ̀ ǝn linali sǝ ǝn nunà mùr ka, sǝ awu nǝ lìli, awu nǝ nu mùr re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Nǝ̀ pàkkî muna-ɓala man yàwá, acemǝnana kpata cau mana ne wi ɓǝ̀ pè ka le? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Anggo gbal sǝ nǝ̀ pang nǝ wun: ɓǝ̀ wu pangŋǝna agir mǝnana kat à bangga wun ama ɓǝ̀ wu pea ka, wun nǝ̀ na ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm nda ka mǝtúró-ɓala mǝnana sǝm pà a kun kǝgìr raka. Kǝ túró ma'sǝm nda sǝm pak ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu twali amǝ dakali lum <optbreak /> ban kwánó malea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu nǝ̀ o a Urǝshalima ka, kar nǝ nzong-nzali mala amǝ Samariya andǝ amǝ Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Nda ban kutio aɓa ɓè muna-là ka, aɓea burana lum amǝdakali na, à yì kasǝ a kúni. À cam zak, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />sǝ à loasǝ già à tunǝban ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule! Yesu! Sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr ma'sǝm!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu pǝlǝ mǝsǝì sǝnia sǝ nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu kyane, wu kya lǝmdǝ rǝ wun aban apǝris.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Pǝris 14:1-32</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">À nda ban o ka, kara dakali mali rǝia.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Lang ɓwa mwashat aɓalǝia sǝni rǝì malǝna ka, kara soaɓunu nyare aban yiu, loasǝ gi, kǝ ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Yi kpa a ɓadǝm Yesu aban pakki wi yàwá. Sǝ yì ka, ɓwa Samariya na.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Aɓwana lum mbo sǝ à twalia wia ban dakali? Aman tongno-nong-ine ka à nda malea ake? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Kǝ ɓwa pà kàm ateà nǝ̀ nyare nǝ̀ ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli ka ɗang, she kǝ ɓwa-kúnɗàngna mǝnia ka?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Pǝlǝa ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Lo o, gūliarǝu mo a rǝam amsǝno.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yiu mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matiu 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Amǝ Farisi ɗì Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;A ya pwari sǝ Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli nǝ̀ yiu?&gt;&gt; Yesu earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Yiu mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka gìr na mǝnana à nǝ̀ sǝni nǝ mǝsǝu ka ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kǝɓwa pà nǝ̀ na ama, &lt;Ndya ka, wu sǝni!&gt; Ko ana raka, &lt;Ndako ka&gt; ɗàng. Acemǝnana Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka nda àkǝ̀ ɓalǝ wun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Pǝlǝa ne alaggana male ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 17:22">Pwari na kǝ yiu ka yi mǝnana rǝ wun nǝ̀ ɓǝla arǝ sǝn pwari mwashat aɓalǝ apwari mala Muna Mala Ɓwa ka, sǝ pà wun nǝ̀ sǝni ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ na wun ama, &lt;&lt;Ndako ka!&gt;&gt; Ko ana raka, &lt;&lt;Ndya ka!&gt;&gt; Wu kǝa ɓangŋa ateà ɗang. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kǝla mǝnana ɓǝ̀ mbulo li'nzama pǝlilip ka, nǝ̀ tá amur ɓanza a buì man nǝ̀ nggá bwal ɓe buì ka, anggo sǝ Muna Mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ pa a pwari nyare male. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Sǝa ma peatu ka, Muna mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ nu tanni kǝ̀rkǝ́r arǝ agir pas, sǝ aɓwana mǝnana a nza man ngga à nǝ̀ ɓinǝ mǝsǝì.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Kǝla mǝnana kumban a nza mala Nuhu ka, anggo sǝ nǝ̀ pa aɓalǝ anonggio mǝnana Muna Mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ nyare nǝ̀ yiu nǝi ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Tite 6:5-8</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Ɓwapǝndǝa kǝ lìli, kǝ nu, à kǝ al rǝarǝia, à kǝ isǝ amunia bà pwari mǝnana Nuhu kútí nǝi a nggea-waru ka. Pǝlǝa mùr-gùla yiu yi twaltea kat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 7:5-24">Tite 7:5-24</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">17:28 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Tite 18:20--19:25</ref>
      </char>.</note> Kǝ nda anggo a nza mala Lotu. Ɓwapǝndǝa kǝ li, à kǝ nu, à kǝ kúrkúró, à kǝ makkiagir, à kǝ rikrya, à kǝ ɓakki aɓah. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />A pwari mǝnana Lotu purî ɓá Sodom ngga, bǝsa andǝ amǝsǝtali bǝsa nya nǝ kuli amur amǝ Sodom twaltea kat.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Anggo sǝ nǝ̀ kumban a pwari mǝnana Muna Mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ yia pusǝna rǝì nǝi ka. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />A mǝno yì pwari ka, ɓwa mǝnana nda amur kurǝm male sǝ agirkuma male ka à nda aɓa kurǝm ngga, ɓǝ̀ kǝa na ama nǝ̀ sulǝ púp nǝ̀ nggá pwania ɗang. Anggo sǝ ɓwa mǝnana nda a ɓabondo ka, ɓǝ̀ kǝa nyare a ɓala ace twal kǝgìr ɗang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mat 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mar 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Wu ɗenyi nǝ mālá Lotu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Tite 19:26</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Ɓwa mǝnana kǝ earce nǝ̀ amsǝ yilǝmi ka nǝ̀ turte. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana kǝ turta yilǝmi ka nǝ̀ tsǝkcè.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh 12:25</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ən nggǝ na wun, a mǝno yì du ka, aɓwana ɓari nǝ̀ pa aban nongŋo a kala mǝ'mwashati, à nǝ̀ twal man mwashat ka, à nǝ̀ nying ɓe. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />À nǝ̀ kum amamǝna ɓari aban go aban mǝ'mwashati, à nǝ̀ twal mwashat à nǝ̀ nying man mwashat ka. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[À nǝ̀ kum aburana ɓari a ɓaban, à nǝ̀ twal man mwashat ka, à nǝ̀ nying ɓe.]<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Pǝlǝa alaggana male ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Aya ban le, Mǝtalabangŋo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu earia wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ban mǝnana lugir pak kam ngga, abanì sǝ adǝkǝlaki nǝ̀ rambǝa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ hiwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu ne alaggana male ɓekǝ kanicau mǝnana nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama yia ka ɓǝa kǝ pak hiwi cala rǝia wuki ɗang. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 18:2">A ɓekǝ là, ɓè murǝm-ɓashi nakam mǝnana kǝ ɓanggi Ɓakuli ɗang, sǝ kǝgìr oasǝi arǝ kǝɓwa raka. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Sǝ ɓè mā-lú nakam àkǝ̀ lě, mǝnana camarǝ nyarke aban mǝ'ɓashi man nǝ ɓua ama, &lt;&lt;Kutio anre sǝm sǝnǝ mǝɓinǝ muram.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Atà dǝmbe ka ginǝe. Nǝ nzǝ́mò ka ne ɓamúrì ama, &lt;&lt;Ko kat andǝ amani ama ǝn nggǝ ɓanggi Ɓakuli ɗang, sǝ kǝgìr oasǝkiam arǝ kǝɓwa raka, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />mǝ nǝ pak ɓashi mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì ace mǝnia yì mā-lú mǝnana kùrram mwacang ngga. Acemǝnana ɓǝn pak raka, nǝ̀ yauwam nǝ nyarke male tùtù abanam!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Pǝlǝa Yesu Mǝtalabangŋo na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 18:6">Wu ok cau mǝnana murǝm-ɓashi mǝ'ɗwanyi mǝsǝcau man na ka! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Wu kǝ sǝni kǝla Ɓakuli ka pà nǝ̀ pak ɓashi mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì ace aɓwana male mǝnana tària, mǝnana à kǝ ɓua a ɓadǝmbi, dù andǝ pwari ka re? Nǝ̀ dǝndi arǝ bwalia wia kam le? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ən nggǝ na wun ama, nǝ̀ pea wia gìr mǝnana malea na ka a kaurǝa. Sǝa ma ɓǝ̀ Muna Mala Ɓwa yiu ka, nǝ̀ yia kum paɓamuru a ɓanza le?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nǝ̀ yia kum paɓamuru a ɓanza le? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko: nǝ̀ yia kum aɓwana kam piu mǝnana à nda rǝ gūlì arǝì ɓǝ̀ pakkia wia ɓashi mǝ'mǝsǝcaunì ka le? </char></note><verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ ɓwa Farisi andǝ mǝcemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu na mǝnia yì kanicau ka arǝ aɓwana mǝnana à twalî ɓamuria ama yia ka à nda ka amǝ'cauɓoarna, sǝ à ɓǝsǝki acili aɓwana à nyesǝia amǝ'cauɓikea na ka, ama:<verse eid="LUK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Aɓwana ɓari à wari a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli ace pak hiwi. Mwashat ka ɓwa Farisi na, sǝ ɓè ka mǝcemi na. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Pǝlǝa ɓwa Farisi lo came pak hiwi amur ɓamúrì. Na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓakuli, ǝn pakko yàwá, acemǝnana mǝ nda mǝ'cauɓikea kǝla acili aɓwana ɗàng. Ən pa kǝla amǝ'ɓǝmbǝriban, amǝ ɗwanyi do amur mǝsǝcau, amǝ'nongginǝban a nza nǝ doɓala, ko kǝla mǝnia yì mǝcemi ka ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ən nggǝ gilmùr kusǝ ɓari a nre-limo mwashat, sǝ ǝn nggǝ pe Ɓakuli kāmbe mwashat aɓa lum mala koya girkuma mem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Sǝ mala mǝcemi ka cam kuko. Eare ama nǝ̀ loasǝ múrí a kùli ɗang, wal kikili na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓakuli, sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr mem, mim ngga mǝ nda mǝ'cauɓikea!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ən nggǝ na wun ama, mǝnia yì ɓwa ka, nyare aban o ɓala male ka, mǝ'cauɓoarna na a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli, pa kǝla mala ɓwa Farisi ɗàng. Koyana kat sǝ kǝ twalɓamuri ka, à nǝ̀ kyauwiki, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana kǝ nongsǝ ɓamúrì ka, à nǝ̀ gusǝlǝi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tsǝkbu amur amuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matiu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Markus 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Ɓè fara ka aɓea ɓwana yiu nǝ amuna aban Yesu ama ɓǝ̀ yi tsǝkia wia bu. Alaggana male sǝni anggo ka, à lo à sà a rǝia. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Sǝ Yesu ka tunǝ amuna a baní oaso na ama, &lt;&lt;Wu ɗeki amuna ɓǝa yiu abanam, wu kǝa pǝrkia ɗang, acemǝnana Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka nda ace a ulang amǝnia ka. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ən nggǝ na wun mǝsǝcau ama koyana sǝ pà nǝ̀ ak Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli kǝla muna mǝkyauwe raka, pà nǝ̀ gandǝ kútí kam ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓè ɓwamǝgule mala <optbreak /> amǝ Yahudi mǝkume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matiu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Markus 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ɓè ɓwamǝgule mala amǝ Yahudi mǝkume ɗì Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm mǝɓoarne, mana gir ni na mǝ nǝ pa sǝ mǝ nǝ kum yilǝmu mǝnana málá male pà kàm raka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;A bang ama mǝ nda ɓwa mǝɓoarne? Kǝ ɓwapǝndǝa pa kàm mǝɓoarne na ɗang, she Ɓakuli nǝmurǝì. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />We ka, à súrǝ́nà rǝ anzongcau mala Ɓakuli mǝnana ama: &lt;Kǝa kútí aɓa cauɓikea mala nongnǝ ɓwa mǝnana wu al rǝ wun wunǝi raka, kǝa wal-lú ɗàng, kǝa iun'í ɗang, kǝa ɓun-nyir amur ɓwa ɗàng, pe tárró andǝ nggo gulo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Pur 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Nggur 5:16-20</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Pǝlǝa ɓwe na ama, &lt;&lt;Amǝnia ka, yàle mǝ nda muntulo sǝ ǝn bwalia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Lang Yesu ok mǝnia ka, ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓè gìr mwashat na a ɗwanyi ka. Makki agir mǝnana kat a ndanǝia ka, gaki amǝ'tǝ̀r, awu nǝ kum gǝna a kùli, sǝ wu yiu, wu yi kpatam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Lang nǝ̀ o ana ka bumi kiɗiki, acemǝnana yì ka, mǝkume na kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu sǝni kyap-kyap, sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Nǝ̀ kwano sǝ mǝgǝna nǝ̀ kutio a Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ɓafo ka, kutio mala mǝgǝna a Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka kwano kútì kutio mala kalakadambi a tǝta nlerǝman.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Aɓwana mǝnana à ok mǝnia ka à ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝ yana ado nǝ̀ àwá?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu eare ama, &lt;&lt;Gìr mǝnana pà nǝ̀ gandǝ pa aban ɓwapǝndǝa raka, nǝ̀ gandǝ pa aban Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Pǝlǝa Bitǝrus ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝni, sǝm nyìngŋǝ̀nà agirkuma ma'sǝm kat sǝm yiu a kpato!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ na wun mǝsǝcau, kǝɓwa pà kàm mǝnana ɗeki ɓala, ko ɓwama, ko amǝ'eambu, ko tárrû andǝ nggeau, ko amuna ace Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />sǝ nǝ̀ ɗwanyi kum agir kǝ̀rkǝ́r a nza mǝnia ka. Sǝ ɗǝm ngga a nza mǝno kǝ yiu ka, nǝ̀ kum yilǝmu mǝnana málá male pà kàm raka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nyare nacau amur lú male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matiu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Markus 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu tunǝ alaggana male, aman lum-nong-ɓari ka a giriban, sǝ nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 18:31">Wu sǝni sǝm ndo sǝm nǝ̀ ká a Urǝshalima, sǝ agir mǝnana kat amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli gilǝì amur Muna Mala Ɓwa ka à nǝ̀ lùmsǝo. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />À nǝ̀ nyesǝi à nǝ̀ pea aɓwana mǝnana amǝ Yahudi na raka, à nǝ̀ oali, oalban zalǝkiban, à nǝ̀ sanggì, à nǝ̀ tappi wi ntāra, à nǝ̀ koè, sǝ à nǝ̀ wali nǝ̀ wu, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />sǝ a tàruià nongŋo ka, nǝ̀ loapi ɓembe.<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Sǝ ko alaggana male bwalta kǝgìr aɓa mǝnia yì acau ka ɗàng. À sǝmbǝrǝia wia ɓālǝi, ko à súrǝ̀ gir mǝnana kǝ nacau amurí ka ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝn mǝsǝ nte mǝzǝmggi agir nì</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matiu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Markus 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu gbàshìna Jeriko ka, ɓe nte nakam aban do a girǝi njargula aban zǝmgi agir. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Lang nǝ̀ ok gǝshi ɓwabundǝa mǝnana kǝ kútí ka, ɗiban ama, mana kumban le?<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />À pǝlǝa à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yesu ɓwa Nazarat nda kǝ kútí ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Pǝlǝa tunǝban bàng-bàng ama, &lt;&lt;Yesu! Muna mala Dauda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muna mala Dauda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amǝ Yahudi ka à tsǝkɓalǝia ama Mezaya ko Kǝrǝsti ka nǝ̀ pur a tàu mala Murǝm Dauda sǝ ace mani ka à kǝ tunǝi ama &lt;&lt;Muna mala Dauda,&gt;&gt; ko &lt;&lt;Ko Mǝkà Dauda.&gt;&gt;</char></note>! Sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr mem!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Aɓwana mǝnana à ak dǝmba ka à sà arǝì ɓwam, ama ɓǝ̀ duk kúni ɗǝong. Sǝ yì ka, kara loasǝ gi kpǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Muna Mala Dauda, sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr mem!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu go kusǝì came, sǝ na ama, ɓǝa yinǝi a baní. Lang yina a baní tù ka, Yesu ɗì ama, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Mana a earce mǝ pakko?&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa nte man eare ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, ǝn nggǝ earce sǝnban.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Kum sǝnban! Paɓamuru mo amsǝno.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Àkǝ̀ banì gbal kara kum sǝnban, sǝ kpa atà Yesu aban o, kǝ ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli. Lang ɓwapǝndǝa mǝnana kat sǝni ka, yia gbal ka à ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zaka kum sǝn Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu ara aɓa nggea-là Jeriko, ndaban kútí aɓalǝi. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Ɓè ɓwa ndakam lùllǝì ama Zaka, ɓwamǝgule mala amǝcemi na sǝ yì ka, mǝkume na. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Yì ka, ɓariki nǝ̀ sǝni ko yana nda Yesu. Ɓwabunda nda kam pas mǝnana yia gbal ka à kǝ̀ earce sǝn Yesu ka. Sǝ yi Zaka, acemǝnana nkpandal na ka, gandǝ sǝnban aɓa ɓwabundǝa ɗang. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Pǝlǝa ɓangŋa, ak dǝmba, kya eauwe a nggun vwari nǝ̀ sǝni, acemǝnana àkǝ̀ banì sǝ Yesu nǝ̀ pǝlǝa.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Lang Yesu yi bwalǝna banì ka, loasǝ mǝsǝì a kùli sǝ ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Zaka, fa rǝo sùlǝî nggun! Yalung ngga, she mǝ nǝ sulǝ a ɓala mo.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Pǝlǝa sulǝo a kaurǝa gingsǝ Yesu nǝ bumpwasǝa. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ɓwapǝndǝa mǝnana kat sǝn mǝnia ka, tita nggwani ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwabura man ngga kya sulǝna a ɓala mala mǝ'cauɓikea!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zaka pǝlǝa lo sǝ ne Mǝtalabangŋo ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo, sǝni, mǝ nǝ gau girkuma mem aɓalǝu, mǝ nǝ pè amǝ'tǝ̀r kāmbe mwashat, sǝ ɓǝ̀ ǝn mbǝrina kǝɓwa ka, mǝ nǝ nyesǝi ɓwe gìr nî kusǝ ine.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Pǝlǝa Yesu ne wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yalung ngga amsǝban yina a ɓala mǝnia ka, acemǝnana mǝnia yì ɓwa gbal ka mǝ'kà Ibǝrayim na.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">acemǝnana mǝnia yì ɓwa gbal ka mǝ'kà Ibǝrayim na. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;acemǝnana a lǝmdǝna a nda mǝ'kà Ibǝrayim mǝɓafoe.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><char style="wj">Muna mala Ɓwa ka, yiu àkǝ̀ ce alta gir mǝnana ɓwàr ka, nǝ̀ amsǝi.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mat 18:10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:11">11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ pak túró nǝ boalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matiu 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">19:11 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>
      </char>.</note> Lang à nǝ̀ nggǝ kwaki kiria arǝ mǝnia yì acau ka, Yesu lidǝmba nǝ nea wia ɓe kanicau, acemǝnana anggo ka à gbàshìnà ban Urǝshalima, sǝ à kǝ sǝni kǝla Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka ndo nǝ̀ yiu àkǝ̀ dyadyan mǝno ka. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Pǝlǝa na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 19:12">
    <char style="wj">Ɓè mǝtaumurǝm wari a ɓe nzali mǝsauwe nǝ̀ nggá ak gara-murǝm, sǝ nǝ̀ nyare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" /><char style="wj">Kaniama nǝ̀ o ka tunǝ atà amǝtúró male lum, gakkia wia mǝsǝboalo zǝnariya luru lum sǝ nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Boalo mǝnia ka wu kǝ nggāliki nǝi, she ɓǝn nyarǝna ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ aɓwana male ka à ɓinǝi, pǝlǝa à tasǝ aɓea aɓwana atè ɓǝà kya na ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm earce mǝnia yì ɓwa ka ɓǝ̀ duk murǝm ma'sǝm ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />
    <char style="wj">Kat andǝ amani ka, mǝnia yì ɓwa ka à kya pe wi gara-murǝm, sǝ nyare a kusǝì yiu. Pǝlǝa turban atà amǝ'túró-ɓala mǝnana pākia wia boalo ka, acemǝnana nǝ̀ súrǝ̀ gir mana à kum aɓa nggāliki ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />
    <char style="wj">Mǝdǝmba yiu yi na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, luru mǝsǝboalo mô ka, ǝn kumǝna luru lum amurí.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa mǝtala-ɓala male ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Yàwá, mǝtúró mem mǝɓoarne! Acemǝnana a lǝmdǝ mǝsǝcau amur mǝnia bǝti ka, a nǝ duk mǝlà amur anggea-là lum.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓaria ɓwa yiu yi na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, luru mǝsǝboalo mo ka, ǝn kumǝna luru tongno amurí.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />
    <char style="wj">Mǝtala-ɓala male ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;We ka, a nǝ bwal anggea-là tongno.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa ɓe guro yiu yi na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, luru mǝsǝboalo mo nia ka, ǝn karrì aɓa bugir ǝn sǝmbǝrǝi pepe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" /><char style="wj">Ɓangciu pakkam a rǝo, acemǝnana we ka cau mò kwano na ɗang. A kǝ twal gìr mǝnana awu nǝ̀ tsǝk raka, sǝ a kǝ pwan gìr ɓaban mǝnana awu nǝ̀ ɓeal raka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />
    <char style="wj">Mǝtala-ɓala male eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ kùrro nǝ acau mǝnana à pur a kuno ka, we mǝtúró-ɓala mǝɓealɓike! A sǝlǝna she ama cau mem kwano na ɗang, ǝn nggǝ twal gìr mǝnana mǝ nǝ̀ tsǝk raka, sǝ ǝn nggǝ pwan gìr ɓaban mǝnana mǝ nǝ̀ ɓeal raka?</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" /><char style="wj">Sǝ palang sǝ a ɓinǝ ká tsǝkam boalo mem a banki, ace mǝnana ɓǝn nyare yiu ka, mǝ nǝ yia é nǝ mur amurí?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa nea aɓwana mana à came abanì ka ama, &lt;&lt;Wu ak luru mǝsǝboalo mǝnana a buì ka, wu pè ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝ luru lum ngga.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwamǝgule, yì ka, ndanǝ male yì luru lum mala mǝsǝboalo zǝnariya!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa eare ama, &lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ na wun ama, ɓwa mǝnana ndanǝi ka, à nǝ̀ tsǝki ɓi amurí, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana pà nǝi raka, nggearǝ mǝno bǝti a buì ka à nǝ̀ é arǝì.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">19:26 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:28">Mar 4:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" /><char style="wj">Sǝ amǝno yì amǝɓinǝ muram mǝnana à ear ama mǝ duk murǝm amúrià raka, wu yinǝia kani, wu yi wal-luia a ɓadǝmbam!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aɓwana zǝkice kutio mala Yesu <optbreak /> a Urǝshalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matiu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Markus 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Anzǝm mana Yesu bangŋǝna mǝnia yì acau ka, pǝlǝa dupia wia a dǝmba aban ká a Urǝshalima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Lang gbàshìnà Betafaji andǝ Betani aban nkono Olif ka, pǝlǝa tasǝ aɓea alaggana male ɓari. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu kya a muna-là mǝnana a dǝm wun ngga. Kutio ma'wun ngga wun nǝ̀ kum mǝdambǝriso à kùrni, mǝnana kǝɓwa malaká eauwe a nzǝmi raka. Wu panzǝi, wu yinǝi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ kǝɓwa ɗì wun ama ace mana sǝ wu kǝ panzǝi le ka, wun nǝ̀ ne wi ama Ɓwamǝgule ma'sǝm</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ɓwamǝgule ma'sǝm: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mǝtala mǝdambǝriso.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <char style="wj">kǝ earce.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Yia mǝnana à túriá ka à wario à kya kumi kǝla mǝnana Yesu nea wia ka. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />À ndarǝ panzǝ mǝdambǝriso ka, amǝtale ɗia ama, &lt;&lt;Ace mana sǝ wu kǝ panzǝ mǝdambǝriso?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />À eare ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mǝtalabangŋo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mǝtale&gt;&gt;</char></note> kǝ earce.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />À yiu nǝ mǝdambǝriso aban Yesu. À makki agir-koarǝu malea a nzǝmi, pǝlǝa à eamsǝ Yesu amurí. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Nda ban o ka, ɓwapǝndǝa sárǝ́ki agir-koarǝu malea amur njargula.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Lang yi bwalǝna ban mǝnana njargula dili kam aban ká Nkono Olif ka, bundǝo mala amǝkpate mǝnia ka, à tita loasǝ già nǝ bumpwasǝa aban ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli, ace agir-ndǝlǝki mǝnana à sǝn ngga. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />À kǝ bang ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Ɓwangsǝban ɓǝ pa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">aban Murǝm mǝnana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">kǝ yiu aɓa lullǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Mǝtalabangŋo ka!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ang 118:26</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Dorǝpwala nda kam a kùli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">sǝ gulo ka aban Ɓakuli!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Aɓea amǝ Farisi mǝnana aɓa ɓwabundǝa ka à ne Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, sà arǝ alaggana mo ɓǝa pwalo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ bangga wun, ɓǝà duk ɗǝong ngga, atali nǝ akia wia ɓwangsǝkiban.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓua ace Urǝshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Lang Yesu yi gbashìnà Urǝshalima mǝsǝì nǝ̀ kpa arǝì ka, kara túr kúni a ɓua ace, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Eare mem ngga, we Urǝshalima, yalung ngga a súrǝ́nà rǝ gir mǝnana nǝ̀ yipò nǝ dorǝpwala ka. Sǝ ado ka à sǝmbǝrǝni, mǝsǝo pà nǝ̀ gandǝ sǝne ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" /><char style="wj">Aɓea pwari nda à kǝ yiu, mǝnana aɓio amǝbura nǝ̀ yia ɓak nggea zǝ̀kì mǝcandǝe, à nǝ̀ gumbǝlio aɓalǝu, sǝ à nǝ̀ gìr amuro a koya buì ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" /><char style="wj">À nǝ̀ yia arkio, à nǝ̀ sukkio a nzali, we wunǝ aɓwana mǝnana a ɓālǝo ka. À pà nǝ̀ ɗeki kǝ tali aban came amur ɓè ɗàng, acemǝnana we ka a súrǝ̀ pwari mǝnana Ɓakuli yiu nǝi ace amsǝo ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Pǝlǝa Yesu kutio, pǝr amǝ'kúrkúró a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;À gilǝni ama, &lt;Ɓala mem ngga nǝ̀ duk ɓala hiwi&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isha 56:7</ref></char>.</note>; <char style="wj">&lt;sǝ wun ngga wu nyesǝi duk npu mala amǝ'ɓǝmbǝriban!&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Ir 7:11</ref></char>.</note> &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Ko aya pwari ka Yesu na aban kanigir aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli. Agbani Pǝris andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa sǝ akapana mǝnana aɓa ɓwapǝndǝa ka, à kǝ alte à nǝ̀ wal-luí.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk 21:37</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Sǝ à kumbi ban ɗang, acemǝnana acau male pwan ɗenyicau mala ɓwapǝndǝa kat.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">À ɗiban amur Bangŋo mala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matiu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Markus 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />A ɓekǝ pwari Yesu ndaban kani aɓwana gìr a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, sǝ kǝ hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban, agbani pǝris, andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa, andǝ akapana yia kat à yiu a baní. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />À yì ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Bangga sǝm, nǝ ya rǝcandǝa sǝ a kǝ pakki amǝnia yì agir, sǝ yana po mǝnia yì gara mala pea ka?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu pǝlǝia wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝ nǝ ɗì wun gbal. Wu banggàm,</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" /><char style="wj">batisǝma mala Yohana ka, pur nǝ kuli le, ko pur nǝ ban ɓwapǝndǝa?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Pǝlǝa à pǝlǝki ce arǝarǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm bang ama &lt;Pur nǝ kuli ka,&gt; nǝ̀ ɗì sǝm ama, &lt;Sǝ palang sǝ wu pa ɓamur wun arǝì ɗàng?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Sǝ ɓǝ̀ sǝm na ama, &lt;Pur nǝ ban ɓwapǝndǝa ka, aɓwana mǝnia kat ka à nǝ̀ ɓukki sǝm, acemǝnana yia ka à eàrnà ama Yohana ka mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli na.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Pǝlǝa à eare ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm súrǝ̀ ban mǝnana pur kam ngga ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mim gbal ka pa mǝ nǝ bangga wun nǝ koya rǝcandǝa sǝ ǝn nggǝ pakki amǝnia yì agir ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ ɗenyi nǝ ɓaban</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matiu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Markus 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu lidǝmba aban ne aɓwana mǝnia yì kanicau ka ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 20:9">
    <char style="wj">Ɓè ɓwa tsǝk ɓaban nggun anap, sǝ nyesǝi pè aɓea amǝtúró rya, sǝ kutio o a bǝri banì kya sau kam.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20:9 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isha 5:1</ref>
      </char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" /><char style="wj">Kún pwan ɓǝlanggun anap karǝna adyan ngga, pǝlǝa túr ɓè mǝtúró-ɓala male a ban amǝtúró ɓǝà kya aki wi ɓǝlanggun. Kara amǝtúró yi walki mǝtúró-ɓala man, sǝ à pǝrì um nǝ ɓabui.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" /><char style="wj">Nyare túr ɓè mǝtúró-ɓala; yì gbal ka à walki à lǝmdǝì wi gìr kǝsǝkya sǝ à pǝri um nǝ ɓabui.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" /><char style="wj">Nyar ɗǝm túr tàruià; à yì tsǝki wi anpenye à ramte à túri nǝ nza.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />
    <char style="wj">Pǝlǝa mǝtala ɓaban na ama, &lt;&lt;Mana ado mǝ nǝ pa? Mǝ nǝ tasǝ munem mǝnana ǝn earkiyi ace raka, yakǝla à nǝ̀ pe wi gulo!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />
    <char style="wj">Lang amǝtúró nǝ̀ yia sǝni ka, à kur kunarǝia amurí ama, &lt;&lt;Yauwa! Mǝnia ka nda mǝliɓala. Sǝm nǝ̀ wal-luí, sǝ ɓaban ngga nǝ̀ duk ma'sǝm!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" /><char style="wj">Pǝlǝa à yasǝlǝi à túri nǝ nzǝm nkāndan, sǝ à kar atè à kya wali wu.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Pǝlǝa Yesu ɗiban ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mana ado wu kǝ sǝni mǝnia yì mǝtala ɓaban ngga nǝ̀ yia pakkia wia?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" /><char style="wj">Nǝ̀ yiu nǝ̀ yia wal-lú amǝtúró mǝnia sǝ nǝ̀ nyesǝ ɓaban nǝ̀ pe aɓea aɓwana!&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Lang ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ ok mǝnia ka à na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli twalban mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Pǝlǝa Yesu sǝnia kyap-kyap sǝ na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Sǝ mana ɗe nda tǝrcau mǝnana malǝmce bangŋi ama:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt; &lt;Tali mǝnana amǝɓa ɓinǝi ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">nda à nyesǝi yi bwal </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">ɓǎ kàngkàng ngga.&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20:17 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ang 118:22</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓwa mǝnana kat sǝ kpa amur mǝno yì tali ka nǝ̀ arkya nǝ̀ mesǝke mwashat-mwashat, sǝ ɓwa mǝnana tali man kpa amurí ka, nǝ̀ betǝki.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa andǝ agbani Pǝris alta njargula mǝnana à nǝ̀ bwali nǝi tsuk-tsuk ka, acemǝnana à sǝlǝna ama mǝnia yì kanicau ka nda a rǝia. Sǝa ma ɓangciu kǝ pakkia wia arǝ aɓwana.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">À ɓariki à nǝ̀ tsǝki Yesu gbǝ́lî</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matiu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Markus 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Aɓi-mǝbura tsǝki wi mǝsǝu, pǝlǝa à tasǝ amǝ'iucau, mǝnana à lǝmdǝa kǝla amǝ'mǝsǝcau na ka. A ɗenyicau malea ka à nǝ̀ bwal Yesu aɓa cau mǝnana pur a kúni ka, sǝ à nǝ̀ ká nǝi a ɓabù mǝtala-nzali, yì nggwamna mala amǝ Roma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Pǝlǝa amǝ'iucau ɗì Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, sǝm sǝlǝ ama cau mo andǝ kanigir mo ka mǝsǝcau na kat. Aɓwana kat a bano ka amǝ'mwashati na. A kǝ kani njargula mala Ɓakuli nǝ mǝsǝcau. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Nggearǝì ka ɓoaro ɓǝ̀ sǝm mbwe Kaisar, murǝm mǝgule mala amǝ nzali Roma boalo-cemi le, ko ɓǝ̀ sǝm ká pe wi ɗang?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yì ka, súrǝ́nà ɓá kutan malea pǝlǝa nea wia ama, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" /><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu lǝmdǝam mǝsǝboalo dinari. Ɓamǝsǝ ɓwa andǝ gir mǝnana à gilǝa rǝì ka mala yana?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">À eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mala Kaisar na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ma, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu pè Kaisar gìr mǝnana mala Kaisar na ka, sǝ Ɓakuli ka wu pè wi gìr mǝnana male na ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />À gandǝ kume nǝ ɓwarkio aɓa cau male a ɓadǝm ɓwapǝndǝa ɗang. À ndali nǝ cau male, kara à do kunia ɗǝong.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗiban amur loapi ɓembe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matiu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Markus 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Sǝ aɓea amǝ Saduki, mǝnana à na ama aɓwana pà nǝ̀ lo anzǝm lú raka, à yiu a ban Yesu nǝ ɗiban. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />À na ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 20:28">Malǝm, Musa gilǝa sǝm ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ mǝ'eam ɓwa wú sǝ ɗeki māmí amuna pà kàm raka, ɓwe ka nǝ̀ al mā-lú ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ ɓǝli mǝ'eambi amuna.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Nggur 25:5</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 25:6">6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Sǝ a pwarian ngga aɓea aɓwana ndakam yia tongno-nong-ɓari à nda amǝ'eambu. Mǝdǝmba al ɓwama yi wu à pànǝ muna ɗang. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Sǝ ɓaria ka anggo gbal, al ɓwame sǝ yi wu pànǝ muna ɗang. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Tàruia gbal ka yi twal ɓwame, anggo sǝ yia mǝnia tongno-nong-ɓari ka à yì wúkio à ɗeki ɓwama, ko kǝ muna pa kàm ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />A masǝlǝate ka, ɓwama gbal ka yi wu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Sǝ ado ka, a pwari loapi ɓembe ka nǝ̀ duk mālá yana ateà le, acemǝnana yia mǝnia tongno-nong-ɓari ka à dumǝna nǝi?<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu earia wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 20:34">
    <char style="wj">Aɓwana mǝnana a ɓanza man ngga à kǝ al rǝia sǝ à kǝ isǝ amunia.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" /><char style="wj">Sǝ aɓwana mǝnana à sǝnia à kārǝ́na à nǝ̀ lo a ɓembe sǝ à nǝ̀ kum kutio a ɓanza mǝno kǝ yiu ka, à pà nǝ̀ al rǝia ko à nǝ̀ isǝ amunia ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" /><char style="wj">Sǝ à pà nǝ̀ wu ɗǝm ɗàng, acemǝnana à nda kǝla amǝturonjar. Amuna mala Ɓakuli na. Yia ka à nda ka ɓwana mǝnana à loapi ɓembe ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><char style="wj">Sǝ amur cau mala loapi ɓembe ka, nggearǝ Musa ka lǝmdǝ ama alú nǝ̀ loapi ɓembe. Aɓa cau mǝnana à gilǝe amur mǝ'nkwarki mǝnana kǝ earki bǝsa ka, bang ama Mǝtalabangŋo ka nda, &lt;&lt;Ɓakuli mala Ibǝrayim, Ɓakuli mala Ishaku, sǝ Ɓakuli mala Yakupu.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Pur 3:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" /><char style="wj">Yì ka, Ɓakuli mala alú na ɗang, nda Ɓakuli mala aɓwana mǝnana nǝ yilǝmu ka, acemǝnana sǝlǝna ama yia kat ka à ndanǝ yilǝmu.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Aɓea amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa pǝlǝi wi ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, cau mo ka mǝsǝcau na!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Anggo ka kǝɓwa nyare loasǝ kúni ama nǝ̀ ɗì ɓekǝ cau ɗǝm ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kǝrǝsti, Mǝ'amsǝban ngga <optbreak /> muna mala yana na?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matiu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Markus 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu pǝlǝa turia wia ɓè ɗiban ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mana tsǝa sǝ à kǝ na ama Kǝrǝsti</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mezaya&gt;&gt;</char></note> <char style="wj">ka Muna mala Dauda</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muna mala Dauda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Ko Mǝkà Dauda.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <char style="wj">na?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><char style="wj">Dauda nǝ nggearǝì ka bang aɓa malǝmce mala Anggyal ama,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ɓakuli Mǝtalabangŋo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">ne Mǝtalem ama,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">Do a buam mǝlì</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />
    <char style="wj">she ɓǝn nyesǝna</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="wj">aɓio-mǝbura à pǝlǝna</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="wj">muna-buno tsǝk kusǝu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="wj">a ɓakusǝo ka.&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">20:43 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ang 110:1</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />
    <char style="wj">Dauda ka tunǝ Kǝrǝsti ama &lt;Mǝtalem.&gt; Sǝ palang ado sǝ Kǝrǝsti duk muni ɗǝm?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nunkir amǝtè arǝ <optbreak /> amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Markus 12:38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Luka 11:37-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Lang aɓwana kat nda arǝ kwaki kiria à nǝ̀ nggǝ oè ka, Yesu pǝlǝa ne alaggana male ama, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" /><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu tsǝkir wun arǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa. À earce gya nǝ anggea-daura, sǝ à earce ɓǝà kǝ makkia wia kun aɓalǝ alimo, à earce aban-do mǝɓoarne arǝ andakpapi andǝ abuno mala aɓwana-mǝgule arǝ aban pakkiɗire lìli.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" /><char style="wj">À kǝ ɓǝmbǝri amā-lú arǝ agirkuma malea, sǝ à kǝ ɓosǝki aɓwana nǝ pakki ahiwi mǝ'sake. A ulang yia ka à nǝ̀ pakkia wia ɓashi mǝcandǝe.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Mā-lú mana pa gir <optbreak /> mana ndanǝi kat ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Markus 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Lang Yesu loasǝ mǝsǝì ka, sǝn amǝ kume à nda rǝ turki aɓoro malea aɓa akwati boalo mǝnana aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli ka. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ɗǝm ngga mǝsǝì kpa arǝ ɓe mā-lú, mǝ'tǝ̀r, aban túr amǝsǝ-boalo mǝkèke ɓari. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Pǝlǝa Yesu na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝsǝcau, ǝn nggǝ bangga wun ama mǝnia yì mā-lú mǝtapwasǝa ka, nda túr gìr mǝnana kútì malea ka kat.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana aɓwana mǝnia kat ka à tù aɓa kume malea mǝnana kpǝm ngga, sǝ yì ka, aɓa tǝ̀r male sǝ pa gìr mǝnana kat ndanǝi ace do male ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agir-lǝmdǝa mala masǝlǝata ɓanza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matiu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Markus 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Aɓea alaggana male na aban naki acau amur ɓoarjam mala Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli mǝnana à gilǝki nǝ atali mǝɓoarkijami, andǝ aɓoro mǝnana à tària ace pe Ɓakuli ka. Pǝlǝa Yesu na ama, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" /><char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ mala agir mǝnana wu kǝ sǝnia à nda ka, ɓè pwari nǝ̀ yiu mǝnana kǝ ɓè tali pa kàm à nǝ̀ ɗeki aban came amur ɓè ka ɗàng. Komǝyenani ka à nǝ̀ rambi à nǝ̀ turi a nzali.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nunkiru amur atanni mana à kǝ yiu ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matiu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Markus 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Pǝlǝa à ɗì Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;Malǝm, amǝnia yì agir ka a ya pwari sǝ à nǝ̀ kumban? Ɗǝm ngga mana girnì na nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama à mala à nǝ̀ kumban?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Sǝ Yesu pǝlǝia wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 21:8">
    <char style="wj">Wu parkir wun ɓǝà kǝa swárki wun ɗàng. Acemǝnana aɓwana pas à nǝ̀ yiu aɓa lullǝam, à nǝ̀ nggǝ bang ama, yia ka à nda ka Kǝrǝsti, ɗǝm ngga à nǝ̀ na ama, &lt;&lt;Pwari gbàshìnà!&gt;&gt; Wu kǝa kpata cau malea ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ wu ok cau mala a'lwa andǝ amunǝo ka, cala ɓangciu pakka wun ɗàng. Amǝnia yì agir ka dumǝna púp à nǝ̀ ak dǝmba kumban, sǝ masǝlǝata ɓanza malaká yiu peatu ɗàng.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Pǝlǝa lidǝmba aban nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 21:10">
    <char style="wj">Nzali nǝ̀ lo nǝ lwa arǝ ɓe nzali, sǝ domurǝm nǝ̀ lo arǝ ɓe domurǝm.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" /><char style="wj">Agǝggǝli mǝcandǝe mala nzali nǝ̀ kumban, nzala nǝ̀ kpa, akwánó ɓanza ɗàngɗáng nǝ̀ puro arǝ aban pas. Agir kàrmúrû andǝ agir-lǝmdǝa mǝgulke à nǝ̀ pur nǝ kuli.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />
    <char style="wj">Sǝ kaniama amǝnia yì agir nǝ̀ kumban ngga, à nǝ̀ bwalki wun, à nǝ̀ pà wun tanni. À nǝ̀ ká nǝ wun a ɓashi arǝ andakpapi, à nǝ̀ kùr wun arǝ andakùrban, à nǝ̀ kánǝ wun aban amurǝma andǝ anggwamna, acemǝnana wu nda ka amǝ kpatam ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" /><char style="wj">Mǝnia ka nǝ̀ pa wun dǝmbu hamnǝ Cau Amsǝban mem.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">Wu twali a ɓabum wun ama, pa wu nǝ̀ do nǝ ɓalǝkasǝkya arǝ cau mǝnana wun nǝ̀ na aban ɓashi ka ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana mǝ nǝ pà wun acau andǝ sǝlǝe mǝnana kǝɓwa pà kàm atà amǝ ɓinǝmúr wun mǝnana nǝ̀ gandǝ cam a kún wun, ko nǝ̀ makgìr cau ma'wun ngga ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" /><char style="wj">Nggearǝ aɓwana mǝnana à ɓǝl wun, andǝ amǝ'eam wun, aɓǝla andǝ agyajam ma'wun ngga, à nǝ̀ pà wun nzǝmia, à nǝ̀ wal-lú ka aɓea ɓwana aɓalǝ wun.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" /><char style="wj">Aɓwana kat nǝ̀ ɓinǝmǝsǝ wun acemǝnana wu nda ka amǝkpatam ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ko nyang múr wun mwashat ka pà nǝ̀ kpa a nzali ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" /><char style="wj">Mǝsǝkang-kangŋa ma'wun na nǝ̀ amsǝ wun, nǝ̀ pa wun yilǝmu mǝnana málá male pà kàm raka.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bangcau ama à nǝ̀ <optbreak /> kiɗikí Urǝshalima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matiu 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Markus 13:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ wu sǝnǝna asoje à yì karina Urǝshalima ka, wu sǝlǝ ama kpa male gbàshìnà.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" /><char style="wj">Sǝ anggo ka aɓwana mǝnana a nzali Yahudi ka, ɓǝà ɓangŋa ɓǝà eauwe amur ankono, aɓwana mǝnana aɓa là ka ɓǝà puro, sǝ aɓwana mǝnana a bondo ka ɓǝà kǝa kutio aɓa là ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana mǝnia yì pwari ka mala mbweban nutanni na, ace lùmsǝ agir mǝnana kat à gilǝì aɓa Malǝmce mala Ɓakuli ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" /><char style="wj">Aɓalǝ apwari mǝno ka, gìr mǝsǝswatǝr na nǝ amamǝna mǝnana nǝ amuna a bumia, andǝa mǝnana à kǝ pea amuna kiura ka! Nggea tanni kǝ̀rkǝ́r nǝ̀ yiu amur mǝnia yì nzali, sǝ bumlulla mala Ɓakuli nǝ̀ sulǝo amur amǝnia yì aɓwana ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" /><char style="wj">À nǝ̀ wal-lú aɓea ɓwana ateà nǝ nggeabyau, sǝ aɓea ɓwana ka à nǝ̀ bwalia guro à nǝ̀ umnǝia arǝ anzali kat mala ɓanza. Aɓwana mana amǝ Isǝrayila na raka, à nǝ̀ parki Urǝshalima aɓata rǝcandǝa malea, à nǝ̀ pàkce acau male ɓà, bà lùmsǝo mala apwari mana Ɓakuli kasǝa acea, yia aɓwana mana amǝ Isǝrayila na raka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lùmsǝo mala apwari mana Ɓakuli kasǝa acea. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝnia ka nda lùmsǝo mala apwari mana Ɓakuli tsǝ́ngŋǝ̀nà ace yinǝ aɓwana mala acili anzali ɓanza aɓa kane male, anzǝm ginǝe mana ginǝki amǝ Isǝrayila (ace mgbikiru malea), sǝ ado ka nǝ̀ nyesǝia ɗǝm ɓǝà pa a ɓaɓalǝu ace bwal anggúr túró aɓa kàne male ka; ko she málá mala apwari mana Ɓakuli kasǝnì aɓwana mana à súrǝì raka, ɓǝà yálmúr nggea-là Urǝshalima ka.</char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:3">Zak 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:18">Isha 63:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:2">Sǝn 11:2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓaria yiu mala Muna Mala Ɓwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matiu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Markus 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <char style="wj">Agir-lǝmdǝa nǝ̀ purkio aɓa pwari, andǝ zongŋo andǝ anlero. A ɓanza ka, ɓwapǝndǝa kat nǝ̀ do nǝ ɓalǝkasǝkya andǝ gakkya mala ɗenyicau, à nǝ̀ pǝlǝ nǝ ɓālǝia ɓà nǝ ɓangciu arǝ songnǝo mala nggeamùr andǝ eaki-nkono male.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21:25 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isha 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezǝk 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:31">Jol 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Sǝn 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" /><char style="wj">Ɓwapǝndǝa nǝ̀ wukiaban ace ɓangciu, ɓālǝia nǝ̀ kasǝkya arǝ gir mǝnana nǝ̀ sulǝo amur ɓanza ka, acemǝnana à nǝ̀ dǝurǝki anggea gìr mǝgulke mǝnana a kùli ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><char style="wj">Anggo ka à nǝ̀ sǝn Muna Mala Ɓwa aban yiu aɓa pǝrɓang nǝ rǝcandǝa andǝ ɓoarɓwa mǝgule.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Sǝn 1:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ amǝnia yì agir tinata kumban ngga, wu lo, wu loasǝ múr wun a kùli, acemǝnana pwari akmúr wun gbàshìnà.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanicau arǝ nggun vwari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matiu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Markus 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia mǝnia yì kanicau ka:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 21:29">
    <char style="wj">Wu sǝn nggun vwari andǝ acili anggun kat.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" /><char style="wj">Ɓǝà tinata to mbuia ka, wun nǝ ɓamur rǝ wun ngga, wun nǝ̀ sǝni sǝ wun nǝ̀ sǝlǝ ama mbulo gbashìnà.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" /><char style="wj">Anggo gbal, ɓǝ̀ wu sǝnǝna amǝnia yì agir à ndaban pakki ka, wu sǝlǝ ama Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka gbàshìnà.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />
    <char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun mǝsǝcau ama, tà mǝnia yì nza ka pà nǝ̀ mal ɗang she ɓǝ̀ amǝnia yì agir kat ka à kumǝnaban ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" /><char style="wj">Kùli andǝ nzali ka tea nǝ̀ malâ, sǝ Cau mem ngga tè pà nǝ̀ mal ɗang ko bǝti.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />
    <char style="wj">Wu parkir wun wu kǝa eare ɓǝ̀ ɗenyicau ma'wun lùmsǝ nǝ likiagir, wal-wale andǝ pisǝɓalǝu arǝ alta agir ɓanza, gandǝa mǝno yì pwari ka nǝ̀ yia yasǝlǝ wun ngga ɗàng.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" /><char style="wj">Kǝla gbǝ́lî, nǝ̀ yiu amur aɓwana mǝnana a ɓanza kat ka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" /><char style="wj">Wu dum nǝ mǝsǝ wun ko aya pwari, nǝ́ pak hiwi ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu apî amǝnia yì agir mana à mala à nǝ̀ kumban, sǝ ɗǝm ngga ɓǝ̀ wu kum kusǝu came a ɓadǝm Muna mala Ɓwa ka.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Ko aya pwari ka Yesu nda aban kanigir aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, sǝ nǝ pwarikpana ka nǝ̀ o a múr mǝ'nkono mǝnana à tunǝki ama Nkono Olif ka nǝ̀ nggá nong kam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Sǝ nǝ bu dǝmbari ka aɓwana kat kǝ yiua ok kanigir male a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Aɓwana amǝgule kurkunarǝia <optbreak /> à nǝ̀ wal Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matiu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Markus 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ado ka, pwari Ɗire mala Bǝredi mana kǝ lo raka, mǝnana à tunǝki ama &lt;&lt;Ɗire Yàlîmurû&gt;&gt; ka gbàshìnà.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Pur 12:1-27</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Agbani pǝris andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa came arǝ alta njargula mǝnana à nǝ̀ wal Yesu nǝi aɓa sǝmbǝrǝa ka, acemǝnana ɓangciu kǝ pakkia wia arǝ aɓwana malea.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Pǝlǝa Shetan kutio arǝ Yahuda mǝnana à tunǝki ama Iskariyoti ka. Yì ka, nda aɓalǝ alaggana mala Yesu mana lum-nong-ɓari ka. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yahuda wari aban agbani pǝris andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ yál Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, à nacau andǝia, amur njar mǝnana nǝ̀ pa Yesu nǝi a buia ka. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Banɓoaria wia, kara à eare ama à nǝ̀ pe wi boalo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yì ka, eare, pǝlǝa kútí a alta njar mǝnana nǝ̀ kùmô sǝ nǝ̀ pea wia Yesu nǝi a pwari mǝnana ɓwabundǝa pà kàm raka.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masǝlǝata li girlina mala Yesu <optbreak /> andǝ alaggana male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matiu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Markus 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Lang Lamsan mala Bǝredi mana kǝ lo raka tinate, a pwari walki anzur mala Ɗire Yàlîmurû ka, <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu tasǝ Bitǝrus andǝ Yohana, nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu kyane wu kya gilǝkia sǝm girlina mala Ɗire Yàlîmurû mǝnana sǝm nǝ̀ li ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />À ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A ya ban sǝ ɓǝ̀ sǝm kya pak túró girline?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kutio ma'wun a nggea-là ani ka, wun nǝ̀ je wunǝ ɓe ɓwabura nǝ bàng-mùr amurí. Wu kya atè a ɓala mǝnana nǝ̀ kútí kam ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" /><char style="wj">Wu ne mǝtala-ɓalae ama, &lt;Malǝm nǝ̀ túr sǝm ɓǝ̀ sǝm ɗio ama: Bansulǝo mǝnana nǝ̀ li girlina Ɗire Yàlîmurû kam andǝ alaggana male ka, nda a ya ban?&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" /><char style="wj">Nǝ̀ lǝmdǝa wun rǝ ɓe ndà-kulí mǝgule, à gilǝkina ɓālǝi. A kam sǝ wun nǝ̀ pak túró girlina.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Pǝlǝa à wario à kya kum girbunda kǝla mǝnana Yesu nea wia ka. Pǝlǝa à pak túró girlina Ɗire Yàlîmurû.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Girlina pwarikpǝra mala Mǝtalabangŋo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matiu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Markus 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Amǝ Korinti 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Lang pwari kārǝ́na ka, Yesu andǝ amǝ'mishan male do aban li girlina. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Pǝlǝa nea amǝ'mishan male ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən earǝna ce li girlina Ɗire Yàlîmurû mǝnia ka kǝ̀rkǝ́r sǝnǝa wun, sǝ ɓǝ̀n kutio a tanni!</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ǝn nggǝ na wun, pa mǝ nǝ li ɗǝm ɗàng, she pwari mana ɓǝ̀ kya lumsǝna a Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Pǝlǝa Yesu twal kwap mala mùr-ɓǝlanggun anap, sǝ pakki Ɓakuli yàwá, sǝ na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu ak mǝnia ka, wu gakkia rǝ wun.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" /><char style="wj">Ən nggǝ na wun ama, twal ado ka pà mǝ nǝ nu mùr-ɓǝlanggun anap ɗǝm ɗàng, she ɓǝ̀ Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli yina ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Pǝlǝa twal bǝredi, pakki Ɓakuli yàwá, ɓwani, sǝ pea wia, nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda nggūrǝam, mǝnana ǝn pa ace wun ngga, wu kǝ pak mǝnia ka, ace ɗenyi nǝ mim.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Anzǝm girlina ka, twal ɓè kwap mala mùr-ɓǝlanggun anap a buì, sǝ na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kwap mǝnia ka, nda bǝsa kùrcau a nre Ɓakuli andǝ aɓwana male, mǝnana à kurrì nǝ nkílèm mana à sukki ace wun ngga. </char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Ir 31:31-34</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" /><char style="wj">Sǝ wu sǝni! Ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ kúrkúró nǝ mim ngga nda aɓalǝ sǝm aban li kani atàm!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Ang 41:9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><char style="wj">Lú mala Muna mala Ɓwa ka nǝ̀ pa kǝla mǝnana Ɓakuli kani ka, sǝ caukwanban na nǝ ɓwa mǝnana me ka!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Alaggana tita ɗiki rǝarǝia ko yana ɓwe na aɓalǝia mǝnana nǝ̀ pak mǝnia yì gir ka.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makgir amur gulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Makgir pǝlǝa lo a nrea amur ko yana aɓalǝia nda ɓwamǝgule malea kat.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mat 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mar 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9:46</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mar 10:42-44</ref></char>.</note> Yesu nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 22:25">
    <char style="wj">Amurǝma mala amǝɓanza ka à kǝ lǝmdǝ rǝcandǝa amur aɓwana, sǝ amǝ'lǝmdǝ gulo amur aɓwana ka à kǝ tunǝ ɓamuria ama, &lt;&lt;agyajam mala ɓwapǝndǝa.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><char style="wj">Sǝ wun ngga, anggo sǝ wun nǝ̀ pak ɗàng. Ma'wun ngga, ɓwa mǝnana gula wun kat ka nda nǝ̀ dupa wun kǝla muna kat ka, gbani gbal ka nda rítǎu.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><char style="wj">Yana nda ɓwamǝgule, ɓwa mǝnana do a ban-li ka le, ko ɓwa mǝnana kǝ gaki girlina ka? Nda ɓwa mǝnana do a ban-li ka re? Sǝ mim ngga ǝn do aɓalǝ wun kǝla mǝ gau girlina.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Yoh 13:12-15</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />
    <char style="wj">Wu nda ka aɓwana mǝnana wu came a nzǝmam aɓa kārǝkiban mǝnana kumam ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" /><char style="wj">Ace mani ka, ǝn pana wun gara-murǝm, kǝla mǝnana Tárrám pam ngga.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><char style="wj">Wun nǝ̀ li, sǝ wun nǝ̀ nu atàm a Domurǝm mem, sǝ wun nǝ̀ do amur abuno-murǝm aban ɓashia atau mala Amǝ Isǝrayila mǝnia lum-nong-ɓari ka.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bang ama Shiman <optbreak /> nǝ̀ yia tǝmce súrǝè</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matiu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Markus 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu banggi Bitǝrus ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Shiman, Shiman! Kwaki kiro! Shetan kǝ alte ama nǝ̀ sárǝ́ki wun kǝla sárǝ́ mǝsǝsa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" /><char style="wj">Sǝ mim ngga ǝn pangŋa hiwi aceo we Shiman, ace mǝnana paɓamuru mo ɓǝ̀ kǝa kpa ɗang. Sǝ ɓǝ̀a longŋa ka, ɓak ɓabum amǝ'eambo.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Bitǝrus eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalem, ǝn shamna bumam mǝ nǝ o atò a ndàkurban, sǝ mǝ nǝ wu atò!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu pǝlǝi wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ən nggǝ no we Bitǝrus, yalung mǝnia ka kaniama nggu nǝ̀ ɓua ka, a nǝ tǝmcem kusǝ tàrú ama a súrǝàm ɗang!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu alita ɓamur rǝ wun ndaboalo <optbreak /> andǝ luru andǝ nggeabyau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu pǝlǝa ɗì alaggana male ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;A pwari mǝno ǝn túr wun wu kya hamnǝ cau mem, sǝ wu pànǝ ndaboalo, ko luru-gya, ko ankura raka, wu ɗwanyi kǝgìr le?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">À eare ama &lt;&lt;Awo!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:9">Mat 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mar 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Sǝ ado ka, koyana sǝ ndanǝ ndaboalo ko luru ka, ɓǝ̀ twali. Sǝ ɓwa mǝnana pànǝ nggeabyau raka, ɓǝ̀ mak daura-múrɓì male ɓǝ̀ kúrô.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><char style="wj">Mǝ ndaban bangga wun ama cau mǝnana à gilǝì aɓa Malǝmce ama, &lt;À oasǝi atà amǝ'cauɓikea&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isha 53:12</ref></char>.</note> <char style="wj">ka, nǝ̀ lùmsǝo a muram pup. E, gìr mǝnana à gilǝì a muram ngga nda kǝ yiu a lùmsǝo ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Pǝlǝa alaggana male ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝtalabangŋo! Sǝni! Anggea-byau ndya ɓari ka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Pǝlǝa Yesu banggia wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kārǝ́na ana!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pak hiwi amur Nkono Olif</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matiu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Markus 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu lo o amur Nkono Olif kǝla mǝnana pakkiyi pwari-pwari ka. Pǝlǝa alaggana male o atè. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />À kya bwalǝna banì ka, Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu pak hiwi, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu kǝa kpa aɓa kārǝkiban raka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Pǝlǝa upia wia zak, kya kū`ndǝó pak hiwi, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Dâ, ɓǝ̀ awu nǝ ear ka, twàlâm mǝnia yì kwap mala tanni ka: sǝ mǝnia ka nê mem ma ɗang, ɓǝ̀ do ama nê mò na.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Kara mǝturonjar sulǝo a baní, ɓak ɓabumi. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Sǝ acemǝnana nda aɓa bumkiɗikea mǝgule ka, kutio arǝ hiwi nǝ rǝcandǝa. Piban mǝnana pur arǝì ka kǝ surkio a nzali kǝla nkila.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Lang Yesu loapi ban hiwi ka, nyare a ban alaggana male kya kumia a ntulo, acemǝnana à nda aɓa bumkiɗikea, mǝnana ɓungi rǝia ka. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mana tsǝa sǝ wu kùtí a nong'ntullo? Wu lo, wu pak hiwi, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu kǝa kpa aɓa kārǝkiban ɗang.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Kúni malaká pwal arǝ cau ɗang, kara ɓwabundǝa yi tusǝna. Yahuda, mwashat aɓalǝ alaggana Lum-nong-ɓari ka, nǝ̀ yinǝia. Pǝlǝa sung a ban Yesu, mǝn abui kùrrì arǝì. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu pǝlǝa ɗì ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Yahuda, a ndarǝ kúrkúró nǝ Muna Mala Ɓwa nǝ nuban a nkiu?&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Lang alaggana mala Yesu mǝnana atè sǝn gìr mǝno nǝ̀ kumban ngga, pǝlǝa à ɗì ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ sǝm paktúró nǝ anggea-byau ma'sǝm le, Mǝtalabangŋo?&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Kara mwashat aɓalǝ alaggana mala Yesu kwetǝ nggeabyau male, kwar guro mala Pǝris Mǝgule, kasǝ kiri mǝlì kpat.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Pǝlǝa Yesu na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ go anggo!&gt;&gt;</char> Pǝlǝa je kir ɓwabure, sonzǝì.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesu pǝlǝa ne agbani pǝris andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ'yál Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, mǝnana à yiu arǝì ka ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu yiu a rǝam nǝ anggea-byau andǝ agara-kwalta kǝla mǝ nda ɓwamǝgule mala amǝ'soakitau?</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><char style="wj">Ko aya pwari ka mǝ nda atà wun aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, sǝ wu loasǝ kun wun a rǝàm ɗàng. Sǝ bu-pwari man she ka ma'wun na, andǝ mala rǝcandǝa mala pǝndǝa.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus tǝmce súrǝ̀ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matiu 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Markus 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />À bwal Yesu, sǝ à dǝshina ɓala mala Pǝris Mǝgule nǝi. Sǝ Bitǝrus ka, tārǝtè kǝ o ateà. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Amǝ'yál palta ka à bwalǝna bǝsa a cengge à dumǝna a kúni. Pǝlǝa Bitǝrus yi do ateà. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ɓè muna-ɓwama, mǝtúró-ɓala sǝni aban do a kun bǝsa. Sǝni kyap-kyap sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝnia yì ɓwa ka, nda atè.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Bitǝrus pǝlǝa tǝmce ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwama, ǝn súrǝ̀ ɓwe ɗàng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Zuku ka, ɓeɓwa sǝn Bitǝrus sǝ na ama, &lt;&lt;We ka, a nda tea!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Bitǝrus eare ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwabura! Mǝ nda ɗang!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Anzǝm kǝla bu-pwari mwashat ka, ɓeɓwa cam kingging ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓafo, mǝnia yì ɓwa ka nda atè, acemǝnana yì gbal ka ɓwa Galili na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Bitǝrus ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwabura! Ən súrǝ̀ cau mǝnana a banggiyi ka ɗàng!&gt;&gt; Kúni malaká pwal ɗàng, kara nggu ɓua. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mǝtalabangŋo pǝlǝ mǝsǝì sǝn Bitǝrus. Ɓalǝ Bitǝrus kasǝa arǝ cau mǝnana Mǝtalabangŋo ne wi ama: <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kaniama nggu nǝ̀ ɓua a bu du man yalung ngga, a nǝ tǝmce súrǝàm kusǝ tàrú.&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Pǝlǝa puro a nza kya ɓua kǝ̀rkǝ́r.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amǝ'yálban oal Yesu, sǝ a walki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matiu 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Markus 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Aɓwana mǝnana à cia ɓǝa yál Yesu ka, à oali, oalban kyauwikiban sǝ à walki. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />À kùr amǝsǝì; pǝlǝa à koè a takiri sǝ à ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;Na sǝm, yana ɓwe na walo ka, we mǝɓangnǝa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />À naki wi acau mǝkwanrui sǝ à kǝ sanggì.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">À warinǝ Yesu a ɓadǝmbǝ amǝkùrcau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matiu 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Markus 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Lang ban fana ka, aɓwana-mǝgule, amǝkùrcau mala amǝ Yahudi, agbani pǝris andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa, yi ramba, pǝlǝa à yinǝ Yesu a ɓadǝmbia. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />À ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ a nda Kǝrǝsti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:67 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mezaya&gt;&gt;</char></note> Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana Ɓakuli turi ka, na sǝm.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu earia wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ ǝn bangga wun ngga, pà wun nǝ̀ earnǝ mim ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" /><char style="wj">Sǝ ɓǝ̀n ɗì wun ngga, pà wu nǝ̀ pam eare ɗang.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" /><char style="wj">Twal ado aban ká ka, Muna Mala Ɓwa nǝ̀ do a bù-mǝlì mala Ɓakuli mǝnana Karmur gulo kat ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Pǝlǝa yia kat ka à sà'arǝì ama, &lt;&lt;A ndarǝ bang ama a nda Muna mala Ɓakuli le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Pǝlǝa pea wia eare ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Kǝ ndo wu na ka, Mǝ nda.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Pǝlǝa à na ama, &lt;&lt;Ya cau ɗǝm sǝm alta oe? Sǝm ongŋǝni àkǝ̀ mburkuni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">A warinǝ Yesu a ɓadǝm <optbreak /> nggwamna Bilatus ɓwa Roma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matiu 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Markus 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Yia kat ka à lo à warinǝ Yesu a ɓadǝm Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Pǝlǝa à tita tsǝki wi acau arǝì ama, &lt;&lt;Sǝm kum mǝnia yì ɓwa ka aban soakita aɓwana, ama ɓǝà kǝa pè Kaisar, murǝm mǝgule mala amǝ Roma, boalo-cemi ɗàng. Ɗǝm ngga kǝ na ama, yì ka, nda Kǝrǝsti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kǝrǝsti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Mezaya,&gt;&gt; ɗǝm ngga a mǝsǝì 35 andǝ 39</char></note>, Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana Ɓakuli túrí ka, sǝ kǝ ne rǝì ama murǝm na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pǝlǝa Bilatus ɗì Yesu ama, &lt;&lt;A nda murǝm mala amǝ Yahudi le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu eare ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Nda kǝla mǝnana à na ka.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pǝlǝa Bilatus ne agbani pǝris andǝ aɓwana ama, &lt;&lt;Ən kum kǝgìr mǝɓane arǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Pǝlǝa à ginǝ kpékpé ama, &lt;&lt;Kànìgìr male aɓa nzali Yahudi kǝ tsǝk aɓwana ɓǝà loasǝ munǝo arǝ amǝ'talanzali Roma. Tita mǝnia yì gir ka a Galili, ndya yi bwalǝna ban man kat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Lang Bilatus nǝ̀ ok anggo ka, pǝlǝa ɗiban ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓwe ka ɓwa Galili na le?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Lang sǝlǝna ama Yesu ka puro a nzali mǝnana aɓata yálban mala murǝm Hirǝdus ka, pǝlǝa tasǝi a ban Hirǝdus, mǝnana yì gbal ka nda a Urǝshalima àkǝ̀ ɓalǝ anongge mǝno ka.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Lang Hirǝdus sǝn Yesu ka, banɓoari wi kǝ̀rkǝ́r, acemǝnana banì sauwuna nda ban alta sǝn Yesu. Aɓa cau mǝnana ok amurí ka, tsǝkbumi ama nǝ̀ sǝn Yesu aban pak gir'ndali. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Pǝlǝa ɗiki nǝ aɗiban pas, sǝ kǝ do mala Yesu kúni più. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Agbani pǝris andǝ amalǝm Nggurcau mala Musa mǝnana abanì ka, à lo nǝ rǝcandǝa aban tsǝki Yesu acau arǝì ɗàngɗáng. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hirǝdus andǝ asoje male pak ceì ɓà, à nyesǝi gìr oalo na. À makki wi adaura murǝm arǝì pǝlǝa à nyesǝi a ban Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Àkǝ̀ bu-pwari mǝno ka Hirǝdus andǝ Bilatus ka à duk agyajam, acemǝnana ɗiɗyal ka à earkiyi mǝsǝarǝia ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">À kasǝi Yesu ɓashi lú</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:5-26">Matiu 27:5-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Markus 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39--19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatus tunǝ agbani pǝris, andǝ aɓwana-mǝgule, andǝ acilia aɓwana. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Wu yiu nǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka a banam, wu na ama kǝ soakita aɓwana ɓǝà lo munǝo. Ən ɗiki akani amǝsǝ wun, sǝ aɓalǝ acau mǝnana wu bang amurí ka, ǝn kum ko kǝcau mwashat mǝnana mǝsǝcau na ka ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Hirǝdus gbal ka kumi nǝ kǝ cauɓikea ɗang, ndya nyesǝi a ban sǝm ngga. Kǝla mǝnana ado wu kǝ sǝni ka, kǝ ɓè gìr pà kàm pè mǝnana ɓoro ɓǝà wal-luí ace ka ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ace mani ka mǝ nǝ koè sǝ mǝ nǝ ɗeki ɓǝ̀ o.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[A koya Pwari Lamsan Yàlîmurû ka, dumǝna púp Bilatus nǝ̀ panzǝia wia ɓwa mwashat atà aɓwana mǝnana à kùrria ka.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ɓwabunda kat loasǝ già ama, &lt;&lt;Wal-lú mǝnia yì ɓwa ka! Panzǝa sǝm Barabbas!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Barabbas ka ɓeɓwa na à oasǝi a ndàkurban ace loasǝ munǝo mǝnana kumban aɓa Urǝshalima, sǝ ace wal-lú ɗǝm.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Bilatus ka kǝ earce ama nǝ̀ nying Yesu ɓǝ̀ o, nda sǝ nyare zǝmbia wia. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kara à came arǝ loasǝ già ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝà gballì a nggun! Ɓǝà gballì a nggun!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Bilatus nyar tàruià ka nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ace mana le? Ya cauɓikea nda mǝnia yì ɓwa ka pa? Ən kum kǝ mǝɓane mǝnana ɓǝà wal-luí ace ka ɗàng. Ace mani ka mǝ nǝ koè sǝ mǝ nǝ nyi ɓǝ̀ o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kara à loasǝ già kǝ̀rkǝ́r ama she ɓǝà gbàllì Yesu a nggun, gandǝa cau malea kya parban. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Bilatus gandǝa eare ama ɓǝà pakkia wia gìr mǝnana bumia kànì ka. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Panzǝia wia ɓwa mǝnana à earce ka ɓǝ̀ o, yì ɓwa mana à túrí a ndàkurban ace loasǝ munǝo andǝ wal-lú ka. Sǝ twal Yesu pea wia ɓǝà pakki wi gìr mǝnana bumia kànì ka.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">À gbàllì Yesu amur nggun-gangndǝi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matiu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Markus 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Lang à nungina Yesu aban o ka, à kya kum Shiman ɓwa Sayirin, pur nǝ ɓabondo nǝ̀ ká aɓa nggea-là. À bwali à parri wi nggun-gangndǝi amurí, sǝ à tsǝì ɓǝ̀ twali, ɓǝ̀ kpa nǝi atà Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ɓwabunda kǝ̀rkǝ́r kpate aban o andǝ amamǝna mǝnana à kǝ ɓua, à kǝ keban ace ka. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu pǝlǝ rǝì nea wia ama:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="LUK 23:28">
    <char style="wj">Wun amamǝna mala amǝ Urǝshalima, wu kǝa ɓua acem ɗàng, wu ɓua ace ɓamur rǝ wun andǝ amuna ma'wun.</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" /><char style="wj">Acemǝnana aɓea apwari nǝ̀ nggá yiu mǝnana wun nǝ̀ na ama, &lt;&lt;Tsǝkbu nda amur amamǝna mǝnana à nkombi na, mǝnana à ɓǝl àkǝ muna raka, andǝ akiura mǝnana kǝ muna nuia àkǝ̀ pwari raka!&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><char style="wj">A pwari mǝno ka,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Aɓwana nǝ̀ ne ankono</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">mǝdārike cau ama, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">&lt;Wu kpa amur sǝm!&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">Sǝ à nǝ̀ ne amuna-nkono ama,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">&lt;Wu kùmsǝó amur sǝm!&gt; &gt;&gt;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23:30 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>
      </char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />
    <char style="wj">Ɓǝ̀ ɓwapǝndǝa kǝ pak amǝnia yì agir, mǝnana nggun nda andǝa pwale ka, lang sǝ nǝ̀ pa, yì mǝnana ɓǝ̀ imǝna ka?</char><verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Aɓea aɓwana ɓari, yia kǝm ngga amǝ'ɓealɓikea na, à warinǝia à nǝ̀ nggá wal-luia andǝ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Lang à yì bwalǝna ban mǝnana à tunǝki ama, Nkpoula Ɓamuru ka, pǝlǝa à gbàllì Yesu kàm amur nggun-gangndǝi, atārǝia andǝ amǝ'ɓealɓikea mǝnia ɓari ka, mwashat atà buì mǝlì, sǝ man mwashat ka, atà buì mǝ'nggare. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Pǝlǝa Yesu na ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Dâ, twalia wia banì, acemǝnana à súrǝ̀ gir mana à pakkiyi ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Pǝlǝa asoje kocàca amur agir-nggūrǝu male, à gakkia rǝia.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Ɓwapǝndǝa came aban sǝnban, sǝ aɓwana-mǝgule oali, ama, &lt;&lt;Kǝ amsǝ aɓea aɓwana, ɓǝ̀ amsǝ ɓamur rǝì, ɓǝ̀ yì ka, nda Kǝrǝsti, Mǝ'amsǝban mǝnana Ɓakuli tarì ka!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Nggearǝ asoje gbal ka, à oali, sǝ à lo à yì pe wi mùr-ɓǝlanggun anap mǝhangŋe. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Sǝ à na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ a nda murǝm mala amǝ Yahudi ka, amsǝ ɓamur rǝò.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />A múrí a kùli arǝ kpamgbang ngga, à gilǝ amǝnia yì acau ka:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 23:38">&lt;&lt;ƁWA MƏNIA KA NDA MURƏM MALA AMƏ YAHUDI.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mwashat atà amǝ'ɓealɓikea mǝnana à gbàllia akanó ka, ne Yesu cau kyauwikiban gbal ama, &lt;&lt;A nda Kǝrǝsti mbak? Amsǝ ɓamur rǝò sǝ wu amsǝ sǝm!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ɓì mǝɓealɓikea gimbi ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;We ka, a ɓanggi Ɓakuli re, yi mǝnana kǝ ɓashi mǝ'mwashati mala lú nda à kàsǝô ka? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Ma'sǝm ngga à kasǝa sǝm ɓashi amur mǝsǝcau gìr mǝnana sǝm pè ka. Sǝ mǝnia yì ɓwa ka pàk kǝ mǝɓane ɗàng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Pǝlǝa na ama, &lt;&lt;Yesu, ɗenyi nǝ mim ɓǝà kutina a Domurǝm mò ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu earî wi ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓafo na ǝn nggǝ nô ka, yalung ngga a nda atàm a là do banɓoarna mala Ɓakuli.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">là do banɓoarna mala Ɓakuli: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ko &lt;&lt;Paradayis.&gt;&gt;</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lú mala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-46">Matiu 27:45-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Markus 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Lang pwari bwalǝna ɓong múrú ka, pǝndǝa yi gir ban, bà bu-pwari tàrú mala pwarikpǝra. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Lagir mǝnana à kasǝna Ban Mǝfele nǝi a Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli ka, kara zanzǝa a ɓalǝu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Pǝlǝa Yesu loasǝ gì bàng-bàng ama, &lt;&lt;<char style="wj">Dâ! A ɓabuo sǝ ǝn nggǝ pa bangŋo mem!&gt;&gt;</char> Lang bangŋǝna anggo ka, kara yilǝmi pùró.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Ang 31:5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ɓwamǝgule soje sǝn gìr mǝnana kumban ngga, ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli, na ama, &lt;&lt;Ɓafo na, mǝnia yì Ɓwa ka Mǝɓealɓoarna na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Lang ɓwabundǝa mǝnana ramba ace sǝn gbàllì Yesu, sǝn gìr mǝnana kumban ngga, à wal kikilia, à pǝlǝ nzǝmia à o nǝ bumkiɗikea. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Sǝ aɓwana mǝnana à súrǝ̀ Yesu, andǝ amamǝna mǝnana à pur andǝi a Galili ka, à cam zak, sǝ à kǝ sǝn amǝnia yì agir ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsǝkban mala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matiu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Markus 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Ɓè ɓwa nakam lùllǝì ama, Yisǝfu, ɓwa Arimatiya mala nzali Yahudi. Yì ka, nda aɓalǝ amǝ kùrcau mala amǝ Yahudi, mǝ'ɓealɓoarne na. Yì ka, gìr mǝnana aɓwana-mǝgule mala amǝ Yahudi pàk ka, earnǝ kǝ ɓè ateà ɗàng. Yì ka, ndarǝ kundǝ yiu mala Domurǝm mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yì nda mana wari a ban Bilatus kya zǝm lú Yesu ka. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Pǝlǝa kya sulǝ lú, marǝki aɓa nggurbyau pwasǝa, sǝ tsǝì a ɓembe mǝnana à tǝmi aɓa tali, yì mǝnana à malaká tsǝk kǝɓwa kàm raka. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Pwari mǝno ka nda pwari gilǝrǝu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:54 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pwari gilǝrǝu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ka nda pwari mana pwari Sabbat kpate ka, sǝ amǝno yì pwari ka dumǝna pup à nǝ̀ mal ko man kat ɓoaro ɓǝà pè ka sǝ ɓǝ̀ pwari Sabbat yiu, acemǝnana a pwari Sabbat ka amǝ Yahudi pà nǝ̀ pàk kǝ túró ɗang. Pwari na ace usǝlǝo.</char></note> ace Sabbat, mǝnana malanǝ̀ tite ka.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Amamǝna mana à yiu andǝ Yesu nǝ Galili ka à o atà Yisǝfu, à kya sǝn ɓembe andǝ nongsǝo mǝnana à nongsǝ luí a ɓembe ka. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Pǝlǝa à nyare à o a là, à kya alta amùrú andǝ amuku agir mǝ'rǝmɓoarne. Sǝ à usǝlǝo a Pwari Sabbat, acemǝnana ɓǝà kpata Nzongcau ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Pur 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Nggur 5:14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu loapi ɓembe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matiu 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Markus 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />A pwari Ladi, pwari mǝdǝmbe anzǝm pwari Sabbat nǝ budǝmbari ɗiɗyal, amamǝna twal muku agir mǝ'rǝmɓoarne mǝnana à gilǝkicea ka, sǝ à o a ɓembe. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />À kya kum tali ka à gǝshini a kun ɓembe. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Sǝ lang à kútí ka, à kum lú Mǝtalabangŋo Yesu ɗàng. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />À ndaban ndali nǝ mǝnia yì gìr ka, kara aɓwana ɓari nǝ agir-nggūrǝu mǝnana à kǝ tà'nzama pǝlilip ka, à came a bania. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Nǝ ɓangciu a rǝia amamǝna man ti múrià a nzali. Sǝ aɓwana mǝno nea wia ama, &lt;&lt;Ace mana sǝ wu kǝ alta ɓwa mǝnana nǝ yilǝmu ka aɓalǝ alú? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18:31-33</ref></char>.</note> Pa kani ɗang, longŋǝna! Wu ɗenyi nǝ cau mǝnana bangga wun yì mana nda a Galili ka <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />ama, &lt;À nǝ̀ pà Muna mala Ɓwa a bu amǝ'cauɓikea, à nǝ̀ gbàllì a nggun, sǝ a tàruià nongŋo ka nǝ̀ lo nǝ yilǝmu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Pǝlǝa ɓalǝ amamǝna man kasǝa arǝ acau male.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Lang à nyàrǝ́nì ɓembe ɓa-tali ka, à kya ne alaggana mana lum-nong-mwashat ka andǝ acili amǝkpate kat. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />A Maryamu Ɓwa Magdala, andǝ Joana, andǝ Maryamu nggea Jemis, andǝ aɓea amamǝna, à nda à yì banggi amǝ'mishan male cê ka. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Sǝ yia ka à earnǝ cau mala amamǝne ɗàng, a bania ka cau mǝɓane na à banggi ka. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Sǝ Bitǝrus ka lo ɓangŋa aban ká ɓembe; kya kū`ndǝó sǝ kǝ anggurbyau múr lú nda sǝn aban nongŋo ka. Pǝlǝa nyare aban o kǝ ndali nǝ gir mǝnana kumban ngga.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lǝmdǝ rǝì amur <optbreak /> njargula ká Imawus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Markus 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Àkǝ̀ pwari mǝno ka aɓwana ɓari atà amǝkpata Yesu puro aban ká a muna-là mǝnana à tunǝki ama Imawus, mana nre andǝ Urǝshalima ka mel tongno nong-ɓari na ka. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />À ndarǝ naki acau amur gir mǝnana kumban ngga. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Lang à nda aɓa naki acau andǝ ɗiki rǝarǝia amur amǝnia yì agir ka, Yesu nǝ nggearǝì ka yiu bwal teà sǝ kǝ gya andǝia aban ká. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />À sǝni, sǝ ko à gandǝ súrǝè ɗàng.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Pǝlǝa Yesu ɗia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mana gir nì nda wu nakiyia, nǝ pǝlǝki ce arǝ wun aban ká ɗe?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">À go kusǝia à cam più, ɓamǝsǝia kìɗìkì. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ɓwa mwashat aɓalǝia, lùllǝì ama Kǝliyopas, ɗì ama, &lt;&lt;A nda kǝ bǝri nǝmurǝo a Urǝshalima mǝnana a sǝlǝce agir mǝnana à kumban aɓalǝ anonggio mǝnia ka ɗang?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Pǝlǝa ɗia ma, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;A ya gìr nani?&gt;&gt;</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">À eari wi ama, &lt;&lt;Agir mǝnana à kum Yesu Ɓwa Nazarat. Yì ka, mǝɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli na, sǝ ndanǝ rǝcandǝa aɓa cau andǝ túró a ɓadǝm Ɓakuli andǝ ɓwapǝndǝa kat. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Agbani pǝris andǝ amurǝma ma'sǝm ramte ama ɓǝà kya kasǝi wi ɓashi lú, pǝlǝa à gbàllì a nggun. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Sǝm ndanǝ tsǝkɓalǝu ama nda ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ yia amsǝ amǝ Isǝrayila ka! Ɗǝm ngga tàruià nongŋo ndya yalung mǝnana mǝnia yì agir kumban ngga. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Nyar ɗǝm ngga, aɓea amamǝna aɓalǝ sǝm yi na sǝm cau ndali. Yalung nǝ dǝmbari ka à wari a ɓembe, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />sǝ à kya kum luí ɗàng. À nyare à yì na sǝm ama à sǝn causǝna mala amǝturonjar, mǝnana à bang ama ndanǝ yilǝmu ka. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Sǝ aɓea aɓwana aɓalǝ sǝm wari a ɓembe à kya kum gìr nî anggo kǝla mǝnana amamǝna na ka, sǝ yì ka, à sǝni ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Pǝlǝa Yesu nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu gǝmi fat, sǝ ɓamur wun dǝmbǝri arǝ bwalta acau mǝnana kat amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli na ka!</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" /><char style="wj">Wu sǝlǝ mbo ama dumǝna púp Kǝrǝsti ka nǝ̀ nu tanni nǝ̀ amǝnia yì agir ka, sǝ nǝ̀ kutio aɓa gulo male?&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Pǝlǝa tite nǝ Nggurcau mala Musa andǝ Kànìgìr mala amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli kat, bǝlkia wia ɓalǝ acau mǝnana à gilǝia aɓalǝ Amalǝmce amurí ka.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Lang à gbàshìnà ban muna-là mǝnana à kǝ ká kàm ngga, Yesu pa kǝla nǝ̀ kutio a dǝmba, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />sǝ à ne wi ama, &lt;&lt;Nongŋo a ban sǝm, pwari kpana, sǝ dù malanǝ̀ pǝndǝa.&gt;&gt; Pǝlǝa o ateà.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />À yì dumǝna amur girlina ka, yi twal bǝredi, pàkkî Ɓakuli yàwá, sǝ ɓwani pea wia. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Anggo ka, kara mǝsǝia mǝnna sǝ à sǝlǝ ama yì na, kara ndǝrmi a rǝia. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Sǝ à ɗì rǝarǝia ama, &lt;&lt;Ashe pa ɓà sǝ ɓabum sǝm kǝ pi mǝnana nda ban na sǝm acau a tanjargula, sǝ kǝ bǝlkia sǝm ɓalǝ Amalǝmce mala Ɓakuli ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Pǝlǝa à lo à nyare a kusǝia aban ká Urǝshalima. À kya kum alaggana male mana lum nong-mwashat ka andǝ acilia à dapina a banɓwáná, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />aban na ama, &lt;&lt;Mǝsǝcau na! Mǝtalabangŋo longŋǝni ɓembe nǝ yilǝmu, yi pusǝrǝi a ban Shiman Bitǝrus!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Amǝnia ɓari ka à na ce gìr mǝnana kumia a njargula Imawus ka, andǝ súrǝó mǝnana à yì súrǝ̀ Yesu anzǝm mana ɓwanǝna bǝredi ka.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pusǝrǝi a ban alaggana male</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matiu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Markus 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Amǝ Mishan 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Kúnià malaká pwal arǝ acau mǝnana à nakiyi ka ɗàng, kara Yesu pusǝrǝi aɓalǝia, sǝ nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ rǝ wun pwalo!&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />À ndali, ɓangciu pakkia wia, à twali kǝla lú na à sǝn ngga. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Palang sǝ ɓangciu bwal wun anggo, sǝ wu do nǝ tuti a ɗenyicau ma'wun?</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" /><char style="wj">Wu sǝn abuam andǝ akusǝam, mǝ nda nǝ ɓamúràm! Wu jem, sǝ wu sǝni, acemǝnana lú pànǝ́ nyama andǝ amú kǝla mǝnana wu sǝni mǝ ndanǝia ka ɗàng.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Lang nania wia anggo ka, pǝlǝa lǝmdǝia wia abui andǝ akusǝi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Sǝ à nda più aɓa ɗwanyi earnǝ cau a ɓabumia, atàcau mala bumpwasǝa andǝ ndali ka, Yesu pǝlǝa ɗia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Wu ndanǝ kǝ girlina kani le?&gt;&gt;</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />À twal nji mǝtwane à pe wi. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Pǝlǝa é sǝ she, àkǝ̀ mǝsǝia.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Pǝlǝa nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda cau mǝnana ǝn bangga wun, mana sǝm nda a tarǝ sǝm ngga. Koya gìr mǝnana à gilǝì a muram aɓa Nggurcau mala Musa andǝ amalǝmce mala Amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli andǝ Anggyal ka, dumǝna púp à nǝ̀ lùmsǝo.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Pǝlǝa mǝn ɗenyicau malea ace mǝnana ɓǝà súrǝ̀ Amalǝmce mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Nyare nea wia ama, <char style="wj">&lt;&lt;Mǝnia ka nda gìr mǝnana à gilǝ ka: Kǝrǝsti Mǝ'amsǝban, nǝ̀ nu tanni, nǝ̀ wu, sǝ nǝ̀ loapi ɓembe nǝ yilǝmu, a tàruià pwari.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" /><char style="wj">Sǝ cau mala pwanzali a mala vwaki bu arǝ cauɓikea, andǝ twalban cauɓikea ka, à nǝ̀ hamnǝi aɓa lùllǝì, arǝ anzali kat, à nǝ̀ tite a Urǝshalima.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" /><char style="wj">Wun nda ka amǝ'nakún mala mǝnia yì agir ka a ban aɓwana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><char style="wj">Ado ka, mǝ nǝ tasǝa wun Bangŋo Mǝfele mǝnana Tárrám bang ama nǝ̀ pà wun ngga. Sǝama wun nǝ̀ kúndǝô a Urǝshalima, she ɓǝ̀ rǝcandǝa mǝnana pur nǝ kuli sulǝna amur wun ngga.&gt;&gt;</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Atúró 1:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">À twal Yesu aban ká kùli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Markus 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Amǝ Mishan 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Pǝlǝa puro andǝia à kya bwal Betani. Loasǝ buì a kùli sǝ tsǝkia wia bù. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Nda rǝ tsǝkia wia bù ka, kara nyia, pǝlǝa à twali aban ká a kùli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Atúró 1:9-11</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />À peri a baní, sǝ à nyare aban ká a Urǝshalima nǝ bumpwasǝa kǝ̀rkǝ́r. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Koya pwari ka à kǝ wari aɓa Ndàmǝgule mala Ɓakuli, à kǝ mal pwari malea kàm aban ɓwangsǝki Ɓakuli.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>